hadiths[679]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Ameerul Momineen Abu Hafs Umar bin Khattab bin Nufail bin Abdul Uzza bin Riyaah bin Qart bin Razaah bin Adi bin Loayy bin Ghaalib Qarshi Adwi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak aamaal niyaton key sath hain, aur beshak har aadmi key liye wahi hai jo us ne niyat ki. Phir jiski hijrat Allah aur uskey Rasool ki taraf ho to uski hijrat Allah aur uskey Rasool ki taraf hai. Aur jiski hijrat duniya key liye ho jo wo paeyga, ya aurat key liye ho jis se wo nikaah karega, to uski hijrat uski taraf hai jiski taraf us ne hijrat ki. (Iskey sahih honay par ittefaaq hai. Isey do imamon ne riwayat kya hai: Abu Abdullah Muhammad bin Ismaeel bin Ibrahim bin Al-Mugheera bin Bardizbah Joafi Bukhari, Abu Al-Husain Muslim bin Al-Hajjaaj bin Muslim Qushairi Naisapoori (Raziallahu anhuma), apni donon Sahih mein jo tasneef karda kitaabon mein sab se sahih hain)."
"2","Ummul Momineen Umm Abdullah Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik lashkar Kaaba par hamla karega. Phir jab wo zameen key khuley maidaan mein hongey to unkey awwal aur aakhir ko dhansa diya jaeyga. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Unkey awwal aur aakhir ko kaisey dhansa diya jaeyga jabke un mein unkey baazaar waley aur jo un mein se nahi hain hongey!? Aap ne farmaya: Unkey awwal aur aakhir ko dhansa diya jaeyga, phir wo apni niyaton par uthaey jaengey. (Muttafaqun aleh. Ye Bukhari ka lafz hai)."
"3","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fatah key baad hijrat nahi hai, lekin jihad aur niyat hai. Aur jab tumhey nikalney key liye kaha jaey to niklo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"4","Abu Abdullah Jabir bin Abdullah Ansaari (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwey mein they. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Madina mein kuchh aadmi hain, tum ne koi safar nahi kya aur na koi waadi tey ki magar wo tumharey sath they, unhey beemari ne rok diya. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Magar wo ajr mein tumharey shareek huey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur ise Bukhari ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Ghazwa Tabook se wapas aey. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Madina mein hamarey peechey kuchh qaumein hain, ham ne koi ghaati aur na waadi tey ki magar wo hamarey sath hain, unhey uzr ne rok diya."
"5","Abu Yazeed Maan bin Yazeed bin Al-Akhnas (Raziallahu anhum), jabke wo aur unkey waalid aur dada sahaabi hain, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey waalid Yazeed ne deenaar nikaaley taake unhey sadqa karein. To unhey masjid mein aik aadmi key paas rakha. To main aaya aur unhey liya aur unkey paas unhey ley kar aaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne tumhara irada nahi kya tha. To main ne un se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jhagda kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumharey liye wo hai jo tum ne niyat ki ae Yazeed, aur tumharey liye wo hai jo tum ne liya ae Maan. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"6","Abu Ishaaq Saad bin Abi Waqqas Maalik bin Uhaib bin Abd Manaaf bin Zuhra bin Kilaab bin Murra bin Kaab bin Loayy Qarshi Zuhri (Raziallahu anhu), jo Jannat ki bashaarat paaney waley das mein se aik hain (Raziallahu anhum), se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hajjatul Wada key saal us dard mein meri ayadat key liye tashreef laey jo mujhey shadeed tha. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mujhey dard ne pahunchaya hai jo tum dekhtey ho, aur main maal wala hun aur meri aik beti key siwa koi waaris nahi hai. To kya main apne maal mein se do tihaai sadqa kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Main ne kaha: To aadha ya Rasulullah? To farmaya: Nahi. Main ne kaha: To tihaai ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Tihaai, aur tihaai bahut hai, ya bada hai. Beshak tum apne waarison ko maaldaar chhoro ye behtar hai ke tum unhey mohtaaj chhoro jo logon se maangtey phirein. Aur beshak tum jo kharch karogey jis se Allah ka chehra chaahtey ho to us par tumhey ajr diya jaeyga, yahan tak ke jo tum apni biwi key munh mein rakhtey ho. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main apne sahaaba key peechey chhora jaaunga? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum peechey nahi chhorey jaogey aur aisa amal karogey jis se Allah ka chehra chaahtey ho magar us se darja aur bulandi mein badhogey. Aur shayed tum peechey chhorey jao yahan tak ke tum se qaumein faeda uthaein aur doosri tum se nuqsaan uthaein. Ae Allah! Merey sahaaba ki hijrat poori farma, aur unhey unki aidiyon par wapas na kar. Lekin bechaara Saad bin Khaula. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us par rehem farmatey hain ke wo Makkah mein faut hua. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"7","Abu Hurairah Abdur Rahman bin Sakhr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumharey jismon ki taraf nahi dekhta, aur na tumhari sooraton ki taraf. Lekin tumharey dilon aur tumharey aamaal ki taraf dekhta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"8","Abu Musa Abdullah bin Qais Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us aadmi key baarey mein poochha gaya jo bahaduri key liye qitaal karta hai, aur qaum key liye qitaal karta hai, aur dikhaawey key liye qitaal karta hai. Un mein se kaun sa Allah key raastey mein hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo isliye qitaal karey taake Allah ka kalima buland ho to wo Allah key raastey mein hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"9","Abu Bakra Nufai bin Al-Haaris Saqafi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab do Musalman apni talwaaron key sath milein to qaatil aur maqtool dozakh mein hain. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye to qaatil hai, phir maqtool ka kya haal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo apne saathi ko qatl karne ka harees tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"10","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ki jamaat mein namaz uski bazaar aur ghar mein namaz se bees se kuchh oopar darjaat zyada hai. Aur wo isliye ke tum mein se jab koi wuzu karta hai aur achchha wuzu karta hai, phir masjid aata hai jabke wo namaz key siwa kuchh nahi chaahta, usey namaz key siwa kuchh nahi ubhaarta. Wo koi qadam nahi uthata magar uskey sabab uskey liye darja buland kya jaata hai, aur us se khata mitaai jaati hai, yahan tak ke masjid mein dakhil ho. Phir jab masjid mein dakhil ho to wo namaz mein hai jab tak namaz usey rok kar rakhey. Aur farishtey tum mein se har aik par rehmat bhejtey hain jab tak wo apni majlis mein hai jis mein us ne namaz padhi hai, jab tak wo behayaai na karey. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai). Aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaul yanhazuhu ya aur ha key fatha aur za key sath hai, yaani usey nikaalta hai aur uthaata hai."
"11","Abul Abbas Abdullah bin Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, us mein jo wo apne Rab Tabaarak wa Taala se riwayat kartey hain, riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne nekiyan aur buraiyan likhein, phir usey bayaan kya: Phir jo neki ka irada karey aur usey na karey to Allah Tabaarak wa Taala uskey paas usey kaamil neki likhta hai. Aur agar uska irada karey aur usey karey to Allah usey das nekiyan likhta hai saat sau guna tak aur bahut guna tak. Aur agar burai ka irada karey aur usey na karey to Allah uskey paas usey kaamil neki likhta hai. Aur agar uska irada karey aur usey karey to Allah usey aik burai likhta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"12","Abu Abdur Rahman Abdullah bin Umar bin Al-Khattab (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum se pehley teen aadmi chaley yahan tak ke unhey raat ne ghaar mein panah di aur wo us mein dakhil huey. To pahaad se chataan giri aur un par ghaar band kar diya. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey is chataan se sirf ye nijaat dega ke tum Allah se apne naik aamaal key sath dua karo. Un mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey boodhey badey walidain they, aur main un se pehley ghar walon aur maal ko shaam ka doodh nahi pilaata tha. To aik din darakht ki talaash ne mujhey door kar diya aur main un par shaam ko wapas na aaya yahan tak ke wo so gaey. To main ne un donon key liye unka shaam ka doodh doha aur unhey soya hua paaya. To main ne unhey jagaana napasand kya aur un se pehley ghar walon ya maal ko shaam ka doodh pilaana napasand kya. To main thehra raha, jabke pyaala merey haath par tha, unkey bedaar honay ka intizaar karta raha yahan tak ke Fajr chamki aur bachchey merey qadmon key paas ro rahey they. To wo bedaar huey aur apna shaam ka doodh piya. Ae Allah! Agar main ne ye Terey chehrey ki talab mein kya tha to ham se kushadgi farma jo ham is chataan mein hain. To wo kuchh khul gai ke wo us mein se nikal nahi saktey they. Doosrey ne kaha: Ae Allah! Meri chacha zaad behan thi jo logon mein mujhey sab se zyada mehboob thi. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Main us se mohabbat karta tha jaisi mard aurton se shadeed mohabbat kartey hain. To main ne usey apne nafs par chaaha aur us ne mujh se inkaar kya yahan tak ke usey saalon mein se aik saal mein sakhti pahunchi. To wo merey paas aai aur main ne usey aik sau bees deenaar diye is par ke wo merey aur apne nafs key darmiyaan khula chhor dey. To us ne kya. Yahan tak ke jab main us par qaadir hua, aur aik riwayat mein hai: Phir jab main uskey donon paaon key darmiyaan baitha, us ne kaha: Allah se daro aur mohar ko haq key siwa na todo! To main us se door hata jabke wo logon mein mujhey sab se zyada mehboob thi, aur jo sona main ne usey diya tha chhor diya. Ae Allah! Agar main ne ye Terey chehrey ki talab mein kya tha to ham se kushadgi farma jo ham is mein hain. To chataan khul gai. Magar wo us mein se nikal nahi saktey they. Teesrey ne kaha: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne mazdooron ko ujrat par rakha aur unhey unki ujrat di siwaey aik aadmi key jis ne apni ujrat chhor di aur chala gaya. To main ne uski ujrat ko badhaya yahan tak ke us mein se bahut maal ho gaya. To wo merey paas baad mein aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah key bandey! Meri ujrat dey. To main ne kaha: Tum jo oont aur gaay aur bakri aur ghulaam dekhtey ho wo tumhari ujrat mein se hai. Us ne kaha: Ae Allah key bandey! Mujh se mazaak na karo! To main ne kaha: Beshak main tum se mazaak nahi karta. To us ne usey liya aur haank ley gaya aur us mein se kuchh na chhora. Ae Allah! Agar main ne ye Terey chehrey ki talab mein kya tha to ham se kushadgi farma jo ham is mein hain. To chataan khul gai aur wo nikley aur chaley gaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"13","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun aur din mein sattar martaba se zyada uski taraf tauba karta hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"14","Agharr bin Yasaar Muzani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logon! Allah se tauba karo aur us se maghfirat maango, kyonke main din mein sau martaba tauba karta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"15","Abu Hamza Anas bin Maalik Ansaari jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key khaadim hain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah apne bandey ki tauba se tum mein se uskey oont par girney se zyada khush hota hai jo us se jungle mein gum ho gaya ho. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Allah apne bandey ki tauba par jab wo uski taraf tauba karta hai, tum mein se uskey sawari par honay se zyada shadeed khush hota hai jo jungle mein apni sawari par tha. To wo us se nikal gai jabke us par uska khaana aur peena tha. To wo us se naumeed hua. To wo darakht key paas aaya aur uskey saaey mein late gaya, jabke wo apni sawari se naumeed ho chuka tha. Isi haal mein wo uskey paas khadi hai. To us ne uski lagaam pakdi, phir khushi ki shiddat se kaha: Ae Allah! Tu mera banda hai aur main tera Rab hun. Us ne khushi ki shiddat se ghalti ki."
"16","Abu Musa Abdullah bin Qais Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala raat mein apna haath pheelata hai taake din ka bura tauba karey, aur din mein apna haath pheelata hai taake raat ka bura tauba karey, yahan tak ke suraj maghrib se tuloo ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"17","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo suraj key maghrib se tuloo honay se pehley tauba karey to Allah us par tauba qabool farmayega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"18","Abu Abdur Rahman Abdullah bin Umar bin Al-Khattab (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jall bandey ki tauba qabool farmata hai jab tak halaq mein jaan na aey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"19","Zirr bin Hubaish se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Safwaan bin Assaal (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aaya taake un se mozon par masah key baarey mein poochhun. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey ae Zirr kya laaya hai? To main ne kaha: Ilm ki talab. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak farishtey taalibe-ilm key liye apne par bichha detey hain us se khush hokar jo wo talab karta hai. To main ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se main tumharey paas aaya hun taake tum se poochhun: Kya tum ne usey us baarey mein kuchh zikr kartey huey suna hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, wo hamein hukm detey they ke jab ham safar mein hon, ya musaafir hon, to apne mozon ko teen din aur unki raaton mein na utaarein siwaey janaabat key, lekin pakhaana aur peshaab aur neend se. To main ne kaha: Safar. Phir ham unkey paas they ke unhey dehaati ne buland awaz se pukaara: Ae Muhammad! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey uski awaz jaisi awaz se jawab diya: Haan. To main ne us se kaha: Tum par afsos! Apni awaz past karo, kyonke tum Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas ho, aur tumhey is se mana kya gaya hai! To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main past nahi karunga. Dehaati ne kaha: Aadmi qaum se mohabbat karta hai jabke wo un se nahi mila? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi qayamat key din uskey sath hoga jis se wo mohabbat karta hai. To wo hamein hadis bayan karta raha yahan tak ke us ne maghrib ki taraf aik darwaaza zikr kya jiski chaudai ka faasla ya sawaar uski chaudai mein chaalees ya sattar saal chaley. Sufyan jo aik rawi hain, ne kaha: Shaam key saamney, Allah Taala ne usey aasmaanon aur zameen ko paida karney key din paida kya tha, tauba key liye khula hua hai jo band nahi hota yahan tak ke suraj us se tuloo ho. Ise Tirmizi waghera ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"20","Abu Saeed Saad bin Maalik bin Sinaan Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehley jo they un mein aik aadmi tha jis ne ninyanbey jaanein qatl kein. To us ne zameen key sab se aalim key baarey mein poochha. To usey raahib ki taraf rahnumai ki gai. To wo uskey paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Us ne ninyanbey jaanein qatl kein hain. To kya uskey liye tauba hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To us ne usey qatl kar diya aur us se sau poorey kiye. Phir zameen key sab se aalim key baarey mein poochha. To usey aalim aadmi ki taraf rahnumai ki gai. To us ne kaha: Us ne sau jaanein qatl kein hain. To kya uskey liye tauba hai? Us ne kaha: Haan, aur uskey aur tauba key darmiyaan kaun haail ho sakta hai? Fulaan fulaan zameen ki taraf jao. Kyonke wahaan log hain jo Allah Taala ki ibaadat kartey hain. To Allah ki ibaadat unkey sath karo, aur apni zameen ki taraf wapas na aao kyonke wo buri zameen hai. To wo gaya yahan tak ke jab aadha raasta hua to usey maut aai. To uskey baarey mein rehmat key farishtey aur azaab key farishtey jhagdey. Rehmat key farishtey ne kaha: Wo tauba karke apne dil key sath Allah Taala ki taraf mutawajjah hokar aaya hai. Aur azaab key farishtey ne kaha: Us ne kabhi bhalai nahi ki. To unkey paas aadmi ki soorat mein farishta aaya aur unhon-ne usey apne darmiyaan, yaani faisla karne wala, banaya. To us ne kaha: Donon zameenon key darmiyaan naapo. Phir jiski taraf wo qareeb ho wo usi ka hai. To unhon-ne naapa aur usey us zameen key qareeb paaya jiska us ne irada kya tha. To rehmat key farishton ne usey qabz kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"21","Abdullah bin Kaab bin Maalik, jo Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) key betey mein se unkey andhey honay key waqt unkey qaayid they, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) ko unki hadis bayan kartey huey suna jab wo Ghazwa Tabook mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se peechey rahey. Kaab ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kisi ghazwey mein peechey nahi raha jo Aap ne kya siwaey Ghazwa Tabook key, lekin main Ghazwa Badr mein peechey raha tha, aur Aap se peechey rehne waley mein se kisi ko malaamat nahi ki gai. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Musalman nikley they Quraish key qafiley ka irada karke yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne unhey aur unkey dushman ko baghair waadey key jama kar diya. Aur beshak main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Lailatul Aqaba mein haazir tha jab ham ne Islam par ahd kya tha. Aur mujhey pasand nahi ke uskey badley merey paas Badr ki haaziri ho, chaahey Badr logon mein us se zyada mashhoor hai. Aur meri khabar jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Ghazwa Tabook mein peechey raha ye thi ke main us ghazwey mein kabhi itna taqatwar aur aasaan nahi tha jitna main us mein peechey raha tha jis mein Aap se peechey raha. Allah ki qasam! Main ne us se pehley do sawariyan kabhi jama nahi kein yahan tak ke unhey us ghazwey mein jama kya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi ghazwey ka irada nahi farmatey they magar us se ghair ki taraf ishara farmatey they, yahan tak ke wo ghazwa tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ghazwey mein sakht garmi mein ghazwa kya, aur door safar ka aur jungle ka aur badi tadaad ka saamna kya. To Aap ne Musalmanon key liye unka muamla khol diya taake wo apne ghazwey ki taiyaari karein. To Aap ne unhey unki jihat khabar di jiska Aap irada rakhtey they. Aur Musalman Rasulullah key sath bahut they aur unhey hifaazat karne wali kitaab jama nahi karti thi, us se deewaan ka irada hai. Kaab ne kaha: To jo aadmi ghaaib honay ka irada karta tha wo kam tha magar wo gumaan karta tha ke wo us se chhupega jab tak uskey baarey mein Allah ki taraf se wahi naazil na ho. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ghazwey mein ghazwa kya jab phal aur saaye achchhey ho gaey they. To main unki taraf maa'il tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Musalman Aap key sath taiyaar huey. Aur main subah ko taiyaari key liye nikalta phir baghair kuchh faisla kiye wapas aata aur kehta: Main aaj ya kal taiyaari karunga. To waqt guzarta raha yahan tak ke log taiyaar ho gaey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Musalman Aap key sath rawana huey. Aur main ne taiyaari nahi ki thi. To main subah nikalta aur ghoomta jabke merey paas sawari nahi thi jis par main unhey paaun. Aur ye haal raha yahan tak ke wo tez chaley gaey aur ghazwa aagey badh gaya. Aur main ne chaaha ke rawana hun aur unhey paaun. Kaash main ne kya hota! To wo merey liye muqaddar nahi tha. Phir jab main logon mein niklta to mujhey ghumgeen karta ke main sirf usey dekhta jis par nifaaq ki tohmat thi, ya kamzoron mein se kamzor aadmi jinhey Allah ne maaf kar diya tha. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera zikr nahi farmaya yahan tak ke Tabook pahunchy. To Aap ne farmaya jabke Aap Tabook mein majlis mein they: Kaab bin Maalik ne kya kya? To Bani Salama mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Usey uski chaadar aur apne pehluon mein dekhna ne rok diya hai. To Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha: Tum ne buri baat kahi! Allah ki qasam ya Rasulullah! Ham ne us par bhalai key siwa kuchh nahi jaana. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh rahey. Kaab ne kaha: Phir jab mujhey pahunchi ke Aap wapas aaney ki taraf mutawajjah huey hain to mujhey fikr ne liya aur main jhoot yaad karne laga aur kehta tha: Main Aap key ghussey se kis tarah niklunga? Aur is mein apne ghar walon mein se samajh waley se madad li. Phir jab kaha gaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qareeb aa gaey hain to mujh se baatil zaaya ho gaya aur main ne pehchaan liya ke main Aap se kisi chiz key sath nijaat nahi paaunga jis mein jhoot ho. To main ne sach ka azm kya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah tashreef laey, jabke Aap jab safar se aatey they to masjid se shuru farmatey they. To Aap ne us mein do rakaatein padhein phir logon key liye baithey. Phir jab Aap ne peechey rehne walon key liye ye kya to wo Aap key paas aey aur Aap se maafi maangney lagey aur Aap key liye qasmein khaane lagey. Aur wo assi se kuchh oopar aadmi they. To Aap ne unka zaahir qabool farmaya aur un se baiyat ki aur unkey liye maghfirat maangi aur unkey baatin ko Allah key supurd kya. Yahan tak ke main aaya. Phir jab main ne Aap ko salaam kya to Aap naraaz hansey ki hansi hansey. Phir farmaya: Aao. To main aaya aur Aap key saamney baitha. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhey kis ne peechey rakha? Kya tum ne apne liye sawari nahi khareedi thi? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ki qasam! Agar main tumharey siwa duniya walon mein se kisi key paas baitha hota to dekhta ke main uskey ghussey se uzr key sath niklunga. Beshak mujhey jhagdey ki salahiyat di gai hai. Lekin Allah ki qasam! Beshak main ne jaan liya hai ke agar main aaj tum se jhoota qaul kahun jis se tum mujh se raazi ho jao to anqareeb Allah tumhey mujh par naraaz farmayega. Aur agar main tum se sachcha qaul kahun to tum mujh par naraaz hogey jabke mujh mein hai ke Allah us mein aafiyat dey. Allah ki qasam! Merey paas koi uzr nahi tha. Allah ki qasam! Main kabhi itna taqatwar aur aasaan nahi tha jitna main tha jab main tum se peechey raha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raha ye, to us ne sach kaha hai. Isliye utho yahan tak ke Allah tumharey baarey mein faisla farmaye. To main utha aur Bani Salama key aadmi merey peechey daudtey huey aey aur mujh se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ham ne tumhey is se pehley gunaah kartey huey nahi dekha! Kya tum is se aajiz they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un uzron mein se kisi uzr key sath maafi maangtey jo peechey rehne walon ne maangi? Beshak tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka tumharey liye maghfirat maangna kaafi hota. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Wo mujhey malaamat kartey rahey yahan tak ke main ne irada kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf wapas jaun aur apne aap ko jhutlaaun. Phir main ne un se kaha: Kya merey sath is mein koi aur mubtala hua hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, tumharey sath do aadmi mubtala huey hain. Unhon-ne waisa kaha jaisa tum ne kaha aur un donon se waisa kaha gaya jaisa tum se kaha gaya. Main ne kaha: Wo kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Muraara bin Ar-Rabee Amri, aur Hilaal bin Umayya Waaqifi. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne merey liye do naik aadmiyon ka zikr kya jinhon-ne Badr mein haaziri di thi jin mein uswa hai. To main chala jab unhon-ne un donon ka naam liya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Musalmanon ko ham se kalaam karne se mana farmaya, ham teenon mein se peechey rehne walon mein. To log ham se bachtey they, ya farmaya: Hamarey liye badal gaey, yahan tak ke zameen mujh par tang ho gai, aur wo wo nahi rahi jo main jaanta tha. Aur ham is haal mein pachaas raatein rahey. Raha merey donon saathi, to wo isteqna kartey they aur apne gharon mein baith-ney rahey aur rotey rahey. Aur raha main, to main un mein sab se jawaan aur mazboot tha. To main nikalta tha aur logon key sath namaz padhta tha, aur bazaaron mein ghoomta tha, jabke koi mujh se kalaam nahi karta tha. Aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aata tha aur Aap ko salaam karta tha jabke wo apni majlis mein namaz key baad they. To main kehta tha: Kya Aap ne mujhey salaam ka jawab dene key liye apne honton ko harkat di ya nahi? Phir Aap key qareeb namaz padhta tha aur chori chhupey Aap ko dekhta tha. Phir jab main namaz ki taraf mutawajjah hota to Aap meri taraf mutawajjah hotey. Aur jab main Aap ki taraf mutawajjah hota to Aap mujh se munh pher letey. Yahan tak ke jab Musalmanon ki sakhti mujh par lambi hui to main chala yahan tak ke Abu Qatada key baagh ki deewaar par chadha, jabke wo mera chacha zaad bhai tha aur mujhey sab se mehboob tha. To main ne usey salaam kya. Allah ki qasam! Us ne mujhey salaam ka jawab nahi diya. To main ne us se kaha: Ae Abu Qatada! Main tumhey Allah ki qasam deta hun: Kya tum jaantey ho ke main Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat karta hun? To wo khamosh raha. To main ne usey qasam di aur wo khamosh raha. To main ne usey qasam di aur us ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. To meri aankhein beh padhein aur main wapas aaya aur deewaar par chadha. Unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba main Madina key bazaar mein chal raha tha ke Nabt mein se Shaam key khaaney walon mein se aik Nabaati aaya jo taa'aam baichta tha aur kehta tha: Kaun mujhey Kaab bin Maalik ki rahnumai karega? To log uski taraf ishara karne lagey yahan tak ke wo merey paas aaya aur mujhey Ghassaan key baadshah ka khat diya. To jab main kaatib tha to wo padha. To achanak us mein hai: Hamd key baad, mujhey pahunchi hai ke tumhara saathi tum se judaa ho gaya hai. Aur Allah ne tumhey zillat aur zaaya honay ki jagah mein nahi rakha. Isliye ham se mil jao, ham tum se hamdardi kareingey. To main ne kaha jab usey padha: Aur ye bhi aazmaaish mein se hai. To usey tandoor mein jhonk diya aur jala diya. Yahan tak ke jab pachaas mein se chaalees guzar gaein aur wahi naazil hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaasid merey paas aaya aur farmaya: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey hukm detey hain ke tum apni biwi se alag hojao. To main ne kaha: Usey talaaq dun ya kya karun? Us ne kaha: Nahi, balke us se alag hojao aur uskey qareeb na jao. Aur apne donon saathiyon ki taraf isi tarah bheja. To main ne apni biwi se kaha: Apne ghar walon se mil jao aur unkey paas raho yahan tak ke Allah is muamley mein faisla farmaye. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Hilaal bin Umayya ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Hilaal bin Umayya boodha hai jo zaaya ho gaya hai aur uska khaadim nahi hai. To kya tum napasand kartey ho ke main uski khidmat karun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, lekin wo tumharey qareeb na aey. Unhon-ne kaha: Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Us mein kisi chiz ki taraf harkat nahi hai. Allah ki qasam! Wo jab se uska ye muamla hua hai rota raha hai. To merey ghar walon mein se baaz ne mujh se kaha: Kaash tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni biwi key baarey mein ijazat maangtey jaisa Hilaal bin Umayya ki biwi ko ijazat di gai hai ke wo uski khidmat karey? To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein ijazat nahi maangunga. Aur main nahi jaanta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kya farmayengey jab main uskey baarey mein ijazat maangun, jabke main jawaan aadmi hun. To main is par das raatein raha yahan tak ke pachaas raatein us waqt se poori huein jab kalaam se mana kya gaya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir main ne Fajr ki namaz pachaaswein subah apne ghar ki chhat par padhi. Aik haal mein ke main baitha tha us haal mein jis ka Allah ne hamarey baarey mein zikr kya hai: Meri jaan mujh par tang ho gai thi aur zameen apni kushadgi key bawajood mujh par tang ho gai thi. To main ne pukaarne waley ki awaz suni: Ae Kaab bin Maalik! Khush ho jao! To main sajdey mein giR gaya aur main ne pehchaan liya ke faraakh aa gai hai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki taraf se hamari tauba ki qabooliyat ki khabar di thi jab Aap ne Fajr ki namaz padhi thi. To log bashaarat dene key liye gaey aur hamarey donon saathiyon ki taraf bashaarat dene waley gaey. Aur aik aadmi meri taraf ghoda dauda kar gaya, aur Aslam mein se aik dauda aur pahaad par chadha, jabke awaz tez thi. Phir jab wo awaz aai jiski awaz main ne suni thi wo merey paas bashaarat dene aaya to main ne apne donon kapdey utaarey aur usey bashaarat key badley pehna diye. Allah ki qasam! Merey paas us din uskey siwa aur nahi they, aur udhaar kapdey liye aur pehney. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jaaney ka irada kya. To log giroh giroh mujh se miley aur tauba ki mubaarakbaad detey they aur kehtey they: Tumhey mubaarak ho Allah ki taraf se tumhari tauba ki qabooliyat! Unhon-ne kaha: Yahan tak ke masjid mein dakhil hua aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon key gird baithey huey they. To Talha bin Ubaidullah khada hua aur dauda yahan tak ke mujh se musafaha kya aur mubaarakbaad di. Allah ki qasam! Muhaajireen mein se uskey siwa koi merey liye khada nahi hua. Unhon-ne kaha: To Kaab Talha ko nahi bhoolta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Kaab ne kaha: Phir jab main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kya to Aap ne farmaya jabke Aap ka chehra khushi se chamak raha tha: Khush ho jao apne behtreen din key sath jo tum par guzra hai jab se tumhey tumhari maa ne jana hai! Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya wo tumhari taraf se hai ya Allah ki taraf se? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke Allah ki taraf se hai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khush hotey to Aap ka chehra roshan hota yahan tak ke goya wo chaand ka tukda hai. Aur ham isey pehchaantey they. Phir jab main Aap key saamney baitha to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri nijaat mein se hai ke main Allah aur uskey Rasool key liye apne maal se nikal jaun sadqa karke. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne maal mein se baaz rok lo, kyonke wo tumharey liye behtar hai. To main ne kaha: Beshak main Khaibar mein jo hissa hai wo rokta hun. Aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ne mujhey sach ki wjah se nijaat di hai. Isliye meri tauba mein se hai ke main jab tak zinda hun sach key siwa na kahun. Allah ki qasam! Main nahi jaanta ke Musalmanon mein se kisi ko Allah ne sachchi baat mein is se behtar aazmaaya hai jo us ne mujhey aazmaaya hai, jab se main ne usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha tha. Allah ki qasam! Jab se main ne usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha tha aaj key din tak main ne jaan boojh kar jhoot ka irada nahi kya. Aur beshak main ummeed rakhta hun ke Allah baqi mein meri hifaazat farmayega. Unhon-ne kaha: To Allah Azza wa Jall ne naazil kya: Beshak Allah ne Nabi par tauba qabool farmai hai, aur muhaajireen aur ansaar par jinhon-ne sakhti key waqt uski pairwi ki, yahan tak ke pahunchy: Aur wo teenon par jinhon-ne peechey rakhey gaey yahan tak ke pahunchy: Ae imaan walon! Allah se daro aur sachey logon key sath hojao, aakhir tak. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Allah ne mujhey apne Islam ki hidayat key baad mujh par kisi naimat mein is se azeem naimat nahi di ke wo sach hai jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha tha ke main jhoot na kahun aur halaak na hun jaisa halaak huey jo jhoot kehtey they. Kyonke Allah ne jhoot kehne walon key baarey mein wahi naazil ki jo us ne sakht kaha tha. Allah Taala ne farmaya: Wo anqareeb tum se Allah ki qasam khaengey jab tum unki taraf wapas aaogey taake tum un se munh pher lo. To un se munh pher lo, beshak wo napak hain aur unka thikana dozakh hai badla iska jo wo kamaatey they. Wo tum se qasam khaengey taake tum un se raazi hojao. Phir agar tum un se raazi hojaogey to beshak Allah nafarmaan qaum se raazi nahi hoga. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ham teenon peechey rakhey gaey they unkey muqabley mein jinki qasam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabool ki thi jab unhon-ne Aap se baiyat ki aur maafi maangi, aur Aap ne un se baiyat ki aur unkey liye maghfirat maangi. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamara muamla muakhkhar kya yahan tak ke Allah ne us mein faisla farmaya. Isliye Allah ne farmaya: Aur wo teenon par jinhon-ne peechey rakhey gaey. Aur peechey rakhney key maana mein hamara peechey rehna nahi hai jo hamarey baarey mein zikr kya gaya hai jab ham ghazwey se peechey rahey aur us mein Aap se peechey rahey. Lekin uskey maana mein hamara peechey rakhna hai aur hamarey muamley ko muakhkhar karna hai unkey muqabley mein jinhon-ne Aap se qasam khai aur Aap se maafi maangi. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Tabook ya Khaibar ki taraf jumeraat key din nikley. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aap safar se chaasht key waqt ke siwa nahi aatey they. Phir jab aatey they to masjid mein jaatey they aur us mein do rakaatein padhtey they, phir wahaan baithetey they."
"22","Abu Nujaid, noon key zamma aur jeem key fatha key sath, Imran bin Al-Husain Khuzaai (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Juhaina ki aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai jabke wo zina se haamila thi. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne hadd waley gunaah ka irtikaab kya hai, isliye mujh par hadd qaim karein. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey sarparast ko bulaya aur farmaya: Iskey sath ahsaan kar. Phir jab wo jan dey to merey paas ley kar aana. To us ne kya. Phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey baarey mein hukm diya to us par kapdey kassey gaey. Phir uskey baarey mein hukm diya to usey rujm kar diya gaya. Phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us par namaz padhi. To Umar ne Aap se kaha: Tum us par namaz padhtey ho ya Rasulullah, jabke us ne zina kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak us ne aisi tauba ki hai ke agar wo Madina walon mein se sattar key darmiyaan taqseem ki jaey to unhey kaafi ho. Aur kya tum ne us se afzal paaya hai ke us ne apni jaan Allah Azza wa Jall key liye di?! Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"23","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar aadmi key betey key paas soney ki waadi ho to wo chaheyga ke uskey paas do waadiyan hon. Aur uska munh matti key siwa kuchh nahi bharegi. Aur Allah us par tauba qabool farmata hai jo tauba karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"24","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Subhanahu wa Taala do aadmiyon par hansta hai jin mein se aik doosrey ko qatl karta hai aur donon Jannat mein dakhil hotey hain: Ye Allah key raastey mein qitaal karta hai aur qatl kya jaata hai. Phir Allah qaatil par tauba qabool farmata hai aur wo Musalman hota hai aur shaheed hota hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"25","Abu Maalik Al-Haaris bin Aasim Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paaki imaan ka aadha hai, aur Alhamdolillah meezaan ko bhar deti hai, aur Subhan Allah aur Alhamdolillah bhar detey hain, ya bharta hai, aasmaanon aur zameen key darmiyaan ko. Aur namaz noor hai, aur sadqa daleel hai, aur sabr roshni hai, aur Quran tumharey liye ya tumharey khilaaf hujjat hai. Har aadmi subah karta hai aur apni jaan baichta hai. Phir ya usey aazaad karta hai, ya halaak karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"26","Abu Saeed Saad bin Maalik bin Sinaan Khudri (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ke Ansaar mein se kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga aur Aap ne unhey diya. Phir unhon-ne maanga aur Aap ne unhey diya, yahan tak ke jo Aap key paas tha khatm ho gaya. To Aap ne un se farmaya jab Aap ne apne haath mein jo kuchh tha kharch kar diya: Jo bhalai merey paas hogi main tum se bacha kar nahi rakhunga. Aur jo paakdaamani ikhtiyaar kareyga Allah usey paakdaaman farmayega. Aur jo be-niyaaz hoga Allah usey be-niyaaz farmayega. Aur jo sabr karega Allah usey saabir farmayega. Aur kisi ko us ata se behtar aur kushada ata nahi di gai jo sabr hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"27","Abu Yahya Suhaib bin Sinaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin key muamley par taajjub hai! Beshak uska saara muamla uskey liye bhalai hai, aur ye kisi key liye nahi hai siwaey momin key: Agar usey khushi pahunchy to shukr karta hai aur wo uskey liye bhalai hoti hai. Aur agar usey takleef pahunchy to sabr karta hai aur wo uskey liye bhalai hoti hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"28","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par sakhti hui to Aap par bechaini taari honay lagi. To Faatima (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha: Haey merey waalid ki bechaini! To farmaya: Tumharey waalid par aaj key baad koi bechaini nahi hai. Phir jab Aap faut ho gaey to unhon-ne kaha: Haey merey waalid! Us Rab ko jawab diya jis ne bulaya. Haey merey waalid! Jannatul Firdaus unka thikana hai. Haey merey waalid! Ham Jibraeel ko khabar detey hain. Phir jab dafan kya gaya to Faatima (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha: Kya tumharey dilon ne chaaha ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par matti daalo? Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"29","Abu Zaid Usaama bin Zaid bin Haarisa jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key aazaad karda ghulaam aur Aap key pyaarey aur Aap key pyaarey key betey hain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti ne bheja: Beshak mera beta marga key qareeb hai, isliye hamarey paas haazir ho. To Aap ne salaam kehla kar bheja aur farmaya: Beshak Allah ka hai jo us ne liya, aur usi ka hai jo us ne diya, aur har chiz uskey paas muqarrar waqte muayyan key sath hai. Isliye sabr karey aur sawaab ki ummeed rakhey. To us ne Aap ki taraf bheja aur Aap par qasam di ke Aap zaroor uskey paas aaein. To Aap khadey huey jabke Aap key sath Saad bin Ubaada, aur Muaz bin Jabal, aur Ubayy bin Kaab, aur Zaid bin Saabit, aur aadmi (Raziallahu anhum) they. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bachcha uthakar laaya gaya aur Aap ne usey apni god mein bithaya jabke uski saans ukhad rahi thi. To Aap ki donon aankhein beh padhein. To Saad ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye kya hai? To farmaya: Ye rehem hai jo Allah Taala ne apne bandon key dilon mein rakha hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Un bandon key dilon mein jo wo chaahta hai. Aur beshak Allah apne bandon mein se rehem karne walon par rehem farmata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"30","Suhaib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehley jo they un mein baadshah tha, aur uska jaadugar tha. Phir jab wo boodha hua to us ne baadshah se kaha: Beshak main boodha ho gaya hun, isliye merey paas ladka bhejo taake main usey jaadu sikhaaun. To us ne uskey paas ladka bheja jo usey sikhaata tha. Aur uskey raastey mein jab wo chalta tha raahib tha. To uskey paas baitha aur uska kalaam suna aur usey achchha laga. Aur wo jab jaadugar key paas aata tha to raahib key paas se guzarta tha aur uskey paas baith-ta tha. Phir jab jaadugar key paas aata to wo usey maarta tha. To us ne uski shikayat raahib se ki. To us ne kaha: Jab tum jaadugar se daro to kaho: Merey ghar walon ne mujhey rok diya. Aur jab tum apne ghar walon se daro to kaho: Mujhey jaadugar ne rok diya. Isi haal mein wo aik badey jaanwar par aaya jis ne logon ko rok diya tha. To us ne kaha: Aaj main jaanunga ke jaadugar afzal hai ya raahib afzal hai? To us ne pathar liya aur kaha: Ae Allah! Agar raahib ka muamla Terey nazdeek jaadugar key muamley se zyada mehboob hai to is jaanwar ko qatl farma taake log guzrein. To usey maara aur qatl kar diya aur log guzar gaey. To raahib key paas aaya aur usey khabar di. To raahib ne us se kaha: Ae merey betey! Tum aaj mujh se afzal ho. Tumhara muamla pahunch gaya hai jo main dekhta hun. Aur beshak tum anqareeb aazmaaish mein mubtala hogey. Phir agar mubtala huey to meri taraf rahnumai na karna. Aur ladka andhey aur kodhi ko achchha karta tha, aur logon ka tamaam beemariyon se ilaaj karta tha. To baadshah ka humnasheen jis ne suna tha jo andha ho gaya tha. To wo uskey paas bahut sey tohfey ley kar aaya aur kaha: Jo yahaan tumharey liye hai sab hai agar tum mujhey shifa do. To us ne kaha: Beshak main kisi ko shifa nahi deta, shifa to Allah Taala deta hai. Phir agar tum Allah par imaan laao to main Allah se dua karunga aur wo tumhey shifa dega. To wo Allah Taala par imaan laya aur Allah Taala ne usey shifa di. To wo baadshah key paas aaya aur uskey paas baitha jaisa baith-ta tha. To baadshah ne us se kaha: Tumhari beenai kis ne wapas ki? Us ne kaha: Mera Rab. Us ne kaha: Aur merey siwa tumhara Rab hai? Us ne kaha: Mera aur tumhara Rab Allah hai. To us ne usey pakad liya aur usey azaab deta raha yahan tak ke us ne ladkey ki taraf rahnumai ki. To ladka laaya gaya aur baadshah ne us se kaha: Ae merey betey! Tumhara jaadu pahunch gaya hai jo andhey aur kodhi ko achchha karta hai aur karta hai aur karta hai. To us ne kaha: Beshak main kisi ko shifa nahi deta, shifa to Allah Taala deta hai. To us ne usey pakad liya aur usey azaab deta raha yahan tak ke us ne raahib ki taraf rahnumai ki. To raahib laaya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Apne deen se wapas aao. To us ne inkaar kya. To us ne aara mangwaya aur usey uskey sar key darmiyaan mein rakha aur usey cheera yahan tak ke uskey donon tukdey gir gaey. Phir baadshah ka humnasheen laaya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Apne deen se wapas aao. To us ne inkaar kya. To us ne aara uskey sar key darmiyaan mein rakha aur usey cheera yahan tak ke uskey donon tukdey gir gaey. Phir ladka laaya gaya aur us se kaha gaya: Apne deen se wapas aao. To us ne inkaar kya. To us ne usey apne baaz saathiyon key supurd kya aur kaha: Usey fulaan pahaad tak ley jao aur usey us par chadhao. Phir agar wo apne deen se wapas aey warna usey phenk do. To wo usey ley gaey aur usey pahaad par chadhaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey un se jis tarah chaahey kaafi hoja. To pahaad ne unhey hilaaya aur wo gir gaey. Aur wo baadshah key paas chal kar aaya. To baadshah ne us se kaha: Tumharey saathiyon ne kya kya? Us ne kaha: Allah mujhey un se kaafi ho gaya. To us ne usey apne baaz saathiyon key supurd kya aur kaha: Usey ley jao aur usey badi kashti mein sawaar karo aur usey samundar key darmiyaan tak ley jao. Phir agar wo apne deen se wapas aey warna usey phenk do. To wo usey ley gaey. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey un se jis tarah chaahey kaafi hoja. To kashti un se ulat gai aur wo doob gaey. Aur wo baadshah key paas chal kar aaya. To baadshah ne us se kaha: Tumharey saathiyon ne kya kya? Us ne kaha: Allah mujhey un se kaafi ho gaya. To us ne baadshah se kaha: Beshak tum mujhey qatl nahi kar sakogey yahan tak ke tum wo karo jo main tumhey hukm dun. Us ne kaha: Wo kya hai? Us ne kaha: Logon ko aik maidaan mein jama karo, aur mujhey taney par latkao. Phir meri tarkash mein se teer lo, phir teer ko kamaan key darmiyaan mein rakho. Phir kaho: Allah key naam key sath jo ladkey ka Rab hai. Phir mujhey maaro. Kyonke agar tum ye karogey to mujhey qatl karogey. To baadshah ne logon ko aik maidaan mein jama kya aur usey taney par latkaaya. Phir uski tarkash mein se teer liya, phir teer ko kamaan key darmiyaan mein rakha. Phir kaha: Allah key naam key sath jo ladkey ka Rab hai. Phir usey maara aur teer uski kankpati mein laga. To us ne apna haath kankpati par rakha aur mar gaya. To logon ne kaha: Ham ladkey key Rab par imaan laey. To baadshah key paas aaya aur us se kaha gaya: Kya tum dekhtey ho? Allah ki qasam! Tumhey jo waaqe hua hai wo waaqe ho gaya hai. Log imaan laey hain. To us ne hukm diya aur raaston key dahaaney par garhey khodey gaey aur un mein aag bhadkai gai. Aur kaha: Jo apne deen se wapas na aey to us mein daal do, ya kaha jaeyga: Us mein dakhil ho. To unhon-ne kya. Yahan tak ke aik aurat aai jiskey sath uska bachcha tha. To wo us mein giRney se ruki. To bachchey ne kaha: Ae ammi! Sabr karo, kyonke tum haq par ho."
"31","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik aurat key paas se guzrey jo qabr key paas ro rahi thi. To farmaya: Allah se daro aur sabr karo. To us ne kaha: Mujh se door ho, kyonke tumhey meri museebat nahi pahunchi. Aur wo Aap ko nahi pehchaanti thi. To us se kaha gaya: Beshak wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. To wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key darwaazey par aai aur Aap key paas darbaan nahi paey. To us ne kaha: Main ne tumhey nahi pehchaana. To farmaya: Sabr to pehli chot key waqt hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"32","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala farmata hai: Merey momin bandey key liye merey paas badla nahi hai jab main duniya walon mein se uskey pyaarey ko qabz kar lun phir wo us par sawaab ki ummeed rakhey siwaey Jannat key. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"33","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se taoon key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne unhey khabar di ke wo azaab tha jo Allah Taala jis par chaahta bhejta tha. Phir Allah Taala ne usey mominon key liye rehmat bana diya. Phir jo banda taoon mein mubtala ho aur apne sheher mein sabr kartey huey sawaab ki ummeed rakhtey huey thehrey, aur jaanta ho ke usey sirf wo pahunchega jo Allah ne uskey liye likha hai, to uskey liye shaheed key ajr jaisa hoga. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"34","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Jab main apne bandey ko uski donon pyaari cheezon key sath aazmaata hun aur wo sabr karta hai to main usey unkey badley Jannat deta hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"35","Ata bin Abi Rabaah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhey Jannat walon mein se aurat na dikhaaun? To main ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye kaali aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur us ne kaha: Beshak mujhey mirgi aati hai, aur beshak main nangey ho jaati hun. Isliye Allah Taala se merey liye dua karein. Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to sabr karo aur tumharey liye Jannat hai. Aur agar tum chaho to main Allah Taala se dua karun ke wo tumhey aafiyat dey. To us ne kaha: Main sabr karungi. To us ne kaha: Beshak main nangey ho jaati hun. Isliye Allah se dua karein ke main nangey na hun. To Aap ne uskey liye dua ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"36","Abu Abdur Rahman Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhta hun ke wo ambiya mein se aik Nabi ka qissa bayan farma rahey hain, Allah ki rehmaten aur salaamti un par hon. Unki qaum ne unhey maara aur khoon aalood kar diya jabke wo apne chehrey se khoon ponchh rahey hain aur kehtey hain: Ae Allah! Meri qaum ko bakhsh dey kyonke wo nahi jaantey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"37","Abu Saeed aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ko jo thakaan ya beemari ya fikr ya ghum ya takleef ya gham pahunchta hai, yahan tak ke kaanta jo usey chubhta hai, to Allah uskey sabab uski khataein mita deta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Walwasab beemari hai."
"38","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas dakhil hua jabke Aap ko bukhaar tha. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tumhey sakht bukhaar hai. Aap ne farmaya: Haan, beshak mujhey aisa bukhaar hota hai jaisa tum mein se do aadmiyon ko hota hai. Main ne kaha: Isliye ke tumharey liye do ajr hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, ye isi tarah hai. Jo Musalman ho jisey takleef pahunchy, kaanta aur us se oopar, to Allah uskey sabab uski buraiyan mita deta hai, aur us se uskey gunaah jhad jaatey hain jaisa darakht apne pattey jhaadta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"39","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis key sath Allah bhalai ka irada farmata hai usey museebat mein mubtala karta hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"40","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi takleef key sabab jo usey pahunchi hai maut ki tamanna na karey. Phir agar wo zaroor karne wala ho to kahey: Ae Allah! Mujhey zinda rakh jab tak zindagi merey liye behtar ho, aur mujhey wafaat dey jab wafaat merey liye behtar ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"41","Abu Abdullah Khabbaab bin Al-Aratt (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se shikayat ki jabke Aap Kaaba key saaey mein apni chaadar ka takiya lagaye huey they. To ham ne kaha: Kya tum hamarey liye madad nahi maangtey? Kya hamarey liye dua nahi farmatey? To farmaya: Tum se pehley aadmi pakda jaata tha aur uskey liye zameen mein garha khoda jaata tha aur us mein rakh diya jaata tha. Phir aara laaya jaata tha aur uskey sar par rakha jaata tha aur do tukdey kar diya jaata tha. Aur lohey ki kanghiyon key sath uskey gosht aur haddi key neechey nochha jaata tha. Wo usey uskey deen se nahi rokta tha. Allah ki qasam! Allah is muamley ko zaroor poora farmayega yahan tak ke sawaar Sanaa se Hazramaut tak chalega aur Allah key siwa kisi se nahi darega, aur bhediye se apni bakriyon par. Lekin tum jaldi kartey ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"42","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Hunain ka din hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqseem mein kuchh logon ko tarjeeh di. To Aqra bin Haabis ko sau oont diye, aur Uyaina bin Hisn ko us jaisa diya. Aur Arab key sardaron mein se kuchh logon ko diya aur unhey us din taqseem mein tarjeeh di. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ye taqseem hai jis mein insaaf nahi kya gaya, aur us mein Allah ka chehra nahi chaha gaya. To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar dunga. To main Aap key paas aaya aur Aap ko us ne jo kaha tha khabar di. To Aap ka chehra badal gaya yahan tak ke wo surkh chamdey ki tarah tha. Phir farmaya: To kaun insaaf karega jab Allah aur uskey Rasool insaaf na karein? Phir farmaya: Allah Musa par rehem farmaye, unhey is se zyada takleef di gai aur unhon-ne sabr kya. To main ne kaha: Beshak main uskey baad Aap ki taraf koi hadis nahi uthaaunga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"43","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah apne bandey key sath bhalai ka irada farmata hai to uskey liye duniya mein saza mein jaldi farmata hai. Aur jab Allah apne bandey key sath shar ka irada farmata hai to us se uskey gunaah key sabab rokta hai yahan tak ke qayamat key din uskey sath aey. Aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak badey badley ka badi aazmaaish key sath hai. Aur beshak Allah Taala jab qaum se mohabbat farmata hai to unhey aazmaaish mein mubtala karta hai. Phir jo raazi ho uskey liye raza hai, aur jo naraaz ho uskey liye naraazgi hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"44","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ka beta beemar tha. To Abu Talha nikley aur bachcha faut ho gaya. Phir jab Abu Talha wapas aey to farmaya: Merey betey ne kya kya? Umm Sulaim jo bachchey ki walida thein, ne kaha: Wo sab se sukoon mein hai jo tha. To unhon-ne unkey saamney raat ka khaana rakha aur unhon-ne khaaya. Phir un se mili. Phir jab faarigh huein to kaha: Bachchey ko dafan karo. Phir jab Abu Talha ne subah ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap ko khabar di. To farmaya: Kya tum ne raat mein dulha dulhan ki tarah raat guzaari? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Un donon ko barkat ata farma. To wo ladkey se haamila huein. To Abu Talha ne mujh se kaha: Usey uthayo yahan tak ke usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas lao. Aur uskey sath khajoorein bhejein. To farmaya: Kya uskey sath kuchh hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, khajoorein hain. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey liya aur chabaaya. Phir usey apne munh se liya aur bachchey key munh mein rakha. Phir usey ghutti di aur uska naam Abdullah rakha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Abu Talha key Umm Sulaim se beta faut ho gaya. To unhon-ne apne ghar walon se kaha: Abu Talha ko uskey betey ki khabar na dena yahan tak ke main usey khabar dun. To wo aey aur unhon-ne unkey saamney raat ka khaana rakha. To us ne khaaya aur piya. Phir uskey liye taiyaar huein sab se achchha jo wo us se pehley taiyaar hoti thein. To wo un se miley. Phir jab unhon-ne dekha ke wo sair ho gaya hai aur us se mil chuka hai to kaha: Ae Abu Talha! Batao agar kisi qaum ne apni aariyat ghar walon ko di ho aur phir apni aariyat maangi ho, kya unhey haq hai ke unhey rokein? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. To unhon-ne kaha: To apne betey ka sawaab samjho. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo ghusay huey. Phir kaha: Tum ne mujhey chhora yahan tak ke jab main aalooda hua to mujhey merey betey ki khabar di?! To wo chaley yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap ko jo tha khabar di. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah tumhari donon raaton mein barkat ata farmaye. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo haamila huein. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein they aur wo Aap key sath thein. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar se Madina aatey they to usey raat mein nahi aatey they. To wo Madina key qareeb huey aur usey dard-e-zeh hua. To usey rok diya gaya. To Abu Talha ne farmaya, ya unhon-ne farmaya: Beshak tum jaantey ho ae Rab ke mujhey pasand hai ke Rasulullah key sath niklun jab wo niklein, aur unkey sath dakhil hun jab wo dakhil hon. Aur beshak main iskey sabab rok diya gaya hun jaisa tum dekhtey ho. Unhon-ne kaha: To Abu Talha ne kaha: Ae Rab! Beshak mujhey pasand hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo chaley aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath dakhil huey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo ladkey se haamila thein. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To us ne mujh se wada kya ke us waqt mujh se judaa nahi hogi. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo usey ley aain yahan tak ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein. To Umm Sulaim ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Abu Talha dua farmatey hain. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor maangi aur chabaai, phir usey bachchey key munh mein daala aur ghutti di aur uska naam Abdullah rakha."
"45","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pehelwaan kushti ladney wala nahi hai, pehelwaan to wo hai jo ghussey key waqt apne nafs ka maalik hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"46","Sulaiman bin Surad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baitha tha, jabke do aadmi gaali galoch kar rahey they, aur un mein se aik ka chehra surkh ho gaya tha aur uski ragein phool gaein thein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main aisa kalima jaanta hun ke agar wo kahey to us se wo door ho jaey jo wo paata hai. Agar wo kahey: Main shaitaan mardood se Allah ki panah maangta hun, to us se wo door ho jaey jo wo paata hai. To us se kaha gaya: Beshak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaitaan mardood se Allah ki panah maango. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"47","Muaz bin Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghussey ko pi jaey jabke wo usey naafiz karne par qaadir ho, to Allah Subhanahu wa Taala qayamat key din usey makhlooq key sardaron par bulayega yahan tak ke usey hooron mein se ikhtiyaar dega jo chaahey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"48","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhey waseeyat karein. Aap ne farmaya: Ghussa na karo. Us ne baar baar dohraaya. Aap ne farmaya: Ghussa na karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"49","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin mard aur momin aurat par apni jaan aur aulaad aur maal mein aazmaaish rehti hai yahan tak ke wo Allah Taala se miley jabke us par koi khata nahi hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"50","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Uyaina bin Hisn aaya aur apne bhatijey Hurr bin Qais key paas thehra, jabke wo un giroh mein se they jinhey Umar (Raziallahu anhu) qareeb kartey they. Aur qaari hazraat Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki majlis waley aur unkey mushir they, chaahey boodhey hon ya jawaan. To Uyaina ne apne bhatijey se kaha: Ae merey bhatijey! Tumhey is ameer key paas martaba hai, isliye merey liye us se ijazat lo. To us ne ijazat li aur Umar ne ijazat di. Phir jab wo dakhil hua to kaha: Haan ae Ibn Khattab! Allah ki qasam! Tum hamein zyada nahi detey aur na hamarey darmiyaan insaaf se faisla kartey ho. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ghusay huey yahan tak ke us par waqe honay ka irada kya. To Hurr ne un se kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Beshak Allah Taala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se farmaya: Darguzar ikhtiyaar karo aur bhalai ka hukm do aur jaahilon se munh phero (Al-Aaraaf: 199). Aur beshak ye jaahilon mein se hai. Allah ki qasam! Umar ne us se tajawuz nahi kya jab us ne usey padha, jabke wo Allah Taala ki kitaab par rukne waley they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"51","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak merey baad tarjeeh hogi aur muamlaat jinka tum inkaar karogey! Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To tum hamein kya hukm detey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Tum wo haq ada karogey jo tum par hai, aur Allah se wo maangogey jo tumharey liye hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"52","Abu Yahya Usaid bin Hudhair (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhey aamil nahi banaogey jaisa tum ne fulaan ko aamil banaya hai? To farmaya: Beshak tum merey baad tarjeeh paogey. Isliye sabr karo yahan tak ke Hauz par mujh se milo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"53","Abu Ibrahim Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne baaz dinon mein jin mein Aap dushman se miley, suraj dhalney tak intizaar farmatey. Phir un mein khadey hotey aur farmatey: Ae logon! Dushman se milney ki tamanna na karo, aur Allah se aafiyat maango. Phir jab un se milo to sabr karo, aur jaan lo ke Jannat talwaaron key saayon key neechey hai. Phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Kitaab naazil karne waley aur baadal chalaaney waley aur girohon ko shikast dene waley! Unhey shikast dey aur un par hamari madad farma. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Allah hi taufeeq dene wala hai."
"54","To pehli Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sachchai neki ki taraf rahnumai karti hai aur beshak neki Jannat ki taraf rahnumai karti hai. Aur beshak aadmi sach bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah key paas siddiq likha jaata hai. Aur beshak jhoot gunaah ki taraf rahnumai karta hai aur beshak gunaah dozakh ki taraf rahnumai karta hai. Aur beshak aadmi jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah key paas kazzaab likha jaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"55","Doosri: Abu Muhammad Hasan bin Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yaad kya: Jo tumhey shak mein daaley usey chhor do uski taraf jo tumhey shak mein na daaley. Kyonke sachchai sukoon hai, aur jhoot shak hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"56","Teesri: Abu Sufyan Sakhr bin Harb (Raziallahu anhu) se unki taweel hadis mein Qaisar key qissey mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hiraql ne kaha: Phir wo tumhey kya hukm deta hai, yaani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)? Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo kehta hai: Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao, aur chhoro jo tumharey baap kehtey hain. Aur hamein namaz ka, aur sachchai ka, aur paakdaamani ka, aur rishta jorney ka hukm deta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"57","Chauthi: Abu Saabit, aur kaha gaya Abu Saeed, aur kaha gaya Abul Waleed, Sehel bin Hunaif, jo Badri hain (Raziallahu anhu), se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah Taala se sachchai key sath shahaadat maangey to Allah usey shuhada key manaazil tak pahunchayega, chaahey wo apne bistar par mar jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"58","Paanchwein: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ambiya mein se aik Nabi ne ghazwa kya, Allah ki rehmaten aur salaamti un par hon. To apni qaum se farmaya: Mera peecha wo aadmi na karey jis ne aurat ka mehr apnaaya ho. Aur wo us se shaadi karna chaahta ho lekin us se shaadi na ki ho. Aur na wo jis ne ghar banaey hon aur unki chhatein buland na ki hon. Aur na wo jis ne bakriyan ya haamila oontniyan khareedi hon jabke wo unkey bachchon ka intizaar karta ho. To ghazwa kya aur basti key qareeb Asr ki namaz key waqt ya uskey qareeb pahuncha. To suraj se farmaya: Beshak tum hukm di gai ho aur main hukm diya gaya hun. Ae Allah! Usey ham par rok dey. To wo rok di gai yahan tak ke Allah ne us par fatah di. To maal-e-ghanimat jama kya. To aag aai, yaani usey khaaney key liye, lekin us ne usey nahi khaaya. To farmaya: Beshak tum mein khayaanat hai. Isliye har qabeeley mein se aik aadmi meri baiyat karey. To aik aadmi ka haath uskey haath key sath chipak gaya. To farmaya: Tum mein khayaanat hai. Isliye tumhara qabeela meri baiyat karey. To do ya teen aadmiyon key haath uskey haath key sath chipak gaey. To farmaya: Tum mein khayaanat hai. To wo gaay key sar jaisa soney ka sar laey. To usey rakha aur aag aai aur usey khaa gai. To maal-e-ghanimat ham se pehley kisi key liye halaal nahi huey. Phir Allah ne hamarey liye maal-e-ghanimat halaal kiye jab us ne hamari kamzori aur aajizi dekhi aur unhey hamarey liye halaal kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"59","Chhathi: Abu Khaalid Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baichney aur khareedney waley ko judaa honay tak ikhtiyaar hai. Phir agar wo sach bolein aur bayaan karein to unkey sauda mein barkat di jaati hai. Aur agar wo chhupaen aur jhoot bolein to unkey sauda ki barkat mita di jaati hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"60","Aur rahi ahadis: To pehli: Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baithey huey they ke ham par aik aadmi zaahir hua jiska libaas sakht safed tha, aur uskey baal sakht kaaley they. Us par safar ka asar nahi dekha jaata tha, aur ham mein se koi usey nahi pehchaanta tha. Yahan tak ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baitha. To us ne apne ghutney Aap key ghutnon key sath lagaye, aur apni hatheliyan apni raanon par rakhein aur kaha: Ae Muhammad! Mujhey Islam key baarey mein khabar dein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam hai ke tum gawahi do ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. Aur namaz qaim karo, aur zakaat do, aur Ramazan key rozey rakho, aur Baitullah ka Hajj karo agar uski taraf rasta pa sako. Us ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha. To ham ne us par taajjub kya ke wo Aap se poochhta hai aur tasdeeq karta hai! Us ne kaha: To mujhey Imaan key baarey mein khabar dein. Aap ne farmaya: Ke tum Allah par, aur uskey farishton par, aur uski kitaabon par, aur uskey Rasoolon par, aur aakhirat key din par imaan laao, aur taqdeer key bhaley aur burey par imaan laao. Us ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha. Us ne kaha: To mujhey Ehsaan key baarey mein khabar dein. Aap ne farmaya: Ke tum Allah ki ibaadat karo goya tum usey dekhtey ho. Phir agar tum usey nahi dekhtey to wo tumhey dekhta hai. Us ne kaha: To mujhey Qayamat key baarey mein khabar dein. Aap ne farmaya: Uskey baarey mein poochha jaaney wala poochhney waley se zyada jaanne wala nahi hai. Us ne kaha: To mujhey uski nishaaniyon key baarey mein khabar dein. Aap ne farmaya: Ke londi apni aaqa ko janey, aur tum nangey paaon nangey badan faqeer bakri charaaney walon ko imaarton mein buland hotey huey dekho. Phir wo chala gaya. To main dair tak raha. Phir farmaya: Ae Umar! Kya tum jaantey ho poochhney wala kaun tha? Main ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Wo Jibraeel they jo tumhey tumharey deen ka muamla sikhaanay aey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"61","Doosri: Abu Zarr Jundab bin Junaada, aur Abu Abdur Rahman Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah se daro tum jahan bhi ho, aur burai key peechey bhalai karo jo usey mita degi, aur logon key sath achchhey akhlaaq se pesh aao. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"62","Teesri: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey tha. To farmaya: Ae ladkey! Beshak main tumhey kalimey sikhaata hun: Allah ki hifaazat karo wo tumhari hifaazat farmayega. Allah ki hifaazat karo tum usey apne saamney paogey. Jab maango to Allah se maango, aur jab madad chaho to Allah se madad chaho. Aur jaan lo: Ke ummat agar is par jama ho jaey ke tumhey kisi chiz key sath faeda pahunchaye, to tumhey us chiz key siwa faeda nahi pahunchayengey jo Allah ne tumharey liye likhi hai. Aur agar wo is par jama hon ke tumhey kisi chiz key sath nuqsaan pahunchaye, to tumhey us chiz key siwa nuqsaan nahi pahunchayengey jo Allah ne tum par likhi hai. Qalam utha liye gaey hain, aur saheefey khushk ho gaey hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"63","Chauthi: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tum aise aamaal kartey ho jo tumhari nazaron mein baal se zyada bareek hain, ham unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein halaak karne walon mein se shumaar kartey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur farmaya: Mobiqaat halaak karne waley hain."
"64","Paanchwein: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ghairat farmata hai, aur Allah Taala ki ghairat hai ke aadmi usey aey jo Allah ne us par haraam kya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"65","Chhathi: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Bani Israeel mein se teen they: Kodhi, aur ganja, aur andha. Allah ne chaaha ke unhey aazmaey aur unki taraf farishta bheja. To wo kodhi key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Tumhey kaun si chiz sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Achchha rang, aur achchhi khaal, aur mujh se wo door ho jaey jiskey sabab log mujhey ganda samajhtey hain. To us ne uska masah kya aur us se uski gandagi door ho gai aur usey achchha rang diya gaya. Us ne kaha: To tumhey kaun sa maal sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Oont, ya farmaya: Gaay, rawi ko shak hai. To usey dus maah ki haamila oontni di gai. To us ne kaha: Allah tumharey liye us mein barkat ata farmaye. To wo ganjey key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Tumhey kaun si chiz sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Achchhey baal, aur mujh se ye door ho jaey jiskey sabab log mujhey ganda samajhtey hain. To us ne uska masah kya aur us se door ho gaya aur usey achchhey baal diye gaey. Us ne kaha: To tumhey kaun sa maal sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Gaay. To usey haamila gaay di gai aur kaha: Allah tumharey liye us mein barkat ata farmaye. To wo andhey key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Tumhey kaun si chiz sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Ke Allah meri beenai wapas kar dey aur main logon ko dekhun. To us ne uska masah kya aur Allah ne uski beenai wapas kar di. Us ne kaha: To tumhey kaun sa maal sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Bakri. To usey bachcha dene wali bakri di gai. To in donon ne bachchey diye aur is ne bachcha diya. To iskey paas oonton ki waadi thi, aur iskey paas gaayon ki waadi thi, aur iskey paas bakriyon ki waadi thi. Phir wo kodhi key paas uski soorat aur haalat mein aaya. To us se kaha: Miskeen aadmi aur musaafir hun jiski rasiyan merey safar mein toot gaein hain. Aaj merey liye pahunchna nahi hai magar Allah phir tumharey sabab. Tum se uskey naam par maangta hun jis ne tumhey achchha rang, aur achchhi khaal, aur maal diya hai, oont jiskey sath apne safar mein pahunchun. To us ne kaha: Huqooq bahut hain. To us ne kaha: Goya main tumhey pehchaanta hun. Kya tum kodhi nahi they jisey log ganda samajhtey they aur faqeer they, phir Allah ne tumhey diya?! To us ne kaha: Main ne to ye maal badon se wirasat mein paaya hai. To us ne kaha: Agar tum jhoote ho to Allah tumhey waisa kar dey jaisa tum they. Aur wo ganjey key paas aaya aur us se waisa kaha jaisa is se kaha tha, aur us ne usey waisa jawab diya jaisa is ne jawab diya tha. To us ne kaha: Agar tum jhoote ho to Allah tumhey waisa kar dey jaisa tum they. Aur wo andhey key paas aaya uski soorat aur haalat mein aur kaha: Miskeen aadmi aur musaafir hun jiski rasiyan toot gaein hain. Aaj merey pahunchney key liye Allah phir tumharey sabab key siwa kuchh nahi. Tum se uskey naam par maangta hun jis ne tumhari beenai wapas ki hai, bakri jiskey sath apne safar mein pahunchun. To us ne kaha: Beshak main andha tha aur Allah ne mujhey beenai di hai. Isliye lo jo chaho aur chhoro jo chaho. Allah ki qasam! Aaj tum mujh se jo logey us par main tumhey mushkil nahi dunga Allah Azza wa Jall key naam par. To us ne kaha: Apna maal rok kar rakho kyonke tum aazmaey gaey ho. Beshak Allah tum se raazi hua hai aur tumharey donon saathiyon par naraaz hua hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"66","Saatwein: Abu Yaala Shaddaad bin Aus (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dana wo hai jo apne nafs ka hisaab ley, aur maut key baad key liye amal karey. Aur aajiz wo hai jo apne nafs ko uski khuwahish key peechey lagaey, aur Allah par tamanna karey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"67","Aathwein: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi key achchhey Islam mein se hai uska usey chhorna jo usey matlab nahi rakhta. Hasan hadis hai, ise Tirmizi waghera ne riwayat kya hai."
"68","Nawein: Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi se nahi poochha jaeyga ke us ne apni biwi ko kis mein maara. Ise Abu Dawud waghera ne riwayat kya hai."
"69","Aur rahi ahadis: To pehli: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Logon mein sab se izzat wala kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Un mein sab se muttaqi. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham tum se iskey baarey mein nahi poochhtey. Aap ne farmaya: To Yusuf Allah key Nabi, Allah key Nabi key betey, Allah key Nabi key betey, Allah key khaleel key betey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham tum se iskey baarey mein nahi poochhtey. Aap ne farmaya: To tum mujh se Arab key maadanon key baarey mein poochhtey ho? Jaahiliyat mein unkey behtreen Islam mein unkey behtreen hain jab wo samjhein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"70","Doosri: Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak duniya meethi sabz hai, aur beshak Allah tumhey us mein khalifa banaata hai aur dekhta hai ke tum kaisey amal kartey ho. Isliye duniya se daro aur aurton se daro. Kyonke Bani Israeel ka pehla fitna aurton mein tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"71","Teesri: Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se hidayat aur taqwa aur paakdaamani aur be-niyaazi ka sawal karta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"72","Chauthi: Abu Zareef Adi bin Haatim Taa'i (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo qasam khaey phir us se Allah key liye zyada parhezgaar dekhey to taqwa ko aey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"73","Paanchwein: Abu Umama Sudy bin Ajlaan Baahili (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Hajjatul Wada mein khutba detey huey suna. To farmaya: Allah se daro, aur apni paanch padho, aur apna maheena rozey rakho, aur apne maalon ki zakaat do, aur apne ameeron ki itaat karo. Apne Rab ki Jannat mein dakhil hojaogey. Ise Tirmizi ne Kitaabus Salaah key aakhir mein riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"74","To pehli Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh par ummatein pesh ki gaein. To main ne Nabi ko dekha jinkey sath chhoti jamaat thi, aur Nabi ko jinkey sath aik aur do aadmi they, aur Nabi ko jinkey sath koi nahi tha. Jab merey liye badi tadaad uthai gai to main ne gumaan kya ke wo meri ummat hain. To mujh se kaha gaya: Ye Musa aur unki qaum hain, lekin ufaq ki taraf dekho. To main ne dekha aur achanak badi tadaad thi. To mujh se kaha gaya: Doosrey ufaq ki taraf dekho. To achanak badi tadaad thi. To mujh se kaha gaya: Ye tumhari ummat hain, aur unkey sath sattar hazaar hain jo Jannat mein baghair hisaab aur azaab key dakhil hongey. Phir Aap uth-kar apne ghar mein dakhil huey. To log unkey baarey mein behes karne lagey jo Jannat mein baghair hisaab aur azaab key dakhil hongey. To baaz ne kaha: Shayad wo hain jinhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyaar ki. Aur baaz ne kaha: Shayad wo hain jo Islam mein paida huey aur Allah key sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehraaya, aur cheezein zikr kein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un par nikley aur farmaya: Tum kis mein behes kar rahey ho? To unhon-ne Aap ko khabar di. To farmaya: Wo hain jo daagh nahi lagatey, aur daagh lagwaanay ka mutaaliba nahi kartey, aur badfaali nahi letey, aur apne Rab par bharosa kartey hain. To Ukaasha bin Mihsan khada hua aur us ne kaha: Allah se dua karein ke mujhey un mein se bana dey. To farmaya: Tum un mein se ho. Phir aik aur aadmi khada hua aur us ne kaha: Allah se dua karein ke mujhey un mein se bana dey. To farmaya: Ukaasha tum se sabqat ley gaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"75","Doosri: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se bhi riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Terey liye main ne Islam qabool kya, aur Tujh par imaan laya, aur Tujh par bharosa kya, aur Teri taraf rujoo kya, aur Terey sath jhagda kya. Ae Allah! Main Teri izzat ki panah maangta hun, Terey siwa koi mabood nahi, ke Tu mujhey gumraah karey. Tu zinda hai jo nahi marta, aur jinn aur ins martey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai, aur Bukhari ne mukhtasar kya hai."
"76","Teesri: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se bhi riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hasbunallahu wa ni'mal wakeel, Ibrahim (Alehis salaam) ne kaha tha jab unhey aag mein daala gaya tha. Aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha tha jab unhon-ne kaha: Beshak logon ne tumharey liye jama kya hai isliye un se daro. To unkey imaan mein izafa hua aur unhon-ne kaha: Hasbunallahu wa ni'mal wakeel. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"77","Chauthi: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein qaumein dakhil hongi jinkey dil parindon key dilon jaisey hongey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"78","Paanchwein: Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Najd se pehley Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwa kya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas aey to wo unkey sath wapas aey. To unhey dopahar ne aisi waadi mein paaya jis mein bahut sey kaanteydaar darakht they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey aur log darkhton key saaye mein judaa ho gaey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) keekar key neechey utrey aur us par apni talwaar latka di. Aur ham soey. To achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein bula rahey hain, jabke Aap key paas dehaati hai. To farmaya: Beshak is ne mujh par meri talwaar kheench li jabke main soya hua tha. To main bedaar hua jabke wo uskey haath mein nangey thi. Us ne kaha: Tumhey mujh se kaun bachaayega? Main ne kaha: Allah, teen martaba. Aur usey saza nahi di aur baith gaey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jabir ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Zaatur Riqa mein they. Phir jab ham saaeydaar darakht par aey to usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye chhor diya. To mushrikon mein se aik aadmi aaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki talwaar darakht par latki hui thi. To us ne usey kheench liya aur kaha: Tum mujh se dartey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To tumhey mujh se kaun bachaayega? Aap ne farmaya: Allah. Aur Abu Bakr Ismaaeeli ki Sahih mein riwayat mein hai: Us ne kaha: Tumhey mujh se kaun bachaayega? Aap ne farmaya: Allah. Unhon-ne kaha: To talwaar uskey haath se gir gai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne talwaar li aur farmaya: Tumhey mujh se kaun bachaayega? To us ne kaha: Achchhey pakadney wala ban jao. To farmaya: Kya tum gawahi detey ho ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur main Allah ka Rasool hun? Us ne kaha: Nahi, lekin main tum se ahd karta hun ke tum se qitaal nahi karunga aur na us qaum key sath rahunga jo tum se qitaal karti hai. To usey chhor diya. To wo apne saathiyon key paas aaya aur kaha: Main tumharey paas behtreen logon key paas se aaya hun."
"79","Chhathi: Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Agar tum Allah par uskey bharosey key haq key sath bharosa kartey to wo tumhey aisa rizq deta jaisa parindey ko rizq deta hai. Wo subah khaali pait nikalta hai aur shaam bharay pait wapas aata hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"80","Saatwein: Abu Umaara Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae fulaan! Jab tum apne bistar par aao to kaho: Ae Allah! Main ne apni jaan Terey supurd ki, aur apna chehra Teri taraf mutawajjah kya. Aur apna muamla Terey hawale kya, aur apni peeth Teri taraf jhukai. Teri taraf raghbat aur khauf key sath. Tujh se bachney key liye Terey siwa koi panah aur nijaat nahi. Main Teri kitaab par imaan laya jo Tune naazil ki, aur Terey Nabi par jo Tune bheja. Kyonke agar tum apni raat mein mar gaey to fitrat par marogey. Aur agar subah ki to bhalai paogey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"81","Aathwein: Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) se Abdullah bin Usman bin Aamir bin Amr bin Kaab bin Saad bin Taim bin Murra bin Kaab bin Loayy bin Ghaalib Qarshi Taimi (Raziallahu anhu), jabke wo aur unkey waalid aur walida sahaaba hain (Raziallahu anhum), se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne mushrikon key qadmon ki taraf dekha jabke ham ghaar mein they aur wo hamarey saron par they. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Agar un mein se koi apne qadmon key neechey dekhey to hamein dekheyga. To farmaya: Tumhara kya gumaan hai ae Abu Bakr do key baarey mein jinka teesra Allah hai? (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"82","Nawein: Ummul Momineen Umm Salama, jinka naam Hind bint Abi Umayya Huzaifa Makhzoomiya hai (Raziallahu anha), se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne ghar se nikaltey to farmatey: Allah key naam key sath, main ne Allah par bharosa kya. Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun ke main gumraah hun ya gumraah kya jaun, ya zalil hun ya zalil kya jaun, ya zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kya jaey, ya jihaalat karun ya mujh par jihaalat ki jaey. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi waghera ne sahih asaneed se riwayat kya hai. Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai, aur ye Abu Dawud ka lafz hai."
"83","Daswein: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kahey, yaani jab apne ghar se nikley: Allah key naam key sath, main ne Allah par bharosa kya, aur na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar Allah ki taufeeq se. Us se kaha jaata hai: Tumhey hidayat di gai aur tum kaafi huey aur tum bachaey gaey. Aur shaitaan us se door hat jaata hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi aur Nasaai waghera ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Abu Dawud ne izafa kya hai: To wo kehta hai, yaani shaitaan, doosrey shaitaan se: Tumhey us aadmi key sath kya hai jo hidayat paa gaya aur kaafi hua aur bachaaya gaya?"
"84","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein do bhai they. Aur un mein se aik Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aata tha, aur doosra hunar karta tha. To hunar karne waley ne apne bhai ki shikayat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki. To farmaya: Shayad tum uskey sabab rizq diye jaatey ho. Ise Tirmizi ne Muslim ki shart par sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"85","Abu Amr, aur kaha gaya Abu Amrah Sufyan bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey Islam mein aisi baat kahein ke uskey baarey mein tumharey siwa kisi se na poochhun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Main Allah par imaan laya. Phir saabit qadam raho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"86","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qareeb aao aur seedhey raho, aur jaan lo ke tum mein se koi apne amal key sabab nijaat nahi paayega. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tum bhi nahi ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Aur main bhi nahi, siwaey iskey ke Allah mujhey apni taraf se rehmat aur fazl key sath dhaanp ley. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"87","To pehli: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaamon mein jaldi karo jo andheri raat key tukdon ki tarah fitney hon: Aadmi subah momin hoga aur shaam kaafir, aur shaam momin hoga aur subah kaafir. Wo apna deen duniya key saamaan key badley baichega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"88","Doosri Abu Saroo'a, seen muhmala key kasra aur fatha key sath, Uqba Ibn Al-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey Madina mein Asr padhi. To Aap ne salaam phera, phir tez uth-kar logon ki gardanon ko phalaangtey huey Aap ki baaz biwiyon key hujrey ki taraf gaey. To log Aap ki tezi se ghabra gaey. To Aap un par nikley aur dekha ke wo Aap ki tezi par taajjub kar rahey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey hamarey paas soney ya chaandi key tukdon mein se kuchh yaad aaya. To main ne napasand kya ke wo mujhey rok dey. Isliye uski taqseem ka hukm diya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Bukhari ki aik riwayat mein hai: Main ne ghar mein sadqey mein se soney ka tukda chhora tha. To main ne napasand kya ke main usey raat mein rokun. Tibr soney ya chaandi key tukdey hain."
"89","Teesri: Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Uhad key din kaha: Batao agar main qatl kya jaun to main kahaan hun? Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein. To us ne khajoorein phenk dein jo uskey haath mein thein. Phir qitaal kya yahan tak ke qatl ho gaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"90","Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa sadqa ajr mein sab se azeem hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ke tum sadqa karo jabke tum tandrust kanjoos ho, faqr se dartey ho aur dolat ki ummeed rakhtey ho. Aur mohlat na do yahan tak ke jab halaq tak pahunchy to kaho: Fulaan key liye itna aur fulaan key liye itna. Jabke wo fulaan key liye tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"91","Paanchwein: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Uhad key din talwaar li aur farmaya: Kaun mujh se ye leyga? To unhon-ne apne haath pheelaiye, un mein se har insaan kehta tha: Main main. Aap ne farmaya: To kaun usey uskey haq key sath leyga? To qaum peechey hati. To Abu Dujaana (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main usey uskey haq key sath lunga. To usey liya aur us se mushrikon key sar phaadey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"92","Chhathi: Zubair bin Adi se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aey aur un se Hajjaaj se milney wali takleef ki shikayat ki. To unhon-ne kaha: Sabr karo, kyonke koi zamaana nahi aata magar jo uskey baad hai us se bura hai yahan tak ke apne Rab se milo. Main ne usey tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"93","Saatwein: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaamon mein saat se pehley jaldi karo. Kya tum intizaar kartey ho bhoolaney waley faqr key siwa, ya sarkash karne wali dolat key, ya bigaadney wali beemari key, ya kharaab karne waley budhaapey key, ya taiyaar maut key, ya Dajjaal ka, jo badtareen ghaaib hai jiska intizaar kya jaata hai, ya Qayamat ka, aur Qayamat zyada sakht aur kadwi hai! Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"94","Aathwein: Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar key din farmaya: Main ye jhanda us aadmi ko dunga jo Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat karta hai, Allah uskey haathon par fatah dega. Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne us din key siwa kabhi imaarat ko pasand nahi kya. To main uskey liye utha taake mujhey uskey liye bulaaya jaey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya aur usey usey diya aur farmaya: Chalo aur mur kar na dekho yahan tak ke Allah tum par fatah dey. To Ali kuchh chaley, phir rukey aur mur kar na dekha. To cheekh kar kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main logon se kis par qitaal karun? Aap ne farmaya: Un se qitaal karo yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. Phir agar wo ye karein to unhon-ne tum se apne khoon aur maal bacha liye siwaey uskey haq key, aur unka hisaab Allah par hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"95","To pehli: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ne farmaya: Jo merey dost se dushmani karey to main ne usey ladai ki khabar di hai. Aur mera banda mujh se kisi chiz key sath qareeb nahi hota jo mujhey us se zyada mehboob ho jo main ne us par farz kya hai. Aur mera banda nawafil key sath mujh se qareeb hota rehta hai yahan tak ke main us se mohabbat karta hun. Phir jab main us se mohabbat karta hun to uska kaan banta hun jis se wo sunta hai, aur uski aankh jis se wo dekhta hai, aur uska haath jis se wo pakadta hai, aur uska paaon jis se wo chalta hai. Aur agar wo mujh se maangey to usey deta hun. Aur agar wo mujh se panah maangey to usey panah deta hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"96","Doosri: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, us mein jo wo apne Rab Azza wa Jall se riwayat kartey hain, riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab banda mujh se baalisht bhar qareeb hota hai to main us se haath bhar qareeb hota hun. Aur jab wo mujh se haath bhar qareeb hota hai to main us se do haath qareeb hota hun. Aur jab wo merey paas chal kar aata hai to main uskey paas daud kar aata hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"97","Teesri: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do naimatein hain jin mein bahut sey log dhokey mein hain: Sehat, aur fursat. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"98","Chauthi: Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein qayaam farmatey they yahan tak ke Aap key donon qadam phat jaatey they. To main ne Aap se kaha: Tum ye kyun kartey ho ya Rasulullah, jabke Allah ne tumharey liye tumhara agla aur peechla gunaah bakhsh diya hai?! Aap ne farmaya: Kya main pasand na karun ke shukr guzaar banda banun? (Muttafaqun aleh. Ye Bukhari ka lafz hai, aur Sahihain mein Mugheera bin Shoba ki riwayat se isi tarah hai)."
"99","Paanchwein: Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ashra dakhil hota to raat ko zinda kartey, aur apne ghar walon ko jagaatey, aur koshish kartey aur kamar kastey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"100","Chhathi: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taqatwar momin Allah key nazdeek kamzor momin se behtar aur zyada mehboob hai, aur har mein bhalai hai. Us par harees hoja jo tumhey faeda dey, aur Allah se madad maango aur aajiz na ho. Aur agar tumhey kuchh pahunchy to na kaho: Kaash main ne kya hota to is is tarah hota. Lekin kaho: Allah ne muqaddar kya, aur jo chaha kya. Kyonke kaash shaitaan ka amal kholta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"101","Saatwein: Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dozakh khuwahishaat key sath dhaanpi gai hai, aur Jannat naapasand cheezon key sath dhaanpi gai hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"102","Aathwein: Abu Abdullah Huzaifa bin Al-Yamaan (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath aik raat namaz padhi. To Aap ne Baqarah se shuru kya. To main ne kaha: Aap sau par ruku kareingey. Phir aagey badhey. To main ne kaha: Aap usey aik rakaat mein padheingey. To aagey badhey. To main ne kaha: Aap us se ruku kareingey. Phir Nisa shuru ki aur usey padha. Phir Aal-e-Imran shuru ki aur usey padha. Theher theher kar padhtey they. Jab tasbeeh wali aayat par guzartey to tasbeeh kartey, aur jab sawal wali par to sawal kartey, aur jab panah wali par guzartey to panah maangtey. Phir ruku kya aur kehney lagey: Subhana Rabbi Al-Azeem. To Aap ka ruku Aap key qayaam jaisa tha. Phir kaha: Sami Allahu liman hamidah, Rabbana lakal hamd. Phir taweel khadey rahey jo ruku jaisa tha. Phir sajda kya aur kaha: Subhana Rabbi Al-Aala. To Aap ka sajda Aap key qayaam key qareeb tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"103","Nawein: Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raat mein namaz padhi. To Aap ne qayaam lamba kya yahan tak ke main ne burey kaam ka irada kya! Kaha gaya: Tum ne kya irada kya tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne irada kya ke baith jaun aur Aap ko chhor dun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"104","Daswein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mayyit key peechey teen chaltey hain: Uskey ghar waley aur uska maal aur uska amal. To do wapas aatey hain aur aik baqi rehta hai: Uskey ghar waley aur uska maal wapas aatey hain, aur uska amal baqi rehta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"105","Gyaarahwein: Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat tum mein se har aik key uskey jootey key tasmey se zyada qareeb hai, aur dozakh usi tarah hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"106","Baaraahwein: Abu Firaas Rabee'a bin Kaab Aslami jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key khaadim they, aur Ahle Suffa mein se (Raziallahu anhu), se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raat guzaarta tha. To main Aap key paas Aap ka wuzu aur Aap ki haajat laata tha. To farmaya: Mujh se maango. To main ne kaha: Tum se Jannat mein tumhari rifaaqat maangta hun. To farmaya: Uskey siwa kuchh? Main ne kaha: Wahi hai. Aap ne farmaya: To kasrat-e-sujood key sath apne nafs par meri madad karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"107","Tehraahwein: Abu Abdullah, aur kaha gaya Abu Abdur Rahman, Saubaan jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key aazaad karda ghulaam they, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum par kasrat-e-sujood laazim hai. Kyonke tum Allah ko koi sajda nahi karogey magar Allah uskey sabab tumhara darja buland farmayega, aur us se tumhari khata mita dega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"108","Chaudahwein: Abu Safwaan Abdullah bin Busr Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtreen log wo hain jinki umr lambi ho aur amal achchha ho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Busr ba key zamma aur seen muhmala key sath hai."
"109","Pandrahawein: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey chacha Anas Ibn An-Nazr (Raziallahu anhu) Ghazwa Badr se ghaaib rahey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main pehley qitaal se ghaaib raha jis mein tum ne mushrikon se qitaal kya. Agar Allah mujhey mushrikon key qitaal mein haazir karey to Allah dekhega ke main kya karta hun. Phir jab Uhad ka din hua aur Musalman muntashir ho gaey to unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Main Teri taraf uzr karta hun us se jo inhon-ne kya, yaani unkey sahaaba, aur Teri taraf baraat karta hun us se jo inhon-ne kya, yaani mushrik. Phir aagey badhey aur Saad bin Muaz unhey miley. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Saad bin Muaz! Jannat, Kaaba key Rab ki qasam! Beshak main uski khushbu Uhad se pehley paata hun. Saad ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main taqat na rakh saka jo us ne kya! Anas ne kaha: To ham ne us mein assi se kuchh oopar talwaar ki maar, ya naizey ki chot, ya teer ki maar paai. Aur ham ne usey qatl hua paaya aur mushrikon ne uska musla kar diya tha. To usey uski behan key siwa koi na pehchaan saka ungli key poron se. Anas ne kaha: Ham dekhtey they ya gumaan kartey they ke ye aayat unkey aur un jaison key baarey mein naazil hui: Mominon mein se aise mard hain jinhon-ne Allah se kiye huey ahd ko sach kar dikhaya (Al-Ahzaab: 23), aakhir tak. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"110","Solaahwein: Abu Masood Uqba bin Amr Ansaari Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab sadqa ki aayat naazil hui to ham apni peethon par mazdoori kartey they. To aik aadmi aaya aur bahut sadqa kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Dikhaawa karne wala hai. Aur aik aur aadmi aaya aur saa bhar sadqa kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Allah uskey saa se be-niyaaz hai! To naazil hui: Jo mominon mein se khushi se sadqa karne walon par taana kartey hain aur un par jo apni mehnat key siwa nahi paatey, aayat (At-Taubah: 79). (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"111","Satraahwein: Saeed bin Abdul Azeez se Rabee'a bin Yazeed se Abu Idrees Khaulaani se Abu Zarr Jundab bin Junaada (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, us mein jo wo Allah Tabaarak wa Taala se riwayat kartey hain, riwayat hai ke us ne farmaya: Ae merey bando! Beshak main ne zulm ko apne nafs par haraam kya hai aur usey tumharey darmiyaan haraam banaya hai. Isliye zulm na karo. Ae merey bando! Tum sab gumraah ho siwaey uskey jisey main hidayat dun. Isliye mujh se hidayat maango main tumhey hidayat dunga. Ae merey bando! Tum sab bhookey ho siwaey uskey jisey main khilaaun. Isliye mujh se khaana maango main tumhey khilaaunga. Ae merey bando! Tum sab nangey ho siwaey uskey jisey main pehnaaun. Isliye mujh se libaas maango main tumhey pehnaaunga. Ae merey bando! Beshak tum raat aur din khata kartey ho jabke main tamaam gunaah bakhshta hun. Isliye mujh se maghfirat maango main tumhey bakhshunga. Ae merey bando! Beshak tum merey nuqsaan ko nahi pahunch sakogey aur mujhey nuqsaan pahunchayo. Aur tum merey faedey ko nahi pahunch sakogey aur mujhey faeda pahunchayo. Ae merey bando! Agar tumharey awwal aur aakhir aur ins aur jinn tum mein se aik aadmi key sab se muttaqi dil par hon to wo merey mulk mein kuchh izafa nahi karega. Ae merey bando! Agar tumharey awwal aur aakhir aur ins aur jinn tum mein se aik aadmi key sab se faajir dil par hon to wo merey mulk mein kuchh kami nahi karega. Ae merey bando! Agar tumharey awwal aur aakhir aur ins aur jinn aik chatyal maidaan mein khadey hon aur mujh se maangein aur main har insaan ko uska maanga dun to wo us mein se kami nahi karega jo merey paas hai siwaey iskey jaisa sui samundar mein daakhil honay par kami karti hai. Ae merey bando! Wo to tumharey aamaal hain jinhey main tumharey liye ginta hun, phir tumhey poora deta hun. Phir jo bhalai paey to Allah ki hamd karey. Aur jo uskey siwa paey to apne siwa kisi ko malaamat na karey. Saeed ne kaha: Abu Idrees jab ye hadis bayan kartey they to apne ghutnon par jhuktey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"112","Aur rahi ahadis: To pehli: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne us aadmi ko uzr diya jiski muddat us ne muakhkhar ki yahan tak ke wo saath saal ko pahunch gaya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"113","Doosri: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar (Raziallahu anhu) mujhey Badri boodhon key sath dakhil kartey they. To goya baaz ne apne dil mein paaya aur us ne kaha: Ye hamarey sath kyun dakhil hota hai jabke hamarey us jaisey betey hain!? To Umar ne kaha: Wo wahaan se hai jaisa tum jaantey ho! To unhon-ne mujhey aik din bulaya aur mujhey unkey sath dakhil kya. To main ne nahi dekha ke unhon-ne mujhey us din sirf isliye bulaaya taake unhey dikhaein. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum Allah Taala key qaul key baarey mein kya kehtey ho: Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaey (An-Nasr: 1)? To baaz ne kaha: Hamein hukm diya gaya hai ke ham Allah ki hamd karein aur us se maghfirat maangein jab wo hamein madad dey aur ham par fatah dey. Aur baaz khamosh rahey aur kuchh na kaha. To unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Kya tum is tarah kehtey ho ae Ibn Abbas? To main ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: To tum kya kehtey ho? Main ne kaha: Wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki muddat hai jo usey khabar di hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaey, aur wo tumhari muddat ki alaamat hai. To apne Rab ki hamd key sath tasbeeh karo aur us se maghfirat maango, beshak wo tauba qabool karne wala hai (Al-Fath: 3). To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main us mein se sirf wo jaanta hun jo tum kehtey ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"114","Teesri: Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey baad jab us par Iza jaa'a nasrullahi wal fath naazil hui koi namaz nahi padhi magar us mein kehtey they: Tu paak hai ae hamarey Rab aur Teri hamd key sath. Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Sahihain mein aik riwayat mein hai un se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ruku aur sajdey mein kasrat se kehtey they: Tu paak hai ae Allah ae hamarey Rab aur Teri hamd key sath. Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey. Quran ki taaweel kartey huey. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wafaat se pehley kasrat se kehtey they: Tu paak hai ae Allah aur Teri hamd key sath. Main Tujh se maghfirat maangta hun aur Teri taraf tauba karta hun. Aaisha ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye kalimey kya hain jo main tumhey kehtey huey dekhti hun jo tum ne naye nikaaley hain? Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye meri ummat mein alaamat banai gai hai jab main usey dekhun to kahun: Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaey, soorat key aakhir tak. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kasrat se kehtey they: Allah paak hai apni hamd key sath. Main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun aur uski taraf tauba karta hun. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main tumhey dekhti hun ke tum kasrat se kehtey ho: Allah paak hai apni hamd key sath. Main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun aur uski taraf tauba karta hun? To farmaya: Merey Rab ne mujhey khabar di hai ke main anqareeb apni ummat mein alaamat dekhunga. Phir jab main usey dekhun to kasrat se kahun: Allah paak hai apni hamd key sath. Main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun aur uski taraf tauba karta hun. To beshak main ne usey dekha hai: Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaey, Makkah ki fatah. Aur tum logon ko Allah key deen mein giroh giroh dakhil hotey huey dekho. To apne Rab ki hamd key sath tasbeeh karo aur us se maghfirat maango. Beshak wo tauba qabool karne wala hai."
"115","Chauthi: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jall ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wafaat se pehley wahi lagaataar naazil ki, yahan tak ke Aap faut huey jabke wahi sab se zyada thi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"116","Paanchwein: Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har banda us par uthaaya jaeyga jis par wo mara hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"117","Pehli: Abu Zarr Jundab bin Junaada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par imaan lana, aur uskey raastey mein jihad karna. Main ne kaha: Kaun si gardan afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne walon key nazdeek nafees ho, aur jiski qeemat zyada ho. Main ne kaha: Phir agar main na karun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaarigar ki madad karo ya be-hunar key liye banao. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Batao agar main baaz amal se kamzor hun? Aap ne farmaya: Apna shar logon se roko kyonke wo tumhari taraf se tumharey nafs par sadqa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"118","Doosri: Abu Zarr se bhi (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik key har jor par subah sadqa hai. To har tasbeeh sadqa hai, aur har tahmeed sadqa hai, aur har tehleel sadqa hai, aur har takbeer sadqa hai. Aur bhalai ka hukm sadqa hai, aur burai se rokna sadqa hai. Aur iski taraf se do rakaatein kaafi hain jo Chaasht mein padhta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Sulaama seen muhmala key zamma aur laam key takhfeef aur meem key fatha key sath hai: Jor hai."
"119","Teesri Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat key aamaal mujh par pesh kiye gaey, achchhey aur burey. To main ne uskey achchhey aamaal mein paaya: Takleef deh chiz jo raastey se hataai jaati hai. Aur main ne uskey burey aamaal mein paaya: Thook jo masjid mein ho aur dafan na ki jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"120","Chauthi Unhin se: Ke logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Maaldaar ajr ley gaey. Wo namaz padhtey hain jaisa ham padhtey hain, aur rozey rakhtey hain jaisa ham rakhtey hain, aur apne maalon key fazl se sadqa kartey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kya Allah ne tumharey liye wo nahi banaya jis se tum sadqa karo: Beshak har tasbeeh sadqa hai, aur har takbeer sadqa hai, aur har tahmeed sadqa hai, aur har tehleel sadqa hai. Aur bhalai ka hukm sadqa hai, aur burai se rokna sadqa hai, aur tum mein se har aik key aala mein sadqa hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham mein se koi apni khuwahish poori karta hai aur uskey liye us mein ajr hoga?! Aap ne farmaya: Batao agar usey haraam mein rakhta to kya us par bojh hota? To isi tarah jab usey halaal mein rakhta hai to uskey liye ajr hoga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"121","Paanchwein: Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Neki mein se kisi chiz ko haqeer na samjho chaahey apne bhai se khanda peshani se milna ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"122","Chhathi: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein se har jor par har din sadqa hai jis mein suraj tuloo hota hai: Do key darmiyaan insaaf karna sadqa hai. Aur aadmi ki uski sawari mein madad karna, usey us par sawaar karna, ya uskey liye us par uska saamaan uthana sadqa hai. Aur achchhi baat sadqa hai. Aur har qadam key sath jo tum namaz ki taraf chaltey ho sadqa hai. Aur raastey se takleef deh chiz hatana sadqa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ne bhi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki riwayat se riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Aadam mein se har insaan teen sau saath jor par paida kya gaya hai. Phir jo Allah ki takbeer kahey, aur Allah ki hamd karey, aur Allah ki tehleel karey, aur Allah ki tasbeeh karey, aur Allah se maghfirat maangey, aur logon key raastey se pathar ya kaanta ya haddi hataye, ya bhalai ka hukm dey ya burai se rokey, teen sau saath ki ginti mein, to wo shaam karega jabke us ne apne aap ko dozakh se door kar liya hoga."
"123","Solahwein: Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo thandi donon namazein padhey wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"124","Aathwein: Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Musalman aurton! Padosan apni padosan ko haqeer na samjhey chaahey bakri ka khur ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"125","Nawein: Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imaan sattar se kuchh oopar, ya saath se kuchh oopar shaakhein hain: To sab se afzal La ilaha illallah kehna hai, aur sab se adna raastey se takleef deh chiz hatana hai, aur haya imaan ki aik shaakh hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"126","Daswein: Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik martaba aadmi raastey mein chal raha tha aur usey sakht pyaas lagi. To us ne kuen paaya aur us mein utra aur piya. Phir nikla aur achanak kutta haanp raha tha jo pyaas se matti kha raha tha. To us aadmi ne kaha: Beshak is kuttey ko pyaas se wo pahunchi hai jo mujhey pahunchi thi. To wo kuen mein utra aur apna moza paani se bhara, phir usey apne munh key sath pakda yahan tak ke chadha aur kuttey ko pilaaya. To Allah ne usey qabool kya aur usey bakhsh diya. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya hamarey liye jaanwaron mein ajr hai? To farmaya: Har taaza jigar waley mein ajr hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"127","Gyaarahwein: Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne aik aadmi ko dekha jo Jannat mein darakht mein palat raha tha jo us ne raastey ki peeth se kaata tha jo Musalmanon ko takleef deta tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aik aadmi raastey ki peeth par darakht ki tehni par guzra. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main isey Musalmanon se zaroor hataaunga taake wo unhey takleef na dey. To wo Jannat mein dakhil kya gaya. Aur un donon ki aik riwayat mein hai: Aik martaba aadmi raastey mein chal raha tha aur raastey par kaantey ki tehni paai. To usey peechey kya aur Allah ne usey qabool kya aur usey bakhsh diya."
"128","Baaraahwein: Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo wuzu karey aur achchha wuzu karey, phir Juma mein aey aur suney aur khamosh rahey to uskey aur Juma key darmiyaan bakhsh diya jaata hai aur teen din zyada. Aur jo kankari chhooyey to us ne laghv kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"129","Tehraahwein: Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Musalman ya momin banda wuzu karta hai aur apna chehra dhoota hai to uskey chehrey se har khata nikal jaati hai jisey us ne apni aankhon se dekha tha paani key sath, ya paani key aakhri qatrey key sath. Phir jab apne donon paaon dhoota hai to har khata nikal jaati hai jis par uskey donon paaon chaley they paani key sath ya paani key aakhri qatrey key sath, yahan tak ke wo gunaahon se paak nikalta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"130","Chaudahwein: Unhin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch namazein, aur Juma sey Juma tak, aur Ramazan sey Ramazan tak, darmiyaan ka kaffara hain jab kabeera gunaahon se bacha jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"131","Pandrahawein: Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey uski taraf rahnumai na karun jis se Allah khataein mitaata hai aur darjaat buland farmata hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Naapasand par poora wuzu karna, aur masaajid ki taraf kasrat se qadam, aur namaz key baad namaz ka intizaar karna. To wahi sarhad ki hifaazat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"132","Saatwein: Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah ya shaam masjid ki taraf jaey to Allah uskey liye Jannat mein mehmani taiyaar farmata hai jab kabhi subah ya shaam jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"133","Satraahwein: Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab banda beemar ho ya safar karey to uskey liye waisa likha jaata hai jaisa wo muqeem tandrust hokar amal karta tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"134","Atharaahwein: Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har bhalai sadqa hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai, aur Muslim ne Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat se naql kya hai."
"135","Unneeswein: Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman podha lagaey to jo us mein se khaaya jaey wo uskey liye sadqa tha, aur jo us mein se chori kya jaey wo uskey liye sadqa hai, aur usey koi kami nahi karta magar wo uskey liye sadqa tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: To Musalman podha nahi lagaata aur us mein se insaan aur na jaanwar aur na parinda khaata hai magar wo uskey liye qayamat key din tak sadqa tha. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Musalman podha nahi lagaata, aur na kheti karta hai, aur us mein se insaan aur na jaanwar aur na koi chiz khaati hai magar wo uskey liye sadqa thi. Aur un donon ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat se riwayat kya hai."
"136","Beeswein: Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bani Salama ne chaaha ke masjid key qareeb muntaqil hon. To ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Beshak mujhey pahunchi hai ke tum masjid key qareeb muntaqil hona chaahtey ho? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan ya Rasulullah, beshak ham ne ye chaaha hai. To farmaya: Ae Bani Salama! Tumharey ghar tumharey nishaan likhtey hain. Tumharey ghar tumharey nishaan likhtey hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"137","Ikkeswein: Abul Munzir Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi tha jis se zyada door masjid se kisi aadmi ko nahi jaanta tha, aur us se koi namaz nahi chhoot-ti thi. To us se kaha gaya, ya main ne us se kaha: Kaash tum gadha khareed lo jis par andherey mein aur garmi mein sawaar ho. To us ne kaha: Mujhey pasand nahi ke mera ghar masjid key pehlu mein ho. Beshak main chaahta hun ke merey liye masjid ki taraf mera chalna likha jaey, aur mera wapas aana jab main apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas aaun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tumharey liye wo sab jama kar diya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"138","Baaeswein: Abu Muhammad Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaalees khaslatein hain jinki aala bakri ka doodh dena hai. Jo aamil un mein se kisi khaslat par uskey sawaab ki ummeed aur uskey waadey ki tasdeeq key sath amal karey to Allah uskey sabab usey Jannat mein dakhil farmayega. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"139","Taieswein: Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Dozakh se bacho chaahey khajoor key tukdey se. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur un donon ki aik riwayat mein hai un se, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi nahi magar uska Rab us se kalaam farmayega jabke uskey aur uskey darmiyaan tarjumaan nahi hoga. To wo apne daayein dekheyga aur sirf wo dekheyga jo us ne aagey bheja tha. Aur apne baayein dekheyga aur sirf wo dekheyga jo us ne aagey bheja tha. Apne saamney dekheyga aur apne chehrey key saamney dozakh key siwa kuchh nahi dekheyga. Isliye dozakh se bacho chaahey khajoor key tukdey se. Phir jo na paey to achchhi baat key sath."
"140","Chaubeeswein: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah bandey se raazi hota hai ke wo luqma khaey aur us par uski hamd karey, ya ghoont piye aur us par uski hamd karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"141","Pacheeswein: Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Musalman par sadqa hai. Us ne kaha: Batao agar na paey? Aap ne farmaya: Batao agar taqat na rakhey? Aap ne farmaya: Haajatmand be-qaraar ki madad karo. Us ne kaha: Batao agar taqat na rakhey? Aap ne farmaya: Bhalai ka ya khair ka hukm do. Us ne kaha: Batao agar na karey? Aap ne farmaya: Shar se ruko kyonke wo sadqa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"142","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas dakhil huey jabke unkey paas aurat thi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye fulaani hai jo apni namaz ka zikr karti hai. Aap ne farmaya: Ruko, tum par wo hai jitni tum taqat rakhtey ho. Allah ki qasam! Allah nahi uktaata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao. Aur Aap key nazdeek sab se mehboob deen wo tha jis par uska karne wala hamesha rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"143","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Teen giroh Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki azwaaj key gharon ki taraf aey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ibaadat key baarey mein poochhtey they. Phir jab unhey khabar di gai to goya unhon-ne usey kam samjha aur kaha: Ham kahaan aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kahaan, jabke Allah ne Aap key liye Aap ka agla aur peechla gunaah bakhsh diya hai. Un mein se aik ne kaha: Raha main, to main hamesha raat mein namaz padhunga. Aur doosrey ne kaha: Aur main hamesha zamaaney key rozey rakhunga aur iftaar nahi karunga. Aur doosrey ne kaha: Aur main aurton se alag rahunga aur kabhi shaadi nahi karunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas tashreef laey aur farmaya: Kya tum wahi ho jinhon-ne is is tarah kaha?! Khabardaar! Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darne wala aur us se sab se zyada parhezgaar hun. Lekin main rozey rakhta hun aur iftaar karta hun, aur namaz padhta hun aur sota hun, aur aurton se shaadi karta hun. Phir jo meri sunnat se munh pherey wo mujh se nahi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"144","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hadd se badhney waley halaak ho gaey. Aap ne teen martaba kaha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"145","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak deen aasaan hai, aur deen mein sakhti karne wala us par ghaalib nahi aayega magar wo us par ghaalib aa jaeyga. Isliye seedhey raho aur qareeb raho aur khushkhabri do, aur subah aur shaam aur raat key hissey key sath madad lo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Seedhey raho aur qareeb raho aur subah aur shaam jao, aur raat key hissey se. Darmiyaana raasta darmiyaana raasta, pahunch jaogey."
"146","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein dakhil huey aur achanak rassi do sutoonon key darmiyaan bandhi hui thi. To farmaya: Ye rassi kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Zainab ki rassi hai. Phir jab wo sust hoti hai to us se latak jaati hai. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey kholo. Tum mein se har aik apni chusti mein namaz padhey. Phir jab sust ho jaey to so jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"147","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz padhtey huey oonghey to so jaey yahan tak ke us se neend door ho jaey. Kyonke tum mein se jab koi namaz padhta hai jabke wo oongh raha hai to nahi jaanta, shayed wo jaey aur maghfirat maangey aur apne aap ko bura kahey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"148","Abu Abdullah Jabir bin Samura (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namazein padhta tha. To Aap ki namaz darmiyaani thi aur Aap ka khutba darmiyaana tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"149","Abu Juhafa Wahb bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Salmaan aur Abud Darda key darmiyaan bhai chaara karaya. To Salmaan Abud Darda ki ziyaarat key liye aey aur Umm Ad-Darda ko puraney libaas mein dekha. To kaha: Tumhey kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Tumhara bhai Abud Darda duniya mein koi haajat nahi rakhta. To Abud Darda aey aur uskey liye khaana banaya. To us se kaha: Khao kyonke main rozedaar hun. Us ne kaha: Main nahi khaaunga yahan tak ke tum khao. To us ne khaaya. Phir jab raat hui to Abud Darda uthney gaya. To us se kaha: So jao. To wo so gaya. Phir uthney gaya to us se kaha: So jao. Phir jab raat key aakhir mein hua to Salmaan ne kaha: Ab utho. To donon ne namaz padhi. To Salmaan ne us se kaha: Beshak tumharey Rab ka tum par haq hai, aur beshak tumharey nafs ka tum par haq hai, aur tumharey ghar walon ka tum par haq hai. Isliye har haq waley ko uska haq do. To wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se uska zikr kya. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Salmaan ne sach kaha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"150","Abu Muhammad Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar di gai ke main kehta hun: Allah ki qasam! Main din mein rozey rakhunga, aur raat mein qayaam karunga jab tak zinda hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum wahi ho jo ye kehtey ho? To main ne Aap se kaha: Main ne usey kaha hai, merey maa baap tum par qurbaan ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak tum uski taqat nahi rakhtey. Isliye rozey rakho aur iftaar karo, aur so aur utho. Aur maheeney mein teen din rozey rakho kyonke neki das guna hai, aur wo hamesha key rozey ki tarah hai. Main ne kaha: To beshak main us se afzal ki taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: To aik din roza rakho aur do din iftaar karo. Main ne kaha: To beshak main us se afzal ki taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: To aik din roza rakho aur aik din iftaar karo. To wo Dawood (Alehis salaam) ka roza hai, aur wo sab se aetdaal wala roza hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur wo afzal roza hai. To main ne kaha: To beshak main us se afzal ki taqat rakhta hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us se afzal koi nahi. Aur kaash main ne wo teen din qabool kiye hotey jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaye they, wo mujhey merey ghar walon aur maal se zyada mehboob hotey. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Kya tumhey khabar nahi di gai ke tum din mein rozey rakhtey ho aur raat mein qayaam kartey ho? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: To aisa na karo: Rozey rakho aur iftaar karo, aur so aur utho. Kyonke tumharey jism ka tum par haq hai, aur beshak tumhari aankhon ka tum par haq hai, aur beshak tumhari biwi ka tum par haq hai, aur beshak tumharey mehmaan ka tum par haq hai. Aur beshak tumharey liye kaafi hai ke tum har maah mein teen din rozey rakho. Kyonke tumharey liye har neki key badley das guna hain. To wo hamesha key rozey hain. To main ne sakhti ki aur mujh par sakhti ki gai. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main taqat paata hun. Aap ne farmaya: Allah key Nabi Dawood ka roza rakho aur us par zyada na karo. Main ne kaha: Aur Dawood ka roza kya tha? Aap ne farmaya: Aadha zamaana. To Abdullah budhaapey key baad kehtey they: Kaash main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rukhsat qabool ki hoti. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Kya tumhey khabar nahi di gai ke tum hamesha rozey rakhtey ho, aur har raat Quran padhtey ho? To main ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Bas us ne utna kaha aur Aap khamosh rahey. Phir jab (Ramazan ka) maheena dakhil hua to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Beshak tumharey liye har raat itna hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ise poora karo bees raaton mein. Phir jab taqat ho to saat raaton mein. Phir jab us se zyada ki taqat ho to teen raaton mein. Phir jab us se zyada ki taqat ho to usey kabhi na chhoro jo tumhari taqat se zyada ho. Kyonke tumharey liye tumharey nafs ka hissa hai. Aur beshak tumharey liye tumharey ghar walon ka hissa hai. Phir jab tum taqat rakho to Dawood (Alehis salaam) ka roza rakho aur us par zyada na karo."
"151","Abu Ribee Hanzala bin Ar-Rabee Usaidi Kaatib jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key kaatibon mein se aik they, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) mujh se miley aur farmaya: Tum kaisey ho ae Hanzala? Main ne kaha: Hanzala munaafiq ho gaya? Main ne kaha: Hanzala munaafiq ho gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Subhan Allah! Tum kya kehtey ho? Main ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas hotey hain jab Aap hamein Jannat aur dozakh yaad dilaatey hain goya ham aankh se dekhtey hain. Phir jab ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se nikaltey hain to biwiyon aur bachchon aur jaaydaad se miltey hain aur bahut bhool jaatey hain. Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ham is jaisa paatey hain. To main aur Abu Bakr chaley yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas dakhil huey. To main ne kaha: Hanzala munaafiq ho gaya ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur wo kya hai? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham tumharey paas hotey hain jab tum hamein aag aur Jannat yaad dilaatey ho goya aankh se dekhtey hain. Phir jab ham tumharey paas se nikaltey hain to biwiyon aur bachchon aur jaaydaad se miltey hain aur bahut bhool jaatey hain. To Rasulullah ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar tum us par hamesha raho jo tum merey paas hotey ho aur zikr mein, to farishtey tum se tumharey bistaron par aur tumharey raaston mein musafaha karein. Lekin ae Hanzala! Ghadi ghadi. Teen martaba. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"152","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba dey rahey they ke Aap ne khadey huey aadmi ko dekha. To uskey baarey mein poochha aur unhon-ne kaha: Abu Israeel ne nazr maani hai ke wo dhoop mein khada raheyga aur nahi baitheyga, aur na saaya haasil karega aur na kalaam karega, aur roza rakheyga. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey hukm do ke kalaam karey aur saaya haasil karey aur baith-ney aur apna roza poora karey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"153","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo raat mein apne hizb se, ya us mein se kuchh se so jaey aur usey Fajr ki namaz aur Zuhr ki namaz key darmiyaan padhey to uskey liye likha jaeyga goya us ne usey raat mein padha hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"154","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abdullah! Fulaan ki tarah na hona, wo raat mein qayaam karta tha phir us ne raat ka qayaam chhor diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"155","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat ki namaz dard ya ghair ki wjah se faut ho jaati to din mein baarah rakaatein padhtey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"156","To pehli: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey chhoro jis par main ne tumhey chhora hai: Beshak tum se pehley log apne kasrat se sawal karne ki wjah se halaak huey, aur apne ambiya se ikhtilaaf karne ki wjah se. Phir jab main tumhey kisi chiz se mana karun to us se bacho, aur jab tumhey kisi kaam ka hukm dun to us mein se jitna ho sakey karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"157","Doosri: Abu Najeeh Irbaaz bin Saariya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein baleegh waaz farmaya jis se dil laraz gaey aur aankhein beh padhein. To ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Goya ye rukhsat honay waley ka waaz hai, isliye hamein waseeyat karein. Aap ne farmaya: Main tumhey Allah key taqwa ki, aur sun-ney aur itaat karne ki waseeyat karta hun chaahey tum par Habshi ghulaam ameer ho. Aur beshak tum mein se jo zinda raheyga wo bahut ikhtilaaf dekheyga. Isliye tum par meri sunnat aur hidayat paaney waley khulafa ki sunnat laazim hai. Usey daadhon key sath mazboot pakdo. Aur naye ijaad karda umoor se bacho kyonke har bidat gumraahi hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"158","Teesri: Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri tamaam ummat Jannat mein dakhil hogi siwaey uskey jis ne inkaar kya. Kaha gaya: Aur inkaar kaun karega ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Jo meri itaat karey wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga, aur jo meri nafarmaani karey to us ne inkaar kya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"159","Chauthi: Abu Muslim, aur kaha gaya Abu Iyaas Salama bin Amr bin Al-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baayein haath se khaaya. To farmaya: Daayein haath se khao. Us ne kaha: Main taqat nahi rakhta. Aap ne farmaya: Tu taqat na rakh sakey! Usey takabbur key siwa kuchh nahi rokta tha. To us ne usey apne munh ki taraf na uthaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"160","Paanchwein: Abu Abdullah Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum apni safein zaroor seedhi karogey, warna Allah tumharey chehron key darmiyaan mukhaalifat daal dega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari safein seedhi kartey they yahan tak ke goya un se teer seedhey kartey hain. Yahan tak ke jab dekha ke ham ne Aap se samajh liya hai, phir aik din nikley aur khadey huey yahan tak ke takbeer kehney key qareeb they. To Aap ne aik aadmi ko dekha jiska seena saf se baahar tha. To farmaya: Ae Allah key bando! Tum apni safein zaroor seedhi karogey, warna Allah tumharey chehron key darmiyaan mukhaalifat daal dega."
"161","Chhathi: Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Madina mein aik ghar raat mein apne walon par jal gaya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unkey baarey mein khabar di gai to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye aag tumhari dushman hai. Phir jab tum so jao to usey apne oopar se bujha do. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"162","Saatwein: Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak us hidayat aur ilm ki misaal jis key sath Allah ne mujhey bheja hai us baarish ki si hai jo zameen par barsi. To us mein se kuchh zameen achchhi thi jis ne paani qabool kya aur ghass aur bahut sa chara ugaaya. Aur us mein se sakht zameen thi jis ne paani rok liya. To Allah ne us se logon ko faeda pahunchaya. To unhon-ne us se piya aur pilaya aur kheti ki. Aur us mein se doosrey hissey par barsi jo sirf chatyal maidaan thi jo na paani rokti hai aur na ghass ugaati hai. To ye uski misaal hai jo Allah key deen mein samjha, aur usey faeda diya jo Allah ne mujhey dey kar bheja hai. To us ne seekha aur sikhaya. Aur uski misaal hai jo us se sar uthakar na dekhey, aur Allah ki hidayat ko qabool na karey jis key sath main bheja gaya hun. (Muttafaqun aleh). Faqiha qaaf key zamma key sath mashhoor par hai, aur kaha gaya: Uskey kasra key sath, yaani: Faqeeh ho gaya."
"163","Aathwein: Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri aur tumhari misaal us aadmi ki si hai jo aag jalaata hai. To tiddi aur parwaaney us mein giRney lagtey hain jabke wo unhey us se rokta hai. Aur main tumhey dozakh se kamar se pakad raha hun, jabke tum merey haathon se nikal bhaagtey ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"164","Nawein: Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ungliyan aur pyaala chaat-ney ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Beshak tum nahi jaantey ke un mein se kis mein barkat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma giR jaey to usey utha ley aur jo takleef deh chiz us par lagi hai usey door karey, aur usey kha ley, aur usey shaitaan key liye na chhorey, aur apna haath romaal se na ponchhey yahan tak ke apni ungliyan chaat ley. Kyonke wo nahi jaanta ke uskey khaaney ke kis hissey mein barkat hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak shaitaan tum mein se har aik key paas uskey har muamley mein haazir hota hai, yahan tak ke uskey khaaney par haazir hota hai. Phir jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma giR jaey to jo takleef deh chiz us par lagi hai usey door karey, phir usey kha ley, aur usey shaitaan key liye na chhorey."
"165","Daswein: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamarey darmiyaan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) waaz key liye khadey huey aur farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak tum Allah Taala ki taraf nangey paaon nangey badan baghair khatna key jama kiye jaogey, jaisa ham ne pehli makhlooq ko shuru kya ham usey wapas kareingey, ham par waada, beshak ham karne waley hain (Al-Ambiya: 103). Khabardaar! Aur beshak makhlooq mein sab se pehley qayamat key din Ibrahim (Alehis salaam) ko libaas pehnaaya jaeyga. Khabardaar! Aur beshak meri ummat mein se kuchh aadmiyon key sath laaya jaeyga aur unhey baayein taraf ley jaaya jaeyga. To main kahunga: Ae Rab! Merey sahaaba! To kaha jaeyga: Beshak tum nahi jaantey ke unhon-ne tumharey baad kya naya kya. To main kahunga jaisa naik bandey ne kaha: Aur main un par gawaah tha jab tak main un mein tha, uskey qaul tak: Ghaalib hikmat wala (Al-Maaida: 117, 118). To mujh se kaha jaeyga: Beshak wo apni aidiyon par murtad hotey rahey jab se tum un se judaa huey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"166","Gyaarahwein: Abu Saeed Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gulel se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Wo shikaar nahi maarti, aur na dushman ko zakhmi karti hai. Wo to aankh phodti hai, aur daant todti hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"167","Aabis bin Rabee'a se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ko pathar, yaani aswad ko choomtey huey dekha. Aur wo kehtey hain: Beshak main jaanta hun ke tum pathar ho, na faeda pahunchatey ho aur na nuqsaan. Aur agar main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tumhey choomtey huey na dekha hota to main tumhey na choomta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"168","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par naazil hui: Allah key liye hai jo aasmaanon mein hai aur jo zameen mein hai, aur agar tum zaahir karo jo tumharey dilon mein hai ya usey chhupao to Allah tum se uska hisaab leyga, aayat (Al-Baqarah: 283), to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba par mushkil hui. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey, phir ghutnon par jhukey aur kaha: Ae Allah key Rasool! Ham par aamaal mein se wo laazim kya gaya hai jo ham taqat rakhtey hain: Namaz aur jihad aur rozey aur sadqa. Aur tum par ye aayat naazil hui hai aur ham uski taqat nahi rakhtey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum chahtey ho ke kaho jaisa tum se pehley Ahle Kitaab ne kaha tha: Ham ne suna aur nafarmaani ki? Balke kaho: Ham ne suna aur itaat ki, ae hamarey Rab Teri maghfirat aur Teri taraf laut-na hai. Phir jab qaum ne usey padha aur unki zabanein us se narm huein to Allah Taala ne uskey peechey naazil kya: Rasool imaan laya us par jo uski taraf uskey Rab ki taraf se naazil hua aur momin. Sab Allah par aur uskey farishton par aur uski kitaabon par aur uskey Rasoolon par imaan laey. Ham uskey Rasoolon mein se kisi key darmiyaan farq nahi kartey. Aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne suna aur itaat ki, ae hamarey Rab Teri maghfirat aur Teri taraf laut-na hai. Phir jab unhon-ne ye kya to Allah Taala ne usey mansookh kar diya. To Allah Azza wa Jall ne naazil kya: Allah kisi jaan ko takleef nahi deta magar uski wusat key mutabiq. Uskey liye hai jo us ne kamaaya aur us par hai jo us ne kamaaya. Ae hamarey Rab! Hamari pakad na farma agar ham bhoolein ya khata karein. Farmaya: Haan. Ae hamarey Rab! Ham par bojh na daal jaisa Tune un par daala jo ham se pehley they. Farmaya: Haan. Ae hamarey Rab! Ham par wo na laad jo ham taqat nahi rakhtey. Farmaya: Haan. Aur ham se darguzar farma aur hamein bakhsh dey aur ham par rehem farma. Tu hamara maalik hai, isliye kaafir qaum par hamari madad farma. Farmaya: Haan. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"169","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamarey is muamley mein wo naya karey jo us mein se nahi hai to wo radd hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jo aisa amal karey jis par hamara hukm nahi hai to wo radd hai."
"170","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khutba detey they to Aap ki donon aankhein surkh ho jaatin, aur Aap ki awaz buland hoti, aur Aap ka ghussa shadeed hota. Yahan tak ke goya Aap lashkar se daraaney waley hain jo kehtey hain: Subah tumhey paa leyga aur shaam tumhey paa leyga. Aur farmatey: Mujhey aur Qayamat ko in donon ki tarah bheja gaya hai. Aur apni donon ungliyon: Shahadat aur darmiyaani ko milatey. Aur farmatey: Hamd key baad, beshak behtreen baat Allah ki kitaab hai, aur behtreen hidayat Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hidayat hai. Aur badtareen umoor naye ijaad karda hain, aur har bidat gumraahi hai. Phir farmatey: Main har momin key uskey nafs se zyada haqdaar hun. Jo maal chhorey to uskey ghar walon key liye hai. Aur jo qarz ya zaaya honay waley chhorey to merey paas aur mujh par hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Irbaaz bin Saariya (Raziallahu anhu) ki unki peechli hadis Ummeed key baab mein hai Sunnat ki muhaafazat key baarey mein."
"171","Abu Amr Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham din key shuru mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas they. To Aap key paas qaum aai jo nangey thay, cheetey ki khaal ya aba pehney huey they, talwaarein latkaey huey they. Unkey aksar Muzar se they, balke sab Muzar se they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra badal gaya jab Aap ne un mein faqr dekha. To Aap dakhil huey phir nikley. To Bilaal ko hukm diya aur us ne azaan di aur iqaamat kahi. To namaz padhi, phir khutba diya. To farmaya: Ae logon! Apne Rab se daro jis ne tumhey aik jaan se paida kya, aayat key aakhir tak: Beshak Allah tum par nigehbaan hai. Aur doosri aayat jo Hashr key aakhir mein hai: Ae imaan walon! Allah se daro aur har jaan dekhey ke us ne kal key liye kya aagey bheja hai. Aadmi apne deenaar mein se sadqa karey, apne dirham mein se, apne kapdey mein se, apne saa gandum mein se, apne saa khajoor mein se, yahan tak ke farmaya: Chaahey khajoor key tukdey se. To Ansaar mein se aik aadmi thaili ley kar aaya jis se uski hatheli aajiz thi, balke aajiz ho chuki thi. Phir log lagataar aey yahan tak ke main ne khaaney aur kapdon key do dher dekhey. Yahan tak ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra dekha ke wo khil raha hai goya sona hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein achchhi sunnat jaari karey to uskey liye uska ajr hai, aur uskey baad us par amal karne waley ka ajr hai, baghair iskey ke unkey ajron mein se kuchh kami ho. Aur jo Islam mein buri sunnat jaari karey to us par uska bojh hoga aur uskey baad us par amal karne waley ka bojh hoga, baghair iskey ke unkey bojhon mein se kuchh kami ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"172","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi jaan zulm se qatl nahi ki jaati magar Aadmi key pehley betey par uskey khoon mein se hissa hai, kyonke wo sab se pehla tha jis ne qatl ki sunnat jaari ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"173","Abu Masood Uqba bin Amr Ansaari Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhalai ki taraf rahnumai karey to uskey liye karne waley key ajr jaisa hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"174","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hidayat ki taraf bulayega to uskey liye uski pairwi karne walon key ajron jaisa ajr hoga, us se unkey ajron mein kuchh kami nahi hogi. Aur jo gumraahi ki taraf bulayega to us par uski pairwi karne walon key gunaahon jaisa bojh hoga, us se unkey gunaahon mein kuchh kami nahi hogi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"175","Abbas Sehel bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar key din farmaya: Main kal jhanda us aadmi ko dunga jiskey haathon par Allah fatah dega. Wo Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat karta hai, aur Allah aur uskey Rasool us se mohabbat kartey hain. To log raat bhar behes kartey rahey ke un mein se kisko diya jaeyga. Phir jab logon ne subah ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey: Sab ummeed rakhtey they ke usey diya jaeyga. To farmaya: Ali bin Abi Taalib kahaan hain? To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Wo apni aankhon ki shikayat kartey hain. Aap ne farmaya: To unki taraf bhejo. To wo laey gaey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki donon aankhon mein thooka aur unkey liye dua ki. To wo achchhey ho gaey yahan tak ke goya un mein dard nahi tha. To unhey jhanda diya. To Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main un se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo hamarey jaisey ho jaein? To farmaya: Apni raftar par aahista chalo yahan tak ke unkey maidaan mein utro. Phir unhey Islam ki dawat do, aur unhey khabar do ke us mein Allah Taala ka jo haq hai wo un par hai. Allah ki qasam! Agar Allah tumharey zariye aik aadmi ko hidayat dey to wo tumharey liye surkh oonton se behtar hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"176","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Aslam ka aik ladka aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ghazwa ka irada rakhta hun aur merey paas wo nahi hai jis se main taiyaari karun? Aap ne farmaya: Fulaan key paas jao kyonke wo taiyaar hua tha phir beemar ho gaya. To wo uskey paas aaya aur us se kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey salaam kehtey hain aur farmatey hain: Mujhey wo dey do jo tum ne taiyaar kya tha. To us ne kaha: Ae fulaani! Usey dey do jo tum ne taiyaar kya tha, aur us mein se kuchh na rokna. Allah ki qasam! Us mein se kuchh na rokna taake tumharey liye us mein barkat ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"177","Abu Abdur Rahman Zaid bin Khaalid Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key raastey mein ghazwa karne waley ko taiyaar karey to us ne ghazwa kya. Aur jo ghazwa karne waley key peechey uskey ghar walon mein bhalai key sath khalifa bano to us ne ghazwa kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"178","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Huzail mein se Bani Lahyaan ki taraf lashkar bheja aur farmaya: Har do aadmiyon mein se aik nikley, aur ajr un donon key darmiyaan hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"179","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Rauha mein sawaron se mulaqaat hui. To farmaya: Qaum kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Musalman. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum kaun ho? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key Rasool. To Aap ki taraf aik aurat ne bachcha uthaya aur kaha: Kya iskey liye Hajj hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur tumharey liye ajr hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"180","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amaanatdaar Musalman khazaaanchi jo wo naafiz karta hai jiska usey hukm diya gaya hai. To usey poora bharpoor deta hai, jabke uska dil us se khush hai. To usey uskey supurd karta hai jiskey liye usey hukm diya gaya hai, sadqa karne walon mein se aik hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"181","To pehli: Abu Ruqayya Tameem bin Aus Daari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deen khairkhwahi hai. Ham ne kaha: Kiski? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key liye aur uski kitaab key liye aur uskey Rasool key liye aur Musalmanon key imaamon key liye aur unkey aam logon key liye. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"182","Doosri: Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se namaz qaim karne par, aur zakaat dene par, aur har Musalman ki khairkhwahi par baiyat ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"183","Teesri: Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi imaan nahi laata yahan tak ke apne bhai key liye wahi pasand karey jo apne liye pasand karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"184","To pehli: Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo tum mein se burai dekhey to usey apne haath se badal dey. Phir agar taqat na rakhey to apni zabaan key sath. Phir agar taqat na rakhey to apne dil key sath, aur wo imaan mein sab se kamzor hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"185","Doosri: Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne mujh se pehley kisi ummat mein jo Nabi bheja uskey liye uski ummat mein se hawari aur sahaaba hotey they jo uski sunnat ko letey they aur uskey hukm ki pairwi kartey they. Phir unkey baad naakhalf aatey hain jo kehtey hain jo wo nahi kartey, aur kartey hain jiska unhey hukm nahi diya jaata. Phir jo un se apne haath key sath jihad karey wo momin hai. Aur jo un se apne dil key sath jihad karey wo momin hai. Aur jo un se apni zabaan key sath jihad karey wo momin hai. Aur uskey peechey raai key daaney barabar imaan nahi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"186","Teesri: Abul Waleed Ubaada bin As-Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se tangi aur kushadgi mein, aur chusti aur susti mein sun-ney aur itaat karne par baiyat ki. Aur ham par tarjeeh par. Aur is par ke ham muamley walon se muamla nahi chheeneingey magar ye ke tum kufr-e-bawaah dekho jiska tumharey paas Allah Taala ki taraf se daleel ho. Aur is par ke ham haq kahein jahaan bhi hon, Allah mein malaamat karne waley ki malaamat se na darein. (Muttafaqun aleh). Almunshit wal mukrah apne donon meemon key fatha key sath hain, yaani: Aasaani aur mushkil mein. Walasrah maal-e-mushtarak mein khusoosiyat hai, aur uska bayaan guzar chuka hai. Bawaahan ba muwahhada key fatha key baad waao phir alif phir ha muhmala key sath hai, yaani zaahir jo taaweel ka ehtimaal na rakhta ho."
"187","Chauthi: Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki hudood par qaim rehne waley aur un mein padney waley ki misaal us qaum ki si hai jo kashti par qura andaazi karein. To baaz uskey oopar hon aur baaz uskey neechey hon. Aur jo neechey hon wo jab paani letey hain to un par guzartey hain jo oopar hain. To wo kehtey hain: Kaash ham apne hissey mein suraakh kar lein aur unhey takleef na dein jo hamarey oopar hain. Phir agar wo unhey chhor dein aur jo wo chaahtey hain, to wo halaak hon aur sab halaak hon. Aur agar wo unkey haath pakdein to wo nijaat paaein aur sab nijaat paaein. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"188","Paanchwein: Ummul Momineen Umm Salama Hind bint Abi Umayya Huzaifa (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum par ameer muqarrar kiye jaengey aur tum pehchaanogey aur inkaar karogey. Phir jo napasand karey to wo bari ho gaya. Aur jo inkaar karey to wo mehfooz raha. Lekin jo raazi ho aur pairwi karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham un se qitaal na karein? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, jab tak wo tum mein namaz qaim karein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"189","Chhathi: Ummul Momineen Umm Al-Hakam Zainab bint Jahsh (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas ghabrahat mein dakhil huey aur farmatey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi. Arab key liye us shar se kharaabi hai jo qareeb aa gaya hai. Aaj Yaajooj aur Maajooj ki deewaar mein se is jaisa khola gaya hai. Aur apni donon ungliyon: Angootha aur uskey peechey wali key sath halqa banaya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham halaak hongey jabke hamarey darmiyaan naik log hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, jab khabaasat zyada ho jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"190","Saatwein: Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raaston mein baith-ney se bacho. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamarey liye hamari majlison se bachna nahi hai, ham us mein baat kartey hain! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir agar tum majlis key siwa nahi maantey to raastey ko uska haq do. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur raastey ka haq kya hai ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Nigaah neechey karna, aur takleef rokna, aur salaam ka jawab dena, aur bhalai ka hukm, aur burai se rokna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"191","Aathwein: Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi key haath mein soney ki angoothi dekhi. To usey utaara aur phenk diya aur farmaya: Tum mein se koi aag key angaarey ka qasad karta hai aur usey apne haath mein rakhta hai! Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaley gaey to us aadmi se kaha gaya: Apni angoothi lo aur us se faeda uthayo. Us ne kaha: Nahi Allah ki qasam! Main usey kabhi nahi lunga jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey phenk diya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"192","Nawein: Abu Saeed Hasan Basri se riwayat hai ke Aa'iz bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) Ubaidullah bin Ziyaad key paas dakhil huey aur farmaya: Ae merey betey! Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak badtareen charwaahey zulm karne waley hain. Isliye bacho ke tum un mein se ho. To us ne us se kaha: Baitho, kyonke tum to Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba key bhoosey mein se ho. To us ne kaha: Aur kya un mein bhoosa tha? Bhoosa to unkey baad aur unkey siwa mein tha! Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"193","Daswein: Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum zaroor bhalai ka hukm dogey, aur burai se rokogey, warna anqareeb Allah tum par apni taraf se azaab bhejega. Phir tum us se dua maangogey aur tumharey liye qabool nahi ki jaeygi. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"194","Gyaarahwein: Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Afzal jihad zaalim sultaan key paas insaaf ki baat hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"195","Baaraahwein: Abu Abdullah Taariq bin Shihaab Bajali Ahmasi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha jabke us ne apna paaon rakaab mein rakha tha: Kaun sa jihad afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Zaalim sultaan key paas haq baat. Ise Nasaai ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"196","Tehraahwein: Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehley jo kami Bani Israeel mein dakhil hui wo ye thi ke aadmi aadmi se milta tha aur kehta tha: Ae fulaan! Allah se daro aur jo kartey ho chhor do kyonke wo tumharey liye halaal nahi hai. Phir agley din us se milta tha jabke wo apni haalat par tha. To wo usey nahi rokta tha ke uska khaaney wala aur peeney wala aur baith-ney wala ho. Phir jab unhon-ne ye kya to Allah ne baaz key dilon ko baaz key sath maar diya. Phir farmaya: Jin logon ne Bani Israeel mein se kufr kya un par Dawood aur Eesa Ibn Maryam ki zabaan se laanat ki gai, is sabab key jo unhon-ne nafarmaani ki aur wo hadd se badhtey they. Wo us burai se nahi roktey they jo wo kartey they, wo bura tha jo wo kartey they. Tum un mein se bahut ko dekhtey ho jo kufr karne walon se dosti rakhtey hain, bura hai jo unkey nafs ne unkey liye aagey bheja hai, uskey qaul tak: Nafarmaan hain (Al-Maaida: 78, 81). Phir farmaya: Hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! Tum zaroor bhalai ka hukm dogey aur burai se rokogey. Aur zaalim ka haath zaroor pakdogey aur usey haq par zaroor modogey, aur usey haq par zaroor rokogey. Warna Allah tumharey baaz key dilon ko baaz par zaroor maarega, phir tum par zaroor laanat farmayega jaisa un par laanat ki. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Ye Abu Dawud ka lafz hai, aur Tirmizi ka lafz hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Bani Israeel gunaahon mein mubtala huey to unkey ulema ne unhey mana kya aur wo baaz na aey. To wo unkey sath unki majlison mein baithey aur unkey sath khaaya aur piya. To Allah ne baaz key dilon ko baaz key sath maar diya, aur un par Dawood aur Eesa Ibn Maryam ki zabaan se laanat ki, is sabab key jo unhon-ne nafarmaani ki aur wo hadd se badhtey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith gaey, jabke Aap tek lagaey huey they. To farmaya: Nahi, us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Yahan tak ke tum unhey haq par modogey. Uska qaul taaturoohum yaani unhey modogey. Wala taqsurunnahu yaani unhey rokogey."
"197","Chaudahwein: Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ae logon! Beshak tum ye aayat padhtey ho: Ae imaan walon! Tum par tumhari jaanein hain, tumhey wo nuqsaan nahi pahunchayega jo gumraah hua jab tum hidayat paa gaey (Al-Maaida: 105). Aur beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak log jab zaalim ko dekhein aur uska haath na pakdein to qareeb hai ke Allah unhey apni taraf se azaab mein aam kar dey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi aur Nasaai ne sahih asaneed se riwayat kya hai."
"198","Abu Zaid Usaama bin Zaid bin Haarisa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qayamat key din aadmi laaya jaeyga aur dozakh mein daala jaeyga. To uskey pait ki aantein nikal aaengi aur wo unkey sath ghoomega jaisa gadha chakki mein ghoomta hai. To dozakh waley uskey paas jama hongey aur kaheingey: Ae fulaan! Tumhey kya hai? Kya tum bhalai ka hukm nahi detey they aur burai se nahi roktey they? To wo kaheyga: Kyun nahi, main bhalai ka hukm deta tha aur usey nahi karta tha. Aur burai se rokta tha aur usey karta tha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Uska qaul tandaliq daal muhmala key sath hai, aur iskey maana hain: Nikalti hain. Walaqtaab aantein hain, uska waahid qatab hai."
"199","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munaafiq ki nishaani teen hain: Jab baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab waada karey to khilaaf karey, aur jab usey amaanat di jaey to khayaanat karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"200","Huzaifa bin Al-Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein do hadis bayan kein jin mein se aik main ne dekh li hai, aur doosri ka intizaar karta hun: Hamein khabar di ke amaanat aadmiyon key dilon ki jad mein naazil hui. Phir Quran naazil hua aur unhon-ne Quran se seekha, aur sunnat se seekha. Phir hamein amaanat key uthney key baarey mein khabar di aur farmaya: Aadmi neend soyega aur amaanat uskey dil se qabz ki jaeygi. To uska asar nishaan ki tarah raheyga. Phir aadmi neend soyega aur amaanat uskey dil se qabz ki jaeygi. To uska asar phaale ki tarah raheyga, jaisa angaara jo tum ne apne paaon par ludhka diya. To phoola aur tum usey ubhra hua dekhtey ho jabke us mein kuchh nahi hai. Phir Aap ne kankari li aur usey apne paaon par ludhka diya. To log subah kartey hain aur khareed o farokht kartey hain. To shayed hi koi amaanat ada karey yahan tak ke kaha jaeyga: Beshak Bani fulaan mein amaantdaar aadmi hai. Yahan tak ke aadmi key liye kaha jaeyga: Wo kitna mazboot hai, kitna hoshiyaar hai, kitna aqalmand hai! Jabke uskey dil mein raai key daaney barabar imaan nahi hai. Aur beshak mujh par zamaana aaya hai aur mujhey parwah nahi thi ke tum mein se kissey baiyat karun. Agar wo Musalman hota to uska deen usey meri taraf wapas karta. Aur agar wo Nasraani ya Yahoodi hota to uska kaarinda usey meri taraf wapas karta. Aur raha aaj to main tum mein se fulaan aur fulaan key siwa kissey baiyat nahi karta tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"201","Huzaifa aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Tabaarak wa Taala logon ko jama farmayega. To momin khadey hongey yahan tak ke unkey liye Jannat qareeb ki jaeygi. To wo Aadam (Alaihis salaam) key paas aaengey aur kaheingey: Ae hamarey waalid! Hamarey liye Jannat khulwaein. To wo kaheingey: Kya tumhey Jannat se tumharey waalid ki khata key siwa kuchh ney nikaala! Main iska ahel nahi hun. Merey betey Ibrahim jo Allah key khaleel hain, key paas jao. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo Ibrahim key paas aaengey. To Ibrahim kaheingey: Main iska ahel nahi hun. Musa key paas jao jis se Allah ne kalaam kya. To wo Musa key paas aaengey. To wo kaheingey: Main iska ahel nahi hun. Eesa jo Allah ka kalima aur uski rooh hain, key paas jao. To Eesa kaheingey: Main iska ahel nahi hun. To wo Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaengey. To wo khadey hongey aur unhey ijazat di jaeygi. Aur amaanat aur rishta bhejey jaengey aur wo pul key donon kinaron par daayein aur baayein khadey hongey. To tum mein se pehla bijli ki tarah guzrega. Main ne kaha: Merey maa baap tum par qurbaan, bijli ki tarah guzarna kya chiz hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke wo kaisey jaati hai aur palak jhapakney mein wapas aati hai? Phir hawa ki tarah, phir parindey ki tarah. Aur aadmiyon ko tez unkey aamaal daudaengey. Aur tumharey Nabi pul par khadey farmatey hongey: Ae Rab! Salaamti salaamti. Yahan tak ke bandon key aamaal aajiz ho jaengey. Yahan tak ke aadmi aayega jo chalney ki taqat nahi rakhta magar ghisat kar. Aur pul key donon kinaaron mein latki hui kaanTeydaar salaahein hongey jinhey uska hukm diya gaya hai jisey pakadne ka unhey hukm diya gaya hai. To zakhmi nijaat paaney wala, aur dozakh mein giRaaya hua. Aur us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Abu Hurairah ki jaan hai! Beshak dozakh ki gehrai sattar saal hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"202","Abu Khubaib, kha muqta muqta key zamma key sath, Abdullah bin Az-Zubair (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Zubair Jamal key din khadey huey to mujhey bulaaya aur main unkey pehlu mein khada hua. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey betey! Aaj sirf zaalim ya mazloom qatl hoga. Aur beshak main apne aap ko aaj mazloom qatl honay wala hi dekhta hun. Aur beshak merey sab se badey fikr mein se mera qarz hai. To kya tum dekhtey ho ke hamara qarz hamarey maal mein se kuchh baqi rakheyga? Phir kaha: Ae merey betey! Hamara maal baicho aur mera qarz ada karo. Aur tihaai ki waseeyat ki aur uska tihaai uskey beton key liye, yaani Abdullah bin Az-Zubair key beton key liye tihaai ka tihaai. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir agar hamarey maal mein se qarz ada karne key baad kuchh fazl ho to uska tihaai tumharey beton key liye hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Hishaam ne kaha: Aur Abdullah ki baaz aulaad Bani Az-Zubair key baaz key barabar thi, Khubaib aur Abbaad. Aur us din uskey nau betey aur nau betiyan thein. Abdullah ne kaha: To wo mujhey apne qarz ki waseeyat karne lagey aur kehtey they: Ae merey betey! Agar tum us mein se kisi chiz se aajiz hojao to us par apne Maalik se madad lo. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi jaanta tha wo kya chahtey they yahan tak ke main ne kaha: Ae merey waalid! Tumhara Maalik kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main uskey qarz ki kisi museebat mein nahi pada magar main ne kaha: Ae Zubair key Maalik! Uskey qarz ko ada farma. To wo usey ada farmata tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Zubair qatl kiye gaey aur unhon-ne deenaar aur na dirham chhora siwaey zameenon key. Un mein se Ghaabah aur Madina mein gyaarah ghar, aur Basra mein do ghar, aur Kufa mein ghar aur Misr mein ghar. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur uska qarz jo us par tha wo tha ke aadmi uskey paas maal key sath aata tha aur usey uskey paas amaanat rakhta tha. To Zubair kehtey they: Nahi, lekin wo qarz hai, beshak main uskey zaaya honay ka khauf karta hun. Aur unhon-ne kabhi imaarat ki wilayat nahi ki aur na mahsool aur na khiraaj aur na kuchh, siwaey iskey ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwey mein hon, ya Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Usman (Raziallahu anhum) key sath. Abdullah ne kaha: To main ne hisaab kya jo us par qarz mein tha aur usey bees laakh paaya! To Hakeem bin Hizaam Abdullah bin Az-Zubair se miley aur kaha: Ae merey bhatijey! Merey bhai par kitna hai? Abdullah ne kaha: Aur us ne usey chhupaaya. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi dekhta ke tumharey maal usey ada kareingey. To Abdullah ne us se kaha: Kya tum dekhtey ho agar wo chaalees laakh hon? Hakeem ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi dekhta ke tum taqat rakho. To Muawiya ne kaha: Kya tum dekhtey ho agar wo chaalees laakh hon? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne unhey baicha aur qarz ada kya. Phir jo baqi raha usey waarison key darmiyaan taqseem kya. To Zubair key beton mein se har betey key liye chaalees laakh huey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"203","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zulm se daro, kyonke zulm qayamat key din andherey hongey. Aur kanjoosi se daro kyonke kanjoosi ne unhey halaak kya jo tum se pehley they. Us ne unhey is par ubhara ke wo apne khoon bahaein aur apni hurmaton ko halaal karein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"204","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat key din huqooq unkey walon ko diye jaengey yahan tak ke baghair seengon wali bakri key liye seengon wali bakri se badla liya jaeyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"205","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Hajjatul Wada key baarey mein baat kartey they jabke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey darmiyaan they, aur ham nahi jaantey they ke Hajjatul Wada kya hai. Yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd ki aur uski sana ki. Phir Masih Dajjaal ka zikr kya aur uskey zikr mein taveel kya. Aur farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne apni ummat ko us se daraaya: Nooh ne us se daraaya aur uskey baad Nabiyon ne. Aur beshak agar wo tum mein nikley to uskey muamley mein jo tum par chhupa hai wo tum par chhupa nahi raheyga. Beshak tumhara Rab kaana nahi hai, aur beshak wo daayein aankh se kaana hai, goya uski aankh ubhra hua angoor hai. Khabardaar! Beshak Allah ne tum par tumharey khoon aur maal haraam kiye hain, jaisa tumharey is din ki hurmat hai, tumharey is sheher mein, tumharey is maheeney mein. Khabardaar! Kya main ne pahunchaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Gawaah reh, teen martaba. Tum par kharaabi, ya afsos, dekho, merey baad kaafir hokar wapas na laut-na ke baaz baaz ki gardaney maarney lago. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai, aur Muslim ne baaz hissa riwayat kya hai."
"206","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo baalisht bhar zameen zulm se ley to usey saat zameenon tak tauq pehnaaya jaeyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"207","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah zaalim ko mohlat deta hai. Phir jab usey pakadta hai to usey nahi chhorta. Phir padha: Aur isi tarah tumharey Rab ki pakad hai jab wo bastiyon ko pakadta hai jabke wo zaalim hain. Beshak uski pakad dardnaak sakht hai (Hood: 102). (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"208","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey bheja aur farmaya: Beshak tum Ahle Kitaab ki qaum key paas jaatey ho. To unhey dawat do ke gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur main Allah ka Rasool hun. Phir agar wo iskey liye itaat karein to unhey khabar do ke Allah ne un par har din raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain. Phir agar wo iskey liye itaat karein to unkey umda maalon se bacho. Aur mazloom ki baddua se daro kyonke uskey aur Allah key darmiyaan parda nahi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"209","Abu Humaid Abdur Rahman bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim ne Azd mein se aik aadmi ko aamil banaya jisey Ibn Al-Lutbiya kaha jaata hai sadqa par. Phir jab wo aaya to us ne kaha: Ye tumharey liye hai, aur ye mujhey tohfey mein diya gaya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimbar par khadey huey aur Allah ki hamd ki aur uski sana ki. Phir farmaya: Hamd key baad, beshak main tum mein se aadmi ko us kaam par aamil banaata hun jis par Allah ne mujhey waali banaaya hai. To wo aata hai aur kehta hai: Ye tumharey liye hai, aur ye tohfa hai jo mujhey diya gaya hai. To kya wo apne waalid aur walida key ghar mein nahi baitha yahan tak ke uskey paas uska tohfa aey agar wo sachcha hai? Allah ki qasam! Tum mein se koi koi chiz naq haq key baghair nahi leyga magar wo Allah Taala se milega jabke wo usey qayamat key din uthaye huey hoga. Isliye main tum mein se kisi ko na pehchaanun ke wo Allah se miley jabke wo oont uthaye huey hai jiski awaz hai, ya gaay jiski awaz hai, ya bakri jo cheekhti hai. Phir apne donon haath uthayein yahan tak ke Aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi gai. To farmaya: Ae Allah! Kya main ne pahunchaya? Teen martaba. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"210","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jiskey paas apne bhai ki zulm ho, uski izzat mein se ya kisi chiz mein se, to wo us se aaj maafi maangey is se pehley ke deenaar aur na dirham ho. Agar uskey paas naik amal hoga to us mein se uski zulm key barabar liya jaeyga. Aur agar uskey paas nekiyan nahi hongi to uskey saathi ki buraiyon mein se liya jaeyga aur us par daala jaeyga. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"211","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman wo hai jiski zabaan aur haath se Musalman mehfooz rahein. Aur muhaajir wo hai jo usey chhor dey jis se Allah ne mana farmaya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"212","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key bojh par aik aadmi tha jisey Karkara kaha jaata tha. To wo mar gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo dozakh mein hai. To wo usey dekhney gaey aur usey abaaya paaya jo us ne khayaanat ki thi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"213","Abu Bakra Nufai bin Al-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak zamaana ghoom kar waisa ho gaya hai jaisa us din tha jab Allah ne aasmaanon aur zameen ko paida kya tha: Saal baarah maheena hai, un mein se chaar hurmat waley hain: Teen lagataar hain: Zul Qaada, aur Zul Hijja, aur Muharram, aur Rajab Muzar jo Jumaada aur Shaabaan key darmiyaan hai. Ye kaun sa maheena hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. To Aap khamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap usey uskey naam key siwa naam se pukaareingey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye Zul Hijja nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To ye kaun sa sheher hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. To Aap khamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap usey uskey naam key siwa naam se pukaareingey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye Balda nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To ye kaun sa din hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. To Aap khamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap usey uskey naam key siwa naam se pukaareingey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye Yaumun Nahr nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak tumharey khoon aur tumharey maal aur tumhari izzatein tum par haraam hain, jaisa tumharey is din ki hurmat hai tumharey is sheher mein tumharey is maheeney mein. Aur tum anqareeb apne Rab se milogey aur wo tum se tumharey aamaal key baarey mein poochheyga. Khabardaar! Merey baad kaafir hokar wapas na laut-na ke baaz baaz ki gardaney maarney lago. Khabardaar! Haazir ghaaib ko pahunchaye. Shayad baaz jisey pahunchaya jaey wo baaz sun-ney waley se zyada yaad rakhne wala ho. Phir farmaya: Khabardaar! Kya main ne pahunchaya? Khabardaar! Kya main ne pahunchaya? Ham ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Gawaah reh. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"214","Abu Umama Iyaas bin Saalaba Haarithi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni qasam key sath kisi Musalman aadmi ka haq kaat ley to Allah ne uskey liye dozakh waajib kar di hai, aur us par Jannat haraam kar di hai. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Chaahey wo mamuli chiz ho ya Rasulullah? To farmaya: Chaahey araak ki tehni ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"215","Adi Ibn Umaira (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jisey ham tum mein se kisi kaam par aamil banaein aur wo ham se sui ya us se oopar chhupaye to wo khayaanat hogi jisey wo qayamat key din ley kar aayega. To Ansaar mein se kaala aadmi uski taraf khada hua, goya main usey dekhta hun. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujh se apna kaam wapas lo. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhey kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main ne tumhey is is tarah kehtey huey suna hai. Aap ne farmaya: Aur main ab kehta hun: Jisey ham kaam par aamil banaein to wo thoda aur zyada ley kar aey. To jo us mein se usey diya jaey wo ley, aur jis se usey mana kya jaey us se ruk jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"216","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Khaibar ka din hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se giroh aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Fulaan shaheed hai, aur fulaan shaheed hai. Yahan tak ke wo aik aadmi par guzrey aur unhon-ne kaha: Fulaan shaheed hai. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hargiz nahi, beshak main ne usey dozakh mein dekha hai chaadar mein jis mein us ne khayaanat ki thi, ya abaaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"217","Abu Qatada Al-Haaris bin Ribee (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke wo un mein khadey huey. To unhey khabar di ke Allah key raastey mein jihad, aur Allah par imaan afzal aamaal hain. To aik aadmi khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Batao agar main Allah key raastey mein qatl kya jaun to kya meri khataein mita di jaengi? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Haan agar tum Allah key raastey mein qatl kiye jao jabke tum sabr karne waley sawaab ki ummeed rakhne waley aagey badhney waley peeth na pherne waley ho. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne kaisey kaha? Us ne kaha: Batao agar main Allah key raastey mein qatl kya jaun to kya meri khataein mita di jaengi? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan jabke tum sabr karne waley sawaab ki ummeed rakhne waley aagey badhney waley peeth na pherne waley ho, siwaey qarz key kyonke Jibraeel ne mujh se ye kaha hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"218","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum jaantey ho muflis kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Hamarey darmiyaan muflis wo hai jiska dirham nahi hai aur na saamaan. To farmaya: Beshak meri ummat ka muflis wo hai jo qayamat key din namaz aur rozey aur zakaat key sath aayega. Aur wo aayega jabke us ne isey gaali di thi, aur is par tohmat lagai thi, aur iska maal khaaya tha, aur iska khoon bahaaya tha, aur isey maara tha. To isey uski nekiyon mein se diya jaeyga, aur isey uski nekiyon mein se diya jaeyga. Phir agar uskey zimma jo hai poora honay se pehley uski nekiyan khatm ho gaein to unki khataon mein se liya jaeyga aur us par daala jaeyga, phir wo dozakh mein phenka jaeyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"219","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun, aur beshak tum merey paas jhagda lekar aatey ho. Aur shayed tum mein se baaz apni hujjat mein baaz se zyada tez ho. To main uskey liye faisla karta hun jo main sunta hun. Phir jiskey liye main uskey bhai key haq mein faisla karun to wo uskey liye dozakh ka tukda kaat-ta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"220","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin apne deen mein kushadgi mein rehta hai jab tak wo haraam khoon na bahaey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"221","Khaula bint Aamir Ansaari, jo Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi hain (Raziallahu anha), se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak kuchh aadmi Allah key maal mein naq haq key sath tasarruf kartey hain. To unkey liye qayamat key din dozakh hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"222","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin momin key liye imaarat ki tarah hai, jiska baaz baaz ko mazboot karta hai. Aur apni ungliyon key darmiyaan milaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"223","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamari masaajid mein se kisi mein, ya hamarey bazaaron mein guzrey jabke uskey sath teer hon to usey pakadey, ya apni hatheli key sath uskey phal ko pakadey ke Musalmanon mein se kisi ko us mein se kisi chiz key sath na lagey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"224","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mominon ki misaal unki muhabbat aur rehem aur shafqat mein jism ki si hai: Jab us mein se aik jorr beemar ho to baqi jism uskey liye bedaari aur bukhaar key sath pukarta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"225","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim ne Hasan bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) ko chooma jabke Aap key paas Aqra bin Haabis tha. To Aqra ne kaha: Beshak merey das betey hain, main ne un mein se kisi ko nahi chooma. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski taraf dekha aur farmaya: Jo rehem nahi karta us par rehem nahi kya jaata. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"226","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Dehaatiyon mein se log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum apne bachchon ko choomtey ho? To farmaya: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Lekin ham Allah ki qasam nahi choomtey! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ya main maalik hun agar Allah ne tumharey dilon se rehmat chheen li hai? (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"227","Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon par rehem nahi karta us par Allah rehem nahi farmata. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"228","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi logon ko namaz padhaye to halki karey. Kyonke un mein kamzor aur beemar aur boodha hai. Aur jab apne liye padhey to jitna chaahey lambi karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"229","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) amal chhor detey they jabke Aap pasand farmatey they ke us par amal karein, is khauf se ke log us par amal karein aur un par farz kar diya jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"230","Unhin se (Raziallahu anha) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey bisaal se mana farmaya rehem ki wjah se. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tum bisaal rakhtey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhari haalat jaisa nahi hun. Beshak main raat guzaarta hun jabke mera Rab mujhey khilaata aur pilaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Iskey maana hain: Wo mujh mein khaaney aur peeney walon ki quwwat rakhta hai."
"231","Abu Qatada Al-Haaris bin Ribee (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main namaz key liye khada hota hun aur usey lambi karna chaahta hun. Phir bachchey ka rona sunta hun. To apni namaz mein kami karta hun is naapasandgi se ke uski maa par mushkil karun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"232","Jundab bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Subah ki namaz padhey wo Allah key zimma mein hai. Isliye Allah tum se apne zimma mein se kisi chiz ka mutaaliba na karey. Kyonke jo us se uskey zimma mein se kisi chiz ka mutaaliba karega to wo usey paa leyga, phir usey uskey chehrey par dozakh ki aag mein undha deyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"233","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai. Wo us par zulm nahi karta, aur na usey ruswa karta hai. Jo apne bhai ki haajat mein ho Allah uski haajat mein hoga. Aur jo Musalman se museebat door karey to Allah us se uskey sabab qayamat key din ki museebaton mein se museebat door farmayega. Aur jo Musalman ka parda rakhey to Allah qayamat key din uska parda rakheyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"234","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai. Wo us se khayaanat nahi karta aur na us se jhoot bolta hai aur na usey ruswa karta hai. Har Musalman doosrey Musalman par haraam hai: Uski izzat aur uska maal aur uska khoon. Taqwa yahaan hai. Aadmi key liye shar se yehi kaafi hai ke wo apne Musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"235","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasad na karo, aur boli na badhao, aur bughz na rakho, aur peeth na phero, aur tum mein se koi doosrey key sauda par sauda na karey. Aur Allah key bando bhai bhai hojao. Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai: Wo us par zulm nahi karta aur na usey haqeer samajhta hai, aur na usey ruswa karta hai. Taqwa yahaan hai, aur apne seeney ki taraf teen martaba ishara farmaya. Aadmi key liye shar se yehi kaafi hai ke wo apne Musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhey. Har Musalman doosrey Musalman par haraam hai: Uska khoon aur uska maal aur uski izzat. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"236","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Tum mein se koi imaan nahi laata yahan tak ke apne bhai key liye wahi pasand karey jo apne liye pasand karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"237","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki madad karo chaahey zaalim ho ya mazloom. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main uski madad karunga jab wo mazloom ho. Batao agar wo zaalim ho to main uski madad kaisey karun? Aap ne farmaya: Tum usey zulm se rokogey, ya usey manaa karogey, kyonke wo uski madad hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"238","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ka Musalman par paanch haq hain: Salaam ka jawab dena, aur mareez ki ayadat karna, aur janazon key peechey chalna, aur dawat qabool karna, aur chheenkney waley ko yarhamukallah kehna. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Musalman ka Musalman par chhey haq hain: Jab us se milo to usey salaam karo, aur jab wo tumhey bulaye to usey qabool karo, aur jab wo tum se naseehat maangey to usey naseehat karo, aur jab wo chheenkkey aur Allah ki hamd karey to usey yarhamukallah kaho, aur jab wo beemar ho to uski ayadat karo, aur jab wo mar jaey to uskey peechey chalo."
"239","Abu Umaara Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat ka hukm diya, aur saat se mana farmaya: Hamein mareez ki ayadat ka, aur janazey key peechey chalney ka, aur chheenkney waley ko yarhamukallah kehney ka, aur qasam khaaney waley ki qasam poori karne ka, aur mazloom ki madad ka, aur bulane waley ki dawat qabool karne ka, aur salaam pheelaney ka hukm diya. Aur hamein soney ki angoothiyon ya soney ki angoothi pehen-ney se, aur chaandi mein peeney se, aur surkh reshmi kapdon se, aur qassi se, aur resham aur istabraq aur deebaaj pehen-ney se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"240","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo banda duniya mein bandey ka parda rakhey to Allah qayamat key din uska parda rakheyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"241","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Meri tamaam ummat aafiyat wali hai siwaey khullam khulla karne walon key. Aur beshak khullam khulla karne mein se hai ke aadmi raat mein amal karey, phir subah karey jabke Allah ne us par parda daala hua hai. To wo kahey: Ae fulaan! Main ne kal raat is is tarah kya. Jabke wo raat guzaarta hai jabke uska Rab us par parda daalta hai, aur wo subah karta hai aur Allah ka us par parda kholta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"242","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab londi zina karey aur uska zina zaahir ho jaey to usey hadd key sath kodey maarna chahiye, aur usey malaamat nahi karni chahiye. Phir agar doosri martaba zina karey to usey hadd key sath kodey maarna chahiye aur usey malaamat nahi karni chahiye. Phir agar teesri martaba zina karey to usey baich dena chahiye chaahey baalon ki rassi key badley. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"243","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aik aadmi laaya gaya jis ne sharab pi thi. Aap ne farmaya: Usey maaro. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: To ham mein se haath se maarney wala, aur jootey se maarney wala, aur kapdey se maarney wala tha. Phir jab wo wapas aaya to qaum mein se baaz ne kaha: Allah tumhey ruswa karey. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho, us par shaitaan ki madad na karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"244","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai. Wo us par zulm nahi karta aur na usey ruswa karta hai. Jo apne bhai ki haajat mein ho Allah uski haajat mein hoga. Aur jo Musalman se museebat door karey to Allah us se uskey sabab qayamat key din ki museebaton mein se museebat door farmayega. Aur jo Musalman ka parda rakhey to Allah qayamat key din uska parda rakheyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"245","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo momin se duniya ki museebaton mein se museebat door karey to Allah us se qayamat key din ki museebaton mein se museebat door farmayega. Aur jo tangdast par aasaani karey to Allah us par duniya aur aakhirat mein aasaani farmayega. Aur jo Musalman ka parda rakhey to Allah uska parda duniya aur aakhirat mein rakheyga. Aur Allah bandey ki madad mein hai jab tak banda apne bhai ki madad mein hai. Aur jo aisa rasta chalta hai jis mein wo ilm talaash karta hai to Allah uskey liye Jannat ka rasta aasaan kar deta hai. Aur jo qaum Allah Taala key gharon mein se kisi ghar mein jama ho aur Allah ki kitaab padhey aur aapas mein uska daur karey to un par sukoon naazil hota hai, aur rehmat unhey dhaanp leti hai, aur farishtey unhey gher letey hain, aur Allah unhey unkey paas walon mein yaad farmata hai. Aur jisey uska amal peechey kar dey usey uska nasab aagey nahi badhaayega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"246","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jab haajat maangney wala aata to Aap apne humnasheenon ki taraf mutawajjah hotey aur farmatey: Sifarish karo ajr paogey, aur Allah apne Nabi ki zabaan par wo faisla farmayega jo wo pasand farmayega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"247","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Bareera aur uskey shohar key qissey mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kaash tum us se wapas mil jaatin? Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhey hukm detey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Main to sifarish karta hun. Us ne kaha: Mujhey us mein koi haajat nahi hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"248","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah ne farmaya: Logon mein se har jor par sadqa hai, har din jis mein suraj tuloo hota hai: Do key darmiyaan insaaf karna sadqa hai. Aur aadmi ki uski sawari par madad karna, usey us par sawaar karna, ya uskey liye us par uska saamaan uthana sadqa hai. Aur achchhi baat sadqa hai. Aur har qadam key sath jo tum namaz ki taraf chaltey ho sadqa hai. Aur raastey se takleef deh chiz hatana sadqa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"249","Umm Kulsoom bint Uqba bin Abi Muait (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Wo jhoota nahi hai jo logon key darmiyaan sulah karta hai aur bhalai badhaata hai, ya bhalai kehta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki riwayat mein izafa hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aur main ne Aap ko us mein se kisi mein rukhsat detey huey nahi suna jo log kehtey hain siwaey teen mein, yaani: Ladai, aur logon key darmiyaan sulah, aur aadmi ka apni biwi se baat karna, aur aurat ka apne shohar se baat karna."
"250","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne darwaazey par jhagda karne walon ki awaz suni jinki awazein buland thein. Jabke un mein se aik doosrey se kami ka aur narmi ka mutaaliba kar raha tha kisi chiz mein, jabke wo kehta tha: Allah ki qasam main nahi karunga! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un par nikley aur farmaya: Wo kahaan hai jo Allah par qasam khaata hai ke bhalai nahi karega? To us ne kaha: Main hun ya Rasulullah, isliye uskey liye jo wo pasand karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"251","Abul Abbas Sehel bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi ke Bani Amr bin Auf key darmiyaan shar tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey darmiyaan sulah karne key liye apne sath logon mein se nikley. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rok diye gaey aur namaz ka waqt aaya. To Bilaal Abu Bakr key paas aey aur kaha: Kya tumharey liye hai ke tum logon ki imaamat karo? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan agar chaho. To Bilaal ne namaz khadi ki aur Abu Bakr aagey badhey aur takbeer kahi aur logon ne takbeer kahi. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laey aur safon mein chaltey huey yahan tak ke saf mein khadey huey. To log taali bajaane lagey. Aur Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) apni namaz mein mutawajjah nahi hotey they. Phir jab logon ne taali bajaana zyada kya to mutawajjah huey aur achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf ishara kya. To Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apna haath uthaya aur Allah ki hamd ki. Aur peechey apne peechhey hat-tey gaey yahan tak ke saf mein khadey huey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aagey badhey aur logon ko namaz padhai. Phir jab faarigh huey to logon ki taraf mutawajjah huey aur farmaya: Ae logon! Tumhey kya hai ke jab tumhey namaz mein koi muamla pesh aey to tum taali bajaane lagtey ho? Taali to aurton key liye hai. Jisey uski namaz mein koi muamla pesh aey to kahey Subhan Allah. Kyonke usey koi nahi sunta jab wo Subhan Allah kehta hai magar mutawajjah hota hai. Ae Abu Bakr! Tumhey kis ne roka ke tum logon ko namaz padhao jab main ne tumhari taraf ishara kya? To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ibn Abi Quhaafa key liye munaasib nahi tha ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key saamney logon ko namaz padhaye. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"252","Haarisa bin Wahb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Kya main tumhey Jannat walon ki khabar na dun? Har kamzor dabaaya hua, agar wo Allah par qasam khaey to wo usey poora farmaye. Kya main tumhey dozakh walon ki khabar na dun? Har sakht badakhlaaq mutakabbir. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"253","Abul Abbas Sehel bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se guzra. To Aap ne us aadmi se kaha jo Aap key paas baitha tha: Iskey baarey mein tumhari kya raey hai? To us ne kaha: Logon key sardaron mein se aadmi hai. Ye Allah ki qasam laaiq hai ke agar wo paighaam dey to uska nikaah kya jaey, aur agar wo sifarish karey to uski sifarish qabool ki jaey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh rahey. Phir aik aur aadmi guzra. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Iskey baarey mein tumhari kya raey hai? To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Musalmanon key faqiron mein se aadmi hai. Ye laaiq hai ke agar wo paighaam dey to uska nikaah na kya jaey, aur agar wo sifarish karey to uski sifarish qabool na ki jaey, aur agar wo kahey to uskey qaul ko na suna jaey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye zameen bhar is jaison se behtar hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"254","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat aur dozakh ne jhagda kya. To dozakh ne kaha: Mujh mein jabbar aur mutakabbir hain. Aur Jannat ne kaha: Mujh mein logon key kamzor aur maskeen hain. To Allah ne un donon key darmiyaan faisla kya: Beshak tum Jannat meri rehmat ho, tumharey sath jis par chahunga rehem karunga. Aur beshak tum dozakh ho, tumharey sath jisey chahunga azaab dunga. Aur tum donon key liye mujh par bharna hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"255","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mota azeem aadmi qayamat key din aayega jo Allah key nazdeek machchar key par key barabar wazan nahi rakhta hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"256","Unhin se riwayat hai ke kaali aurat masjid mein jhaadu deti thi, ya ladka tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey na paaya aur uskey baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Wo mar gai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne mujhey ittila nahi di? To goya unhon-ne uska muamla, ya uska muamla chhota samjha. To farmaya: Mujhey uski qabr dikhao. To unhon-ne dikhai aur Aap ne us par namaz padhi. Phir farmaya: Beshak ye qabrein apne walon par andherey se bhari hui hain. Aur beshak Allah Taala unhey unkey liye meri un par namaz key sabab roshan farmata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"257","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shayad bikhrey baalon wala ghubaar aalood darwaazon se dhakela hua ho, agar wo Allah par qasam khaey to wo usey poora farmaye. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"258","Usaama (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Jannat key darwaazey par khada hua. To jo us mein dakhil huey unkey aksar maskeen they. Aur dolat waley rok diye gaey they, lekin dozakh walon key baarey mein hukm diya jaa chuka tha ke unhey dozakh ki taraf ley jaaya jaey. Aur main dozakh key darwaazey par khada hua aur jo us mein dakhil huein unkey aksar aurtein thein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"259","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jhooley mein sirf teen ne kalaam kya: Eesa Ibn Maryam, aur Juraij ka saathi. Aur Juraij aabid aadmi tha. To us ne ibadat khaana banaaya aur us mein tha. To uski maa uskey paas aai jabke wo namaz padh raha tha. To us ne kaha: Ae Juraij! To uski maa uskey paas aai jabke wo namaz padh raha tha. To us ne kaha: Ae Juraij! To us ne kaha: Ae Rab! Meri maa aur meri namaz. To wo apni namaz ki taraf mutawajjah hua aur wo wapas chali gai. Phir jab agla din hua to wo uskey paas aai jabke wo namaz padh raha tha. To us ne kaha: Ae Juraij! To us ne kaha: Ae Rab! Meri maa aur meri namaz. To wo apni namaz ki taraf mutawajjah hua. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Usey na maar yahan tak ke wo fahisha aurton key chehrey dekhey. To Bani Israeel ne Juraij aur uski ibaadat ka zikr kya. Aur aik zaaniya aurat thi jiskey husn ki misaal di jaati thi. To us ne kaha: Agar tum chaho to main usey fitney mein daalun. To wo uskey saamney aai lekin wo uski taraf mutawajjah nahi hua. To wo charwaahey key paas aai jo uskey ibadat khaaney mein rehta tha. To us ne usey apne nafs par qaabu diya aur wo us par waaqe hua. To wo haamila hui. Phir jab us ne jan diya to us ne kaha: Wo Juraij se hai. To wo aey aur usey utaara aur uskey ibadat khaaney ko gira diya aur usey maarney lagey. To us ne kaha: Tumhey kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne is zaaniya key sath zina kya hai aur wo tum se jan di hai. Us ne kaha: Bachcha kahaan hai? To wo usey ley kar aey. To us ne kaha: Mujhey chhoro yahan tak ke namaz padhun. To us ne namaz padhi. Phir jab wapas aaya to bachchey key paas aaya aur uskey pait mein ungli maari aur kaha: Ae ladkey! Tumhara waalid kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Fulaan charwaaha. To wo Juraij ki taraf mutawajjah huey aur usey choomtey they aur us se barkat haasil kartey they. Aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham tumharey liye tumhara ibadat khaana soney ka banayengey. Us ne kaha: Nahi, usey matti ka waisa bana do jaisa tha. To unhon-ne kya. Aur aik doodh peeta bachcha apni maa se doodh pi raha tha. To oomda sawari par sawaar khubsurat nishaan wala aadmi guzra. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey betey ko is jaisa bana. To us ne chhaati chhor di aur uski taraf mutawajjah hua aur usey dekha aur kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey us jaisa na bana. Phir apni chhaati ki taraf mutawajjah hua aur doodh peeney laga. Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhta hun jabke Aap uskey doodh peeney ki naql kar rahey hain apni shahaadat ki ungli key sath apne munh mein. To wo usey choostey they. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo londi par guzrey jabke wo usey maar rahey they aur kehtey they: Tum ne zina kya aur chori ki. Jabke wo kehti thi: Mujhey Allah kaafi hai aur wo behtreen kaarasaaz hai. To uski maa ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey betey ko us jaisa na bana. To wo ruka aur uski taraf dekha aur kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey us jaisa bana. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir dono ne baat ki. To us ne kaha: Dastak dene wala guzra khubsurat shakal wala. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey betey ko is jaisa bana. To tum ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey us jaisa na bana. Aur wo is londi par guzrey jabke wo usey maar rahey they aur kehtey they: Tum ne zina kya aur chori ki. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey betey ko is jaisa na bana. To tum ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey is jaisa bana. Us ne kaha: Beshak wo aadmi jabbar tha. Isliye main ne kaha: Ae Allah! Merey betey ko is jaisa na bana. Aur beshak ye kehtey hain: Tum ne zina kya aur tum ne chori nahi ki. Isliye main ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhey is jaisa bana."
"260","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chhey aadmi they. To mushrikon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Inhey door karo taake wo ham par jurrat na karein. Aur main tha aur Ibn Masood aur aik aadmi jinhey main naam nahi leta. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key dil mein jo Allah ne chaaha waaqe hua. To Aap ne apne dil mein baat ki. To Allah Taala ne naazil kya: Aur unhey na daudo jo apne Rab ko subah aur shaam pukaartey hain uska chehra chaahtey huey (Al-Anaam: 52). Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"261","Abu Habeera Aa'iz bin Amr Muzani jo Bait-e-Rizwaan walon mein se hain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Sufyan Salmaan aur Suhaib aur Bilaal key paas aey giroh mein. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki talwaaron ne Allah key dushman se apna haq nahi liya. To Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya tum Quraish key boodhey aur unkey sardar se ye kehtey ho? To wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap ko khabar di. To farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr! Shayad tum ne unhey naraaz kya hai? Agar tum ne unhey naraaz kya hai to tum ne apne Rab ko naraaz kya hai. To wo unkey paas aey aur kaha: Ae merey bhaiyon! Kya main ne tumhey naraaz kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, Allah tumhey bakhsh dey ae merey bhai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"262","Sehel bin Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main aur yateem ki kafaalat karne wala Jannat mein is tarah hongey. Aur shahaadat aur darmiyaani ungli key sath ishara kya, aur unkey darmiyaan judai ki. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"263","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yateem ki kafaalat karne wala uskey liye ya ghair key liye, main aur wo Jannat mein in donon ki tarah hain. Aur rawi, jo Maalik Ibn Anas hain, ne shahaadat aur darmiyaani ungli key sath ishara kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"264","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi hai jisey aik ya do khajoorein wapas kar dein, aur na aik ya do luqmey. Beshak miskeen wo hai jo paakdaamani ikhtiyaar karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"265","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Bewa aur miskeen par koshish karne wala Allah key raastey mein jihad karne waley ki tarah hai. Aur mera khayaal hai ke farmaya: Aur qayaam karne waley ki tarah jo sust nahi hota, aur rozey rakhne waley ki tarah jo iftaar nahi karta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"266","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badtareen khaana waleemey ka khaana hai. Us se rokta hai jo us mein aata hai, aur us mein bulata hai jo us se inkaar karta hai. Aur jo dawat qabool na karey to us ne Allah aur uskey Rasool ki nafarmaani ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Sahihain mein aik riwayat mein hai Abu Hurairah se unkey qaul se: Bura khaana waleemey ka khaana hai jis mein ameeron ko bulaaya jaata hai aur faqiron ko chhora jaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"267","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo do ladkiyon ki parwarish karey yahan tak ke wo baaligh hon to qayamat key din aayega jabke main aur wo in donon ki tarah hongey. Aur apni ungliyan milaein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"268","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey paas aurat dakhil hui jabke uskey sath uski do betiyan thein jo maangti thein. To us ne merey paas aik khajoor key siwa kuchh nahi paaya. To main ne usey usey di. To us ne usey apni donon betiyon key darmiyaan taqseem kar diya aur us mein se nahi khaaya. Phir khadi hui aur nikli. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas dakhil huey. To main ne Aap ko khabar di. To farmaya: Jo in betiyon mein se kisi key sath aazmaaya jaey aur unkey sath ahsaan karey to wo uskey liye dozakh se parda hongi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"269","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey paas miskeen aurat aai jo apni do betiyan uthaye huey thi. To main ne usey teen khajoorein khilaein. To us ne un mein se har aik ko aik khajoor di aur apne munh ki taraf khajoor uthai taake usey khaey. To uski donon betiyon ne us se maanga. To us ne wo khajoor phaad di jo wo khaana chaahti thi un donon key darmiyaan. To mujhey uska muamla achchha laga. To main ne jo us ne kya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To farmaya: Beshak Allah ne uskey sabab uskey liye Jannat waajib kar di hai, ya usey uskey sabab dozakh se aazaad kar diya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"270","Abu Shuraih Khuwailid bin Amr Khuzaai (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak main kamzor donon: Yateem aur aurat ka haq sakht karta hun. Hasan hadis hai, ise Nasaai ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"271","Musaab bin Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Saad ne dekha ke usey apne neechey walon par fazilat hai. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum apne kamzoron key siwa madad diye jaatey ho aur rizq diye jaatey ho? Ise Bukhari ne is tarah mursal riwayat kya hai, kyonke Musaab bin Saad taabai hain. Aur Haafiz Abu Bakr Barqaani ne apni Sahih mein muttasil riwayat kya hai Musaab se unkey waalid (Raziallahu anhu) se."
"272","Abu Darda Uwaimir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Mujhey kamzoron mein talaash karo. Kyonke tum apne kamzoron key sabab madad diye jaatey ho aur rizq diye jaatey ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"273","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurton key sath bhalai ki waseeyat karo. Kyonke aurat pasli se paida ki gai hai. Aur beshak pasli mein sab se tedha uska oopar hai. Phir agar tum usey seedha karne jao to usey tod dogey. Aur agar usey chhor do to wo tedhi raheygi. Isliye aurton key sath bhalai ki waseeyat karo. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Sahihain mein aik riwayat mein hai: Aurat pasli ki tarah hai, agar tum usey seedha karo to usey tod dogey. Aur agar us se faeda uthao to us se faeda uthao jabke us mein tedh hai. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak aurat pasli se paida ki gai hai. Wo tumharey liye kisi tareeqey par seedhi nahi hogi. Phir agar tum us se faeda uthao to us se faeda uthao jabke us mein tedh hai. Aur agar tum usey seedha karne jao to usey tod dogey, aur uska todna usey talaaq dena hai."
"274","Abdullah bin Zamaa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khutba detey huey suna, jabke Aap ne oontni aur usey kaat-ney waley ka zikr kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab uska badbakht utha, uskey liye izzat wala sakht apne khaandaan mein bachao wala aadmi utha. Phir aurton ka zikr kya aur unkey baarey mein waaz farmaya. To farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni biwi ko ghulaam ki tarah maarta hai, phir shayed wo uskey din key aakhir mein us se sohbat karta hai. Phir unhey unkey hawa khaarij honay par hans-ney key baarey mein waaz farmaya aur kaha: Tum mein se koi us par kyun hansta hai jo wo karta hai? (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"275","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin mard momin aurat se bughz na rakhey. Agar us se uska aik akhlaaq napasand ho to us se doosra pasand hoga, ya farmaya: Ghair. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"276","Amr bin Al-Ahwas Jashmi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Hajjatul Wada mein farmatey huey suna, uskey baad jab Aap ne Allah Taala ki hamd ki, aur uski sana ki, aur zikr aur waaz kya. Phir farmaya: Khabardaar! Aurton key sath bhalai ki waseeyat karo. Kyonke wo tumharey paas qaidi hain, tum un mein se uskey siwa kuchh nahi rakhtey. Siwaey iskey ke wo khuli behayai key sath aaein. Phir agar wo karein to unhey bistaron mein chhoro, aur unhey aisi maar maaro jo sakht na ho. Phir agar wo tumhari itaat karein to un par raasta na chaho. Khabardaar! Beshak tumhara tumhari biwiyon par haq hai, aur tumhari biwiyon ka tum par haq hai. Phir tumhara un par haq hai ke wo tumharey bistaron ko us se na raundein jisey tum napasand kartey ho, aur tumharey gharon mein usey ijazat na dein jisey tum napasand kartey ho. Khabardaar! Aur unka tum par haq hai ke tum unkey libaas aur khaaney mein unkey sath ahsaan karo. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"277","Muawiya bin Haida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)! Ham mein se har aik ki biwi ka us par kya haq hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ke tum usey khilaao jab tum khao, aur usey pehnaao jab tum pehno, aur chehrey par na maaro, aur bura na kaho, aur ghar key siwa qata talluq na karo. Hasan hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: La tuqabbih key maana hain: Yaani na kaho Qabbahakallah."
"278","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imaan mein kaamil tareen momin wo hain jinkey akhlaaq sab se achchhey hain. Aur tum mein behtreen wo hain jo apni biwiyon key liye behtreen hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"279","Iyaas bin Abi Zubaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki londiyon ko na maaro. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur farmaya: Aurtein apne shoharon par daleer ho gaein hain. To unhey maarney ki rukhsat di gai. To Aale Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key gird bahut si aurtein aaein jo apne shoharon ki shikaayat karti thein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Aale Muhammad key ghar key gird bahut si aurtein aaein hain jo apne shoharon ki shikaayat karti hain. Wo tum mein behtreen nahi hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"280","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya saamaan hai, aur uska behtreen saamaan naik aurat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"281","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar ki taraf bulaye aur wo uskey paas na aey aur wo us par naraaz raat guzaarey to farishtey us par subah tak laanat kartey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Jab aurat raat guzaarey apne shohar key bistar se judaa hokar to farishtey us par subah tak laanat kartey hain. Aur aik riwayat mein farmaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Jo aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar ki taraf bulaye aur wo us par inkaar karey to jo aasmaan mein hai us par naraaz rehta hai yahan tak ke wo us se raazi ho jaey."
"282","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat key liye halaal nahi ke wo rozey rakhey jabke uska shohar haazir ho magar uski ijazat key sath. Aur na uskey ghar mein ijazat dey magar uski ijazat key sath. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai)."
"283","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum sab nigehbaan ho, aur tum sab apni riaya key baarey mein poochhey jaaney waley ho. Aur ameer nigehbaan hai, aur aadmi apne ghar walon par nigehbaan hai. Aur aurat apne shohar key ghar aur aulaad par nigehbaan hai. Isliye tum sab nigehbaan ho, aur tum sab apni riaya key baarey mein poochhey jaaney waley ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"284","Abu Ali Talq bin Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apni haajat key liye bulaye to wo uskey paas aey chaahey wo tandoor par ho. Ise Tirmizi aur Nasaai ne riwayat kya hai aur Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"285","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar main kisi ko hukm deta ke kisi ko sajda karey to aurat ko hukm deta ke apne shohar ko sajda karey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"286","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aurat mari aur uska shohar us se raazi tha wo Jannat mein dakhil hui. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"287","Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aurat duniya mein apne shohar ko takleef deti hai to uski hooron mein se biwi kehti hai: Usey takleef na do, Allah tumhey qatl karey! Beshak wo tumharey paas mehmaan hai, anqareeb wo tum se judaa hokar hamari taraf aayega. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"288","Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne apne baad aisa fitna nahi chhora jo mardon par aurton se zyada nuqsaan deh ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"289","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deenaar jo tum ne Allah key raastey mein kharch kya, aur deenaar jo tum ne gardan mein kharch kya, aur deenaar jo tum ne miskeen par sadqa kya, aur deenaar jo tum ne apne ghar walon par kharch kya. Un mein sab se azeem ajr wala wo hai jo tum ne apne ghar walon par kharch kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"290","Abu Abdullah, aur usey Abu Abdur Rahman kaha jaata hai, Saubaan bin Bujdud jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key aazaad karda ghulaam they, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Afzal deenaar jo aadmi kharch karta hai wo deenaar hai jo wo apne ghar walon par kharch karta hai, aur deenaar jo wo Allah key raastey mein apni sawari par kharch karta hai, aur deenaar jo wo Allah key raastey mein apne saathiyon par kharch karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"291","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya merey liye Abi Salama key beton mein ajr hai ke main un par kharch karun, jabke main unhey is tarah aur is tarah nahi chhorti, beshak wo merey betey hain? To farmaya: Haan, tumharey liye ajr hai jo tum ne un par kharch kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"292","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se unki taweel hadis mein jo ham pehley Kitaab key awwal mein Niyat key baab mein laa chukey hain, riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aur beshak tum jo kharch karogey jis se Allah ka chehra chaahtey ho to tumhey us par ajr diya jaeyga, yahan tak ke jo tum apni biwi key munh mein rakhtey ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"293","Abu Masood Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne ghar walon par kharch karey jabke wo us par sawaab ki ummeed rakhta hai to wo uskey liye sadqa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"294","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi key liye gunaah ko yehi kaafi hai ke wo usey zaaya karey jisey wo khilaata hai. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud waghera ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Muslim ne apni Sahih mein isi maana mein riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi key liye gunaah ko yehi kaafi hai ke wo usey rok ley jisey wo khilaata hai."
"295","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi din nahi jis mein bandey subah kartey hain magar do farishtey utartey hain. To un mein se aik kehta hai: Ae Allah! Kharch karne waley ko badla ata farma. Aur doosra kehta hai: Ae Allah! Rokne waley ko halaakat ata farma. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"296","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Oopar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. Aur us se shuru karo jisey tum khilaatey ho. Aur behtreen sadqa wo hai jo be-niyaazi ki peeth se ho. Aur jo paakdaamani ikhtiyaar kareyga Allah usey paakdaaman farmayega. Aur jo be-niyaaz hoga Allah usey be-niyaaz farmayega. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"297","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) Madina mein khajoor mein Ansaar mein sab se zyada maal waley they. Aur unkey maalon mein sab se mehboob unhey Bairaha thi. Aur wo masjid key saamney thi. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us mein dakhil hotey they aur us mein khushgawaar paani mein se peetey they. Anas ne kaha: Phir jab ye aayat naazil hui: Tum neki nahi paogey yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand kartey ho, to Abu Talha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas khadey huey aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah Taala ne tum par naazil kya hai: Tum neki nahi paogey yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand kartey ho. Aur beshak mera sab se mehboob maal Bairaha hai. Aur beshak wo Allah Taala key liye sadqa hai, main uski bhalai aur Allah Taala key paas uskey zakheera ki ummeed rakhta hun. Isliye usey rakho ya Rasulullah jahaan Allah tumhey dikhaata hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wah! Wo nafa dene wala maal hai. Wo nafa dene wala maal hai. Aur beshak main ne suna hai jo tum ne kaha. Aur beshak main dekhta hun ke tum usey qareebi rishtedaaron mein rakho. To Abu Talha ne kaha: Karunga ya Rasulullah. To Abu Talha ne usey apne rishtedaaron aur chacha zaad bhaiyon mein taqseem kar diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"298","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hasan bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) ne sadqa ki khajoor li aur usey apne munh mein rakha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kakh kakh! Usey phenk do. Kya tum nahi jaantey ke ham sadqa nahi khaatey!? (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ke hamarey liye sadqa halaal nahi hai. Aur uska qaul kakh kakh kha key sukoon key sath kaha jaata hai, aur kaha jaata hai uskey kasra key sath tanween key sath. Aur wo bachchey ko gandi cheezon se rokne ka kalima hai. Aur Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) bachchey they."
"299","Abu Hafs Umar bin Abi Salama Abdullah bin Abdul Asad jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key parwarda betey hain, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki god mein ladka tha aur mera haath pyaaley mein ghoomta tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae ladkey! Allah Taala ka naam lo, aur daayein haath se khao, aur apne saamney se khao. To uskey baad wahi mera khaana raha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"300","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum sab nigehbaan ho, aur tum sab apni riaya key baarey mein poochhey jaaney waley ho. Aur aurat apne shohar key ghar mein nigehbaan hai aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochhi jaaney wali hai. Aur khaadim apne aaqa key maal mein nigehbaan hai aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochha jaaney wala hai. Isliye tum sab nigehbaan ho aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochhey jaaney waley ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"301","Amr bin Shuaib se apne waalid se apne dada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni aulaad ko namaz ka hukm do jab wo saat saal key hon, aur unhey us par maaro jab wo das saal key hon, aur unkey darmiyaan bistaron mein judai karo. Hasan hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"302","Abu Surayya Sabra bin Maabad Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bachchey ko saat saal mein namaz sikhao, aur usey das saal mein us par maaro. Hasan hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur Abu Dawud ka lafz hai: Bachchey ko namaz ka hukm do jab wo saat saal ko pahunchy."
"303","Ibn Umar aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibraeel mujhey padosi key baarey mein waseeyat kartey rahey yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kya ke wo usey waaris bana deingey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"304","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Jab tum shorba pakao to uska paani zyada karo, aur apne padosiyon ki khabar lo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai Abu Zarr se, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak merey khaleel (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey waseeyat ki: Jab tum shorba pakao to uska paani zyada karo, phir apne padosiyon mein se ghar walon ko dekho aur unhey us mein se bhalai key sath do."
"305","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam wo imaan nahi laata! Allah ki qasam wo imaan nahi laata! Allah ki qasam wo imaan nahi laata! Kaha gaya: Kaun ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Wo jiskey shar se uska padosi aman mein na ho! (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Wo Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga jiskey shar se uska padosi aman mein na ho."
"306","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Musalman aurton! Padosan apni padosan ko haqeer na samjhey chaahey bakri ka khur ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"307","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi apne padosi ko uski deewaar mein lakdi gaadney se na rokey. Phir Abu Hurairah kehtey hain: Mujhey kya hai ke main tumhey us se munh phertey huey dekhta hun! Allah ki qasam! Main usey tumharey kandhon key darmiyaan phenkunga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"308","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to apne padosi ko takleef na dey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to apne mehmaan ki izzat karey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to bhalai kahey ya khamosh rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"309","Abu Shuraih Khuzaai (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to apne mehmaan ki izzat karey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to bhalai kahey ya khamosh rahey. Ise Muslim ne isi lafz key sath riwayat kya hai, aur Bukhari ne baaz hissa riwayat kya hai."
"310","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak merey do padosi hain. To main un mein se kisko tohfa dun? Aap ne farmaya: Un mein se jiska darwaaza tum se zyada qareeb ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"311","Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala key nazdeek behtreen saathi wo hain jo apne saathi key liye behtreen hon. Aur Allah Taala key nazdeek behtreen padosi wo hain jo apne padosi key liye behtreen hon. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"312","Abu Abdur Rahman Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kaun sa amal Allah Taala ko zyada mehboob hai? Aap ne farmaya: Namaz apne waqt par. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Walidain key sath husn-e-sulook. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key raastey mein jihad. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"313","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beta waalid ka badla nahi dey sakta siwaey iskey ke usey ghulaam paey aur usey khareed kar aazaad karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"314","Unhin se bhi riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to apne mehmaan ki izzat karey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to apna rishta jorey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to bhalai kahey ya khamosh rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"315","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ne makhlooq ko paida kya. Yahan tak ke jab un se faarigh hua to rishta khada hua. To us ne kaha: Ye qata talluq karne waley se panah maangney waley ka maqaam hai. Allah ne farmaya: Haan, kya tum raazi nahi ke main usey jorun jo tumhey jorey, aur usey kaatun jo tumhey kaatey? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Allah ne farmaya: To wo tumharey liye hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar chaho to padho: To kya tum qareeb ho ke agar tum peeth pher lo to zameen mein fasaad karo aur apne rishtey kaato. Wahi hain jin par Allah ne laanat ki aur unhey behra kar diya aur unki beenai andhi kar di (Muhammad: 22, 32). (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Bukhari ki aik riwayat mein hai: To Allah Taala ne farmaya: Jo tumhey joreyga main usey jorunga, aur jo tumhey kaatega main usey kaatunga."
"316","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri achchhi sohbat ka sab se zyada haqdaar kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari maa. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari maa. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari maa. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara waalid. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ya Rasulullah! Achchhi sohbat ka sab se zyada haqdaar kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari maa, phir tumhari maa, phir tumhari maa, phir tumhara waalid, phir jo qareeb ho jo qareeb ho."
"317","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uski naak khaak aalood ho, phir uski naak khaak aalood ho, phir uski naak khaak aalood ho jo apne walidain ko budhaapey mein paey, aik ya donon ko, phir Jannat mein dakhil na ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"318","Unhin se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak merey rishtedaar hain jin se main rishta jorta hun aur wo mujh se kaat-tey hain. Aur main unkey sath ahsaan karta hun aur wo merey sath bura kartey hain. Aur main un se hilm karta hun aur wo mujh par jihaalat kartey hain. To farmaya: Agar tum waisa ho jaisa tum ne kaha to goya tum unhey garm raakh khilaatey ho. Aur tumharey sath Allah ki taraf se un par madadgaar raheyga jab tak tum us par raho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"319","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo pasand karta hai ke uskey liye uskey rizq mein kushadgi ki jaey, aur uskey liye uskey nishaan mein dair ki jaey to wo apna rishta jorey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"320","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Talha Madina mein khajoor mein Ansaar mein sab se zyada maal waley they. Aur unkey maalon mein sab se mehboob unhey Bairaha thi. Aur wo masjid key saamney thi. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us mein dakhil hotey they aur us mein khushgawaar paani mein se peetey they. Phir jab ye aayat naazil hui: Tum neki nahi paogey yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand kartey ho (Aal-e-Imran: 92), to Abu Talha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas khadey huey aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah Tabaarak wa Taala farmata hai: Tum neki nahi paogey yahan tak ke us mein se kharch karo jo tum pasand kartey ho. Aur beshak mera sab se mehboob maal Bairaha hai. Aur beshak wo Allah Taala key liye sadqa hai, aur main uski bhalai aur Allah Taala key paas uskey zakheera ki ummeed rakhta hun. Isliye usey rakho ya Rasulullah jahaan Allah tumhey dikhaata hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wah! Wo nafa dene wala maal hai. Wo nafa dene wala maal hai! Aur beshak main ne suna hai jo tum ne kaha. Aur beshak main dekhta hun ke tum usey qareebi rishtedaaron mein rakho. To Abu Talha ne kaha: Karunga ya Rasulullah. To Abu Talha ne usey apne rishtedaaron aur chacha zaad bhaiyon mein taqseem kar diya. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur uskey alfaaz ka bayaan guzar chuka hai Kharch karne key baab mein jo pasand karey."
"321","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Main tum se hijrat aur jihad par baiyat karta hun jabke main Allah Taala se ajr chaahta hun. Aap ne farmaya: To kya tumharey walidain mein se koi zinda hai? Us ne kaha: Haan balke donon. Aap ne farmaya: To tum Allah Taala se ajr chaahtey ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To apne walidain ki taraf wapas jao aur unki achchhi sohbat karo. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai). Aur un donon ki aik riwayat mein hai: Aik aadmi aaya aur Aap se jihad mein ijazat maangi. To farmaya: Kya tumharey walidain zinda hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To un donon mein jihad karo."
"322","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rishta jorney wala badla dene wala nahi hai, lekin rishta jorney wala wo hai jo jab uska rishta kaata jaey to usey jorey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"323","Aaisha se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rishta Arsh key sath latka hua hai aur kehta hai: Jo mujhey jorega Allah usey jorega. Aur jo mujhey kaatega Allah usey kaatega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"324","Ummul Momineen Maimoona bint Al-Haaris (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne londi aazaad ki aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat nahi li. Phir jab unka din aaya jo unkey paas ghoomta tha to kaha: Kya tumhey khabar hui ya Rasulullah ke main ne apni londi aazaad kar di hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak agar tum usey apne maamon ko detin to tumharey ajr key liye azeem hota. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"325","Asma bint Abi Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Meri walida merey paas aai jabke wo mushrika thi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se fatwa maanga aur kaha: Meri walida merey paas aai hain jabke wo raghbat rakhti hain. To kya main apni walida se rishta jorun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, apni walida se rishta joro. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"326","Zainab Saqafiya jo Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi hain (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa karo ae aurton ki jamaat, chaahey apne zewaron mein se! Unhon-ne kaha: To main Abdullah bin Masood ki taraf wapas aai aur un se kaha: Beshak tum kam maal waley aadmi ho, aur beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein sadqa ka hukm diya hai. Isliye Aap key paas jao aur poochho. Phir agar wo tumharey liye kaafi ho to warna usey ghair ko de dungi. To Abdullah ne kaha: Balke tum Aap key paas jao. To main gai aur Ansaar mein se aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key darwaazey par thi jiski haajat meri haajat thi. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par roab daala gaya tha. To Bilaal hamarey paas nikley. To ham ne us se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jao aur Aap ko khabar do ke darwaazey par do aurtein tum se poochhti hain: Kya sadqa unkey liye unkey shoharon par aur un yateemon par kaafi hai jo unki god mein hain? Aur usey khabar na do ke ham kaun hain. To Bilaal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas dakhil huey aur Aap se poochha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Wo kaun hain? Us ne kaha: Ansaar mein se aurat aur Zainab. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zainabon mein se kaun si hai? Us ne kaha: Abdullah ki biwi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un donon key liye do ajr hain: Rishtedaari ka ajr aur sadqa ka ajr. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"327","Abu Sufyan Sakhr bin Harb (Raziallahu anhu) se unki taweel hadis mein Qaisar key qissey mein riwayat hai ke Hiraql ne Abu Sufyan se kaha: To wo tumhey kya hukm deta hai? Yaani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo kehta hai: Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao, aur chhoro jo tumharey baap kehtey hain. Aur hamein namaz ka, aur sachchai ka, aur paakdaamani ka, aur rishta jorney ka hukm deta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"328","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum anqareeb zameen fatah karogey jis mein qeeraat ka zikr kya jaata hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Tum anqareeb Misr fatah karogey aur wo zameen hai jis mein qeeraat ka naam liya jaata hai. Isliye uskey walon key sath bhalai ki waseeyat karo, kyonke unkey liye zimma aur rishta hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Phir jab tum usey fatah karo to uskey walon key sath ahsaan karo, kyonke unkey liye zimma aur rishta hai, ya farmaya: Zimma aur susraal hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"329","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab ye aayat naazil hui: Aur apne qareebi rishtedaaron ko darao (Ash-Shuara: 214), to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Quraish ko bulaya. To wo jama huey aur aam aur khaas kya aur farmaya: Ae Bani Abd Shams! Ae Bani Kaab bin Loayy! Apne aap ko dozakh se bachao. Ae Bani Murra bin Kaab! Apne aap ko dozakh se bachao. Ae Bani Abd Manaaf! Apne aap ko dozakh se bachao. Ae Bani Haashim! Apne aap ko dozakh se bachao. Ae Bani Abdul Muttalib! Apne aap ko dozakh se bachao. Ae Faatima! Apne aap ko dozakh se bachao. Kyonke main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh nahi rakhta, lekin tumharey liye rishta hai jisey main uski tari key sath tar karunga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"330","Abu Abdullah Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khullam khulla baghair chhupaye farmatey huey suna: Beshak Bani fulaan key aal merey dost nahi hain. Beshak mera dost Allah hai aur naik momin hain. Lekin unkey liye rishta hai jisey main uski tari key sath tar karunga. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur lafz Bukhari ka hai)."
"331","Abu Ayyub Khaalid bin Zaid Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aise amal ki khabar dein jo mujhey Jannat mein dakhil karey, aur mujhey dozakh se door karey. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki ibaadat karo, aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao, aur namaz qaim karo, aur zakaat do, aur rishta joro. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"332","Salmaan bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi iftaar karey to khajoor se iftaar karey. Kyonke wo barkat hai. Phir agar khajoor na paey to paani, kyonke wo paak hai. Aur farmaya: Miskeen par sadqa sadqa hai, aur rishtedaar par do hain: Sadqa aur rishta. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"333","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey neechey biwi thi, aur main us se mohabbat karta tha, jabke Umar usey napasand kartey they. To unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Usey talaaq do. To main ne inkaar kya. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se uska zikr kya. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey talaaq do. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"334","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi unkey paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak meri biwi hai aur meri walida mujhey uskey talaaq ka hukm deti hain? To unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Waalid Jannat key darwaazon mein se darmiyaana darwaaza hai. Phir agar tum chaho to us darwaazey ko zaaya karo, ya uski hifaazat karo. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"335","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khaala maa key darjey mein hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai. Aur is baab mein Sahih mein bahut si mashhoor ahadis hain. Aur un mein se ghaar walon ki hadis hai, aur Juraij ki hadis hai, jo guzar chuki hain. Aur Sahih mein mashhoor ahadis hain jinhey main ne ikhtisaar key liye hazf kar diya hai. Aur un mein sab se ahem Amr bin Abasa (Raziallahu anhu) ki taweel hadis hai jo Islam key qawaaid aur aadaab mein se bahut jumlon par mushtamil hai. Aur main usey poora zikr karunga Insha Allah Taala Ummeed key baab mein. Unhon-ne us mein farmaya: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Makkah mein dakhil hua, yaani ibtidai nabuwwat mein. To main ne Aap se kaha: Tum kaun ho? Aap ne farmaya: Nabi. To main ne kaha: Aur Nabi kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey Allah Taala ne bheja hai. To main ne kaha: Tumhey kis chiz key sath bheja hai? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey rishtedaaron ko jorney key sath bheja hai, aur buton ko todney key sath, aur ke Allah ko ek maana jaey aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehraaya jaey. Aur poori hadis zikr ki. Aur Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"336","Abu Bakra Nufai bin Al-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey sab se badey kabeera gunaahon ki khabar na dun? Teen martaba. Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Allah key sath shirk karna, aur walidain ki nafarmaani. Aur Aap tek lagaey huey they phir baith gaey. To farmaya: Khabardaar! Aur jhooti baat aur jhooti gawaahi. To Aap dohratey rahey yahan tak ke ham ne kaha: Kaash Aap khamosh ho jaein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"337","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kabeera gunaah hain: Allah key sath shirk karna, aur walidain ki nafarmaani, aur jaan ko qatl karna, aur jhooti qasam. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"338","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kabeera gunaahon mein se hai ke aadmi apne walidain ko gaali dey! Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur kya aadmi apne walidain ko gaali deta hai?! Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Wo aadmi key waalid ko gaali deta hai, to wo uskey waalid ko gaali deta hai. Aur wo uski walida ko gaali deta hai, to wo uski walida ko gaali deta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak sab se badey kabeera gunaahon mein se hai ke aadmi apne walidain par laanat karey! Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Aadmi apne walidain par kaisey laanat karta hai?! Aap ne farmaya: Wo aadmi key waalid ko gaali deta hai, to wo uskey waalid ko gaali deta hai. Aur wo uski walida ko gaali deta hai, to wo uski walida ko gaali deta hai."
"339","Abu Muhammad Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qata talluq karne wala Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga. Sufyan ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Yaani: Rishta kaat-ney wala. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"340","Abu Eesa Mugheera bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ne tum par maaon ki nafarmaani haraam ki hai, aur rokna aur maangna, aur betiyon ko zinda dafan karna. Aur tumharey liye qeel-o-qaal, aur kasrat se sawal, aur maal ko zaaya karna napasand farmaya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"341","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se azeem neki hai ke aadmi apne waalid key doston se rishta jorey."
"342","Abdullah bin Deenaar se Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Makkah key raastey mein dehaatiyon mein se aik aadmi unhey mila. To Abdullah bin Umar ne usey salaam kya, aur usey gadhey par sawaar kya jis par wo sawaar they, aur usey amaama di jo unkey sar par thi. Ibn Deenaar ne kaha: To ham ne us se kaha: Allah tumhey durust karey, beshak wo dehaati hain aur wo thodey par raazi hotey hain. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: Beshak iskey waalid Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) key dost they. Aur beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak sab se azeem neki hai ke aadmi apne waalid key doston key ghar walon se rishta jorey uskey wapas honay key baad. Aur aik riwayat mein hai Ibn Deenaar se Ibn Umar se ke wo jab Makkah ki taraf nikaltey they to unkey paas gadha hota tha jis par aaraam farmatey they jab sawari par sawaar honay se uktaatey they, aur amaama jis se apna sar baandhtey they. To aik din wo us gadhey par they ke unkey paas se dehaati guzra. To us ne kaha: Kya tum fulaan bin fulaan key betey nahi ho? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi. To usey gadha diya aur kaha: Is par sawaar ho. Aur usey amaama diya aur kaha: Us se apna sar baandho. To uskey baaz saathiyon ne us se kaha: Allah tumhey bakhsh dey, tum ne is dehaati ko gadha diya jis par tum aaraam farmatey they, aur amaama jis se tum apna sar baandhtey they? To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak sab se azeem neki mein se hai ke aadmi apne waalid key doston key ghar walon se rishta jorey uskey munh pherney key baad. Aur beshak uskey waalid Umar (Raziallahu anhu) key dost they."
"343","Abu Usaid, hamza key zamma aur seen key fatha key sath, Maalik bin Rabee'a Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baithey huey they ke Bani Salama mein se aik aadmi Aap key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya merey walidain ki neki mein se kuchh baqi hai jiskey sath main unki wafat key baad unkey sath neki karun? To farmaya: Haan, un donon par namaz, aur un donon key liye maghfirat maangna, aur unkey baad unkey ahd ko poora karna, aur us rishtey ko jorna jo sirf un donon key sath joda jaata hai, aur unkey dost ki izzat karna. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"344","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyon mein se kisi par itni ghairat nahi ki jitni Khadija (Raziallahu anha) par ki, jabke main ne usey kabhi nahi dekha tha. Lekin Aap uska kasrat se zikr kartey they. Aur shayed bakri zibah kartey, phir usey tukdey kartey, phir usey Khadija ki saheliyon mein bhejtey. To shayed main Aap se kehti: Goya duniya mein Khadija key siwa koi nahi thi! To farmatey: Beshak wo aisi thein aur aisi thein, aur mujhey us se aulaad thi. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur beshak Aap bakri zibah farmatey, phir us mein se uski saheliyon ko tohfa bhejtey jitna unhey kaafi ho. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jab bakri zibah farmatey to farmatey: Usey Khadija ki doston ki taraf bhejo. Aur aik riwayat mein unhon-ne kaha: Haala bint Khuwailid jo Khadija ki behan thein, ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi. To Aap ne Khadija ki ijazat ko pehchaana aur us se khush huey aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Haala bint Khuwailid."
"345","Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Jareer bin Abdullah Bajali (Raziallahu anhu) key sath safar mein nikla. To wo meri khidmat kartey they. To main ne us se kaha: Aisa na karo. To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne Ansaar ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath kuchh kartey huey dekha hai, main ne apne nafs par qasam khai hai ke main un mein se kisi key sath na rahunga magar uski khidmat karunga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"346","Yazeed bin Hayyaan se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur Husain bin Sabra aur Amr bin Muslim Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhum) ki taraf chaley. Phir jab ham unkey paas baithey to Husain ne us se kaha: Beshak tum ne ae Zaid bahut bhalai paai hai. Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha aur Aap ki hadis suni, aur Aap key sath ghazwa kya, aur Aap key peechey namaz padhi. Beshak tum ne ae Zaid bahut bhalai paai hai. Ham se bayan karo ae Zaid jo tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey bhatijey! Allah ki qasam! Beshak meri umr badi ho gai hai, aur mera ahd puraana ho gaya hai, aur main baaz bhool gaya hun jo main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yaad karta tha. Isliye jo main tumhey bayan karun to qabool karo, aur jo na karun to mujhey takleef na do. Phir kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din hamarey darmiyaan khateeb bankar khadey huey paani par jisey Khumma kaha jaata hai jo Makkah aur Madina key darmiyaan hai. To Allah ki hamd ki, aur uski sana ki, aur waaz aur yaad dihaani ki. Phir farmaya: Hamd key baad, khabardaar ae logon! Beshak main bashar hun, qareeb hai ke merey Rab ka qaasid aey aur main qabool karun. Aur main tum mein do bhaari cheezein chhorney wala hun. Un mein pehli Allah ki kitaab hai, us mein hidayat aur noor hai. Isliye Allah ki kitaab ko lo, aur usey mazboot pakdo. To Allah ki kitaab par ubhara, aur us mein raghbat dilai, phir farmaya: Aur merey Ahle Bait, main tumhey Allah yaad dilaata hun merey Ahle Bait key baarey mein. Main tumhey Allah yaad dilaata hun merey Ahle Bait key baarey mein. To Husain ne us se kaha: Aur Aap key Ahle Bait kaun hain ae Zaid? Kya Aap ki biwiyan Aap key Ahle Bait mein se nahi hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ki biwiyan Aap key Ahle Bait mein se hain. Lekin Aap key Ahle Bait wo hain jin par Aap key baad sadqa haraam hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo Aale Ali, aur Aale Aqeel, aur Aale Jaafar, aur Aale Abbas hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya ye sab par sadqa haraam hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Khabardaar! Aur beshak main tum mein do bhaari cheezein chhorney wala hun: Un mein aik Allah ki kitaab aur Allah ki rassi hai. Jo uski pairwi kareyga wo hidayat par hoga, aur jo usey chhoreyga wo gumraahi par hoga."
"347","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se mauqoof riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Ahle Bait mein khayaal rakho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"348","Abu Masood Uqba bin Amr Badri Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qaum ki imaamat wo karaye jo Allah ki kitaab ko sab se zyada padhney wala ho. Phir agar qiraat mein barabar hon to sunnat ko sab se zyada jaanne wala. Phir agar sunnat mein barabar hon to hijrat mein sab se aagey. Phir agar hijrat mein barabar hon to umr mein sab se bada. Aur aadmi aadmi ki uskey ikhtiyaar mein imaamat na karaye, aur na uskey ghar mein uski izzat ki jagah par baith-ney magar uski ijazat key sath. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: To hijrat mein sab se aagey, salam key siwa. Seenan key siwa: Ya Islam. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Qaum ki imaamat wo karaye jo Allah ki kitaab ko sab se zyada padhney wala ho, aur qiraat mein sab se aagey. Phir agar unki qiraat ho to un mein hijrat mein sab se aagey imaamat karaye. Phir agar hijrat mein barabar hon to un mein umr mein sab se bada imaamat karaye."
"349","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz mein hamarey kandhey chhoote they aur farmatey they: Seedhey hojao aur ikhtilaaf na karo, warna tumharey dil ikhtilaaf kareingey. Mujh se tum mein aqal aur samajh waley milein, phir jo unkey peechey hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"350","Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh se tum mein aqal aur samajh waley milein, phir jo unkey peechey hon. Teen martaba. Aur bazaaron key shor se bacho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"351","Abu Yahya, aur kaha gaya Abu Muhammad Sehel bin Abi Hasma, ha muhmala key fatha aur sa musallasa key sukoon key sath, Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn Sehel aur Muhayyisa bin Masood Khaibar ki taraf nikley jabke wo sulah thi. To wo judaa ho gaey. To Muhayyisa Abdullah bin Sehel key paas aaya jabke wo apne khoon mein tadap raha tha, qatl hua tha. To us ne usey dafan kya. Phir Madina aaya. To Abdur Rahman bin Sehel aur Muhayyisa aur Huwayyisa Ibn Masood Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gaey. To Abdur Rahman baat karne gaya. To farmaya: Bada bada. Jabke wo qaum mein sab se chhota tha. To wo khamosh hua. To un donon ne baat ki. To farmaya: Kya tum qasam khaogey aur apne qaatil ka haq logey? Aur poori hadis zikr ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"352","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Uhad key shaheedon mein se do aadmiyon ko jama farmatey they, yaani qabr mein. Phir farmatey: Un mein se kaun Quran ko zyada leney wala hai? Phir jab un mein se aik ki taraf ishara kya jaata to usey lahad mein aagey farmatey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"353","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne apne aap ko khuwab mein miswaak key sath miswaak kartey huey dekha. To merey paas do aadmi aey, un mein se aik doosrey se bada tha. To main ne miswaak chhotey ko di. To mujh se kaha gaya: Bada. To usey un donon mein badey ko diya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur Bukhari ne taaleeqan."
"354","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ki taazeem mein se hai Musalman safed daadhi waley ki izzat karna, aur Quran uthaaney waley ki jo us mein ghulu nahi karta, aur us se judaa honay waley ki, aur insaaf karne waley sultaan ki izzat karna. Hasan hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"355","Amr bin Shuaib se apne waalid se apne dada (Raziallahu anhum) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham mein se nahi hai jo hamarey chhotey par rehem na karey, aur hamarey badey ki izzat na pehchaaney. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai, aur Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"356","Maimoon bin Abi Shabeeb (Rehmatullah aleh) se riwayat hai ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) key paas se imam guzra aur us ne saail ko roti ka tukda diya. Aur uskey paas se kapdon aur haalat waley aadmi ka guzra aur usey bithaya aur us ne khaaya. To us se uskey baarey mein kaha gaya: ? To us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ko unkey martabon par rakho. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai. Lekin Maimoon ne kaha: Wo Aaisha ko nahi paa saka."
"357","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Uyaina bin Hisn aaya aur apne bhatijey Hurr bin Qais key paas thehra, jabke wo un giroh mein se they jinhey Umar (Raziallahu anhu) qareeb kartey they. Aur qaari hazraat Umar key majlis waley aur unkey mushir they, chaahey boodhey hon ya jawaan. To Uyaina ne apne bhatijey se kaha: Ae merey bhatijey! Tumhey is ameer key paas martaba hai, isliye merey liye us se ijazat lo. To us ne uskey liye ijazat li aur Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey ijazat di. Phir jab wo dakhil hua to kaha: Haan ae Ibn Khattab! Allah ki qasam! Tum hamein zyada nahi detey, aur na hamarey darmiyaan insaaf se faisla kartey ho. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ghusay huey yahan tak ke us par waqe honay ka irada kya. To Hurr ne us se kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Beshak Allah Taala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se farmaya: Darguzar ikhtiyaar karo aur bhalai ka hukm do aur jaahilon se munh phero. Aur beshak ye jaahilon mein se hai. Allah ki qasam! Umar ne us se tajawuz nahi kya jab us ne us par padha, jabke wo Allah Taala ki kitaab par rukne waley they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"358","Abu Saeed Samura bin Jundab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein ladka tha. To main Aap se yaad karta tha. To mujhey qaul se sirf ye rokta tha ke yahaan mujh se badey aadmi hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"359","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo jawaan boodhey ki uski umr ki wjah se izzat karey to Allah uskey liye muqarrar farmata hai jo uski umr mein uski izzat kareyga. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Ghareeb hadis hai."
"360","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafaat key baad kaha: Hamarey sath Umm Aiman (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf chalo, ham unki ziyaarat karein jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki ziyaarat farmatey they. Phir jab wo donon unkey paas pahunchey to wo roein. To unhon-ne un se kaha: Tumhey kya rulaata hai? Kya tum nahi jaantin ke jo Allah key paas hai wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye behtar hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main nahi roti ke main nahi jaanti ke jo Allah Taala key paas hai wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye behtar hai. Lekin main roti hun ke wahi aasmaan se munqata ho gai hai. To unhon-ne un donon ko ronay par ubhara. To wo donon unkey sath ronay lagey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"361","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Ke aik aadmi ne doosri basti mein apne bhai ki ziyaarat ki. To Allah Taala ne uskey raastey par farishta muqarrar kya. Phir jab wo us par aaya to us ne kaha: Tum kahaan chaahtey ho? Us ne kaha: Main is basti mein apne bhai ko chaahta hun. Us ne kaha: Kya tumhey us par koi naimat hai jisey tum paaltey ho? Us ne kaha: Nahi, lekin beshak main ne Allah Taala key liye us se mohabbat ki hai. Us ne kaha: To beshak main tumhari taraf Allah ka bheja hua hun ke Allah ne tum se mohabbat ki hai jaisa tum ne us se us mein mohabbat ki hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"362","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mareez ki ayadat karey ya Allah key liye apne bhai ki ziyaarat karey to munadi karne wala nida karta hai: Tum paak huey, aur tumhara chalna paak hua, aur tum ne Jannat mein thikana banaaya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur baaz nuskhon mein ghareeb hai."
"363","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak naik humnasheen aur burey humnasheen ki misaal mushk uthaaney waley aur bhaati phoonkney waley ki si hai. To mushk uthaaney wala, ya tumhey deyga, ya tum us se khareedogey, ya tum us se achchhi khushbu paogey. Aur bhaati phoonkney wala, ya tumharey kapdey jalaayega, ya tum us se badbudaar khushbu paogey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"364","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat se chaar key liye nikaah kya jaata hai: Uskey maal key liye, aur uskey hasab key liye, aur uski khubsurti key liye, aur uskey deen key liye. To deendaar ko haasil karo, tumharey haath khaak aalood hon. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"365","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jibraeel se kaha: Tumhey kya rokta hai ke tum hamari ziyaarat karo us se zyada jo tum ziyaarat kartey ho? To naazil hui: Aur ham naazil nahi hotey magar tumharey Rab key hukm se. Uskey liye hai jo hamarey aagey hai aur jo hamarey peechey hai aur jo uskey darmiyaan hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"366","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin key siwa kisi ko dost na banao, aur tumhara khaana muttaqi key siwa koi na khaey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne aisi sanad key sath riwayat kya hai jis mein harj nahi."
"367","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi apne dost key deen par hai. Isliye tum mein se har aik dekhey ke wo kissey dosti karta hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai, aur Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"368","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi uskey sath hai jis se wo mohabbat karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein farmaya: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Aadmi qaum se mohabbat karta hai jabke wo un se nahi mila? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi uskey sath hai jis se wo mohabbat karta hai."
"369","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke dehaati ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Qayamat kab hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne uskey liye kya taiyaar kya hai? Us ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool ki mohabbat. Aap ne farmaya: Tum uskey sath ho jis se tum ne mohabbat ki. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai). Aur un donon ki aik riwayat mein hai: Main ne uskey liye bahut rozey, aur na namaz, aur na sadqa taiyaar nahi kya hai, lekin main Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat karta hun."
"370","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum us aadmi key baarey mein kya kehtey ho jo qaum se mohabbat karta hai aur un se nahi mila? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi uskey sath hai jis se wo mohabbat karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"371","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log soney chaandi key maadanon ki tarah maadanein hain. Jaahiliyat mein unkey behtreen Islam mein unkey behtreen hain jab wo samjhein. Aur roohein jama ki hui faujein hain. To un mein se jo aapas mein pehchaanti hain wo mil jaati hain, aur jo aapas mein anjaan hain wo ikhtilaaf karti hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai? Aur Bukhari ne Arwaah ka qaul Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki riwayat se riwayat kya hai."
"372","Usair bin Amr, aur kaha gaya Ibn Jaabir, jo hamza key zamma aur seen muhmala key fatha key sath hai, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab key paas jab Ahle Yaman ki madad aati thi to un se poochhtey they: Kya tum mein Uwais bin Aamir hain? Yahan tak ke Uwais (Raziallahu anhu) par aey. To unhon-ne us se kaha: Kya tum Uwais bin Aamir ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Muraad se phir Qaran se? Us ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey bars tha aur tum us se achchhey ho gaey siwaey dirham ki jagah key? Us ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Tumhari walida hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tumharey paas Uwais bin Aamir aayega Ahle Yaman ki madad key sath Muraad se phir Qaran se. Usey bars tha aur wo us se achchha ho gaya siwaey dirham ki jagah key. Uski walida hai jiskey sath wo husn-e-sulook karta hai. Agar wo Allah par qasam khaey to wo usey poora farmaye. Phir agar tum taqat rakho ke wo tumharey liye maghfirat maangey to karo. To merey liye maghfirat maango. To us ne uskey liye maghfirat maangi. To us ne us se kaha: Tum kahaan chaahtey ho? Us ne kaha: Kufa. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya main tumharey liye uskey aamil ko na likhun? Us ne kaha: Main logon key gair mein hun, mujhey zyada mehboob hai. Phir jab agley saal hua to unkey sardaron mein se aik aadmi ne Hajj kya aur Umar se mila. To us ne us se Uwais key baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Main ne usey puraney ghar wala thodey saamaan wala chhora hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah ko farmatey huey suna: Tumharey paas Uwais bin Aamir aayega Ahle Yaman ki madad mein se Muraad se phir Qaran se. Usey bars tha aur wo us se achchha ho gaya siwaey dirham ki jagah key. Uski walida hai jiskey sath wo husn-e-sulook karta hai. Agar wo Allah par qasam khaey to wo usey poora farmaye. Phir agar tum taqat rakho ke wo tumharey liye maghfirat maangey to karo. To wo Uwais key paas aaya aur us se kaha: Merey liye maghfirat maango. Us ne kaha: Tum naik safar se naey ahd waley ho. Isliye merey liye maghfirat maango. Us ne kaha: Kya tum Umar se miley? Us ne kaha: Haan. To us ne uskey liye maghfirat maangi. To log usey pehchaan gaey aur wo apne munh par chala gaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai Usair bin Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se ke Ahle Kufa Umar (Raziallahu anhu) key paas wafd bankar aey, jabke un mein aik aadmi tha jo Uwais ka mazaak udaata tha. To Umar ne kaha: Kya yahaan Qaraniyon mein se koi hai? To wo aaya aur us ne kaha, waghera."
"373","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Umrah mein ijazat maangi. To Aap ne mujhey ijazat di aur farmaya: Ae merey bhai! Hamein apni dua mein na bhoolna. To us ne aisa kalima kaha jo mujhey us par khush nahi karta ke merey liye uskey badley duniya ho. Aur aik riwayat mein farmaya: Ae merey bhai! Hamein apni dua mein shareek karna. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"374","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quba ki ziyaarat farmatey they sawaar aur paidal. To us mein do rakaatein padhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har hafta Masjid-e-Quba tashreef laatey they sawaar aur paidal, aur Ibn Umar aisa kartey they."
"375","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jo jis mein hon us ne unkey sabab imaan ki mithaas paai: Ke Allah aur uskey Rasool uskey nazdeek uskey siwa se zyada mehboob hon. Aur wo aadmi se mohabbat karey aur us se sirf Allah key liye mohabbat karey. Aur wo kufr mein wapas aaney ko napasand karey uskey baad jab Allah ne usey us se nijaat di hai, jaisa wo napasand karta hai ke dozakh mein daala jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"376","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saat hain jinhey Allah apne saaye mein saaya dega jis din uskey saaye key siwa koi saaya nahi hoga: Insaaf karne wala, aur jawaan jo Allah Azza wa Jall ki ibaadat mein bada hua. Aur aadmi jiska dil masaajid key sath laga hua hai. Aur do aadmi jinhon-ne Allah mein mohabbat ki, us par jama huey aur us par judaa huey. Aur aadmi jisey husn aur jamaal wali aurat ne bulaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak main Allah se darta hun. Aur aadmi jis ne sadqa key sath sadqa kya aur usey chhupaya yahan tak ke uska baayaan haath nahi jaanta ke uska daayaan haath kya kharch karta hai. Aur aadmi jis ne Allah ko tanhai mein yaad kya aur uski donon aankhein beh padhein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"377","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala qayamat key din farmayega: Meri buzurgi mein mohabbat karne waley kahaan hain? Aaj main unhey apne saaye mein saaya dunga jis din merey saaye key siwa koi saaya nahi hoga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"378","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum Jannat mein dakhil nahi hogey yahan tak ke imaan laao, aur tum imaan nahi laogey yahan tak ke mohabbat karo. Kya main tumhey aisi chiz na bataun ke jab tum usey karogey to mohabbat karogey: Aapas mein salaam pheelayo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"379","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ke aik aadmi ne doosri basti mein apne bhai ki ziyaarat ki. To Allah ne uskey raastey par farishta muqarrar kya. Aur hadis zikr ki uskey qaul tak: Beshak Allah ne tum se mohabbat ki hai jaisa tum ne us se us mein mohabbat ki hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur ye pechley baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"380","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ansaar key baarey mein: Un se momin key siwa koi mohabbat nahi karta, aur un se munaafiq key siwa koi bughz nahi rakhta. Jo un se mohabbat karey Allah us se mohabbat karta hai. Aur jo un se bughz rakhey Allah us se bughz rakhta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"381","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Meri buzurgi mein mohabbat karne walon key liye noor key mimbar hongey jin par Nabi aur shaheed rashk kareingey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"382","Abu Idrees Khaulaani (Rehmatullah aleh) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Damishq ki masjid mein dakhil hua. To chamaktey daanton wala ladka tha jabke log uskey sath they. Phir jab wo kisi chiz mein ikhtilaaf kartey to uski taraf sanad kartey aur uski raey se saadir hotey. To main ne uskey baarey mein poochha. To kaha gaya: Ye Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) hain. Phir jab agla din hua to main jaldi aaya aur usey paaya ke wo mujh se pehley jaldi aaya tha. Aur usey paaya ke wo namaz padh raha tha. To uska intizaar kya yahan tak ke us ne apni namaz poori ki. Phir uskey paas uskey chehrey ki taraf se aaya aur usey salaam kya. Phir kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tum se mohabbat karta hun. To us ne kaha: Kya Allah key liye? To us ne kaha: Allah key liye. To us ne kaha: Kya Allah key liye? To us ne kaha: Allah key liye. To us ne meri chaadar key kinarey se mujhey pakda aur mujhey apni taraf kheench liya. To us ne kaha: Khush ho jao. Kyonke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Meri mohabbat waajib ho gai hai merey liye mohabbat karne walon key liye, aur merey liye majlis karne walon key liye, aur merey liye ziyaarat karne walon key liye, aur merey liye kharch karne walon key liye. Sahih hadis hai, ise Maalik ne Muwatta mein apni sahih sanad key sath riwayat kya hai."
"383","Abu Kareema Miqdaad bin Maadi Karib (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai se mohabbat karey to usey khabar dey ke wo us se mohabbat karta hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"384","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka haath pakda aur farmaya: Ae Muaz! Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tum se mohabbat karta hun. Phir tumhey waseeyat karta hun ae Muaz! Har namaz key peechey ye kehna na chhoro: Ae Allah! Meri madad farma Terey zikr par aur Terey shukr par, aur Teri achchhi ibaadat par. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Nasaai ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"385","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas tha. To uskey paas se aadmi guzra. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main is se mohabbat karta hun. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tum ne usey khabar di hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Usey khabar do. To wo uskey peechey gaya aur us se kaha: Beshak main Allah mein tum se mohabbat karta hun. To us ne kaha: Allah tum se mohabbat karey jiskey liye tum ne mujh se mohabbat ki hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"386","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ne farmaya: Jis ne merey dost se dushmani ki to main ne usey ladai ki khabar di hai. Aur mera banda mujh se kisi chiz key sath qareeb nahi hota jo mujhey us se zyada mehboob ho jo main ne us par farz kya hai. Aur mera banda nawafil key sath mujh se qareeb hota rehta hai yahan tak ke main us se mohabbat karta hun. Phir jab main us se mohabbat karta hun to uska kaan banta hun jis se wo sunta hai, aur uski aankh jis se wo dekhta hai, aur uska haath jis se wo pakadta hai, aur uska paaon jis se wo chalta hai. Aur agar wo mujh se maangey to usey deta hun. Aur agar wo mujh se panah maangey to usey panah deta hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"387","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah bandey se mohabbat karta hai to Jibraeel ko pukaarta hai: Beshak Allah Taala fulaan se mohabbat karta hai, isliye us se mohabbat karo. To Jibraeel us se mohabbat karta hai. To aasmaan walon mein pukaarta hai: Beshak Allah fulaan se mohabbat karta hai, isliye us se mohabbat karo. To aasmaan waley us se mohabbat kartey hain. Phir uskey liye zameen mein qabooliyat rakhi jaati hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala jab bandey se mohabbat karta hai to Jibraeel ko bulata hai. To farmata hai: Beshak main fulaan se mohabbat karta hun, isliye us se mohabbat karo. To Jibraeel us se mohabbat karta hai. Phir aasmaan mein pukaarta hai aur kehta hai: Beshak Allah fulaan se mohabbat karta hai, isliye us se mohabbat karo. To aasmaan waley us se mohabbat kartey hain. Phir uskey liye zameen mein qabooliyat rakhi jaati hai. Aur jab bandey se bughz rakhta hai to Jibraeel ko bulata hai aur farmata hai: Beshak main fulaan se bughz rakhta hun, isliye us se bughz rakho. To Jibraeel us se bughz rakhta hai. Phir aasmaan walon mein pukaarta hai: Beshak Allah fulaan se bughz rakhta hai, isliye us se bughz rakho. Phir uskey liye zameen mein bughz rakha jaata hai."
"388","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi ko lashkar par bheja. To wo apne saathiyon ko unki namaz mein padhaata tha aur Qul huwallahu ahad key sath khatm karta tha. Phir jab wo wapas aey to unhon-ne uska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya. To farmaya: Us se poochho ke wo ye kyun karta tha? To unhon-ne us se poochha. To us ne kaha: Kyonke wo Rehman ki sifat hai, isliye main pasand karta hun ke usey padhun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey khabar do ke Allah Taala us se mohabbat karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"389","Jundab bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Subah ki namaz padhey wo Allah key zimma mein hai. Isliye Allah tum se apne zimma mein se kisi chiz ka mutaaliba na karey. Kyonke jo us se uskey zimma mein se kisi chiz ka mutaaliba karega to wo usey paa leyga. Phir usey uskey chehrey par dozakh ki aag mein undha deyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"390","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. Aur namaz qaim karein, aur zakaat dein. Phir agar wo ye karein to unhon-ne mujh se apne khoon aur maal bacha liye siwaey Islam key haq key, aur unka hisaab Allah Taala par hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"391","Abu Abdullah Taariq bin Ashyam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo kahey La ilaha illallah, aur uska inkaar karey jo Allah key siwa pooja jaata hai, to uska maal aur khoon haraam ho gaya, aur uska hisaab Allah Taala par hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"392","Abul Miqdaad bin Al-Aswad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Batao agar main kaafiron mein se aadmi se milun aur ham qitaal karein. To wo talwaar key sath merey aik haath ko maarey aur usey kaat dey. Phir mujh se darakht key sath panah ley aur kahey: Main Allah key liye Musalman hua. Kya main usey qatl karun ya Rasulullah uskey kehney key baad? To farmaya: Usey qatl na karo. Phir agar tum ne usey qatl kya to wo tumharey martabey mein hai is se pehley ke tum usey qatl karo. Aur tum uskey martabey mein ho is se pehley ke wo wo kalima kahey jo us ne kaha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur iskey maana hain: Beshak wo tumharey martabey mein hai, yaani: Uska khoon masoom hai aur uskey Islam ka hukm hai. Aur iskey maana hain: Ke tum uskey martabey mein ho, yaani: Uskey waarison key liye qisaas key sath khoon halaal hai. Wo uskey kufr mein uskey martabey mein nahi hai. Aur Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"393","Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Juhaina key Hirqa ki taraf bheja. To ham ne qaum par unkey paaniyon par subah hamla kya. Aur main aur Ansaar mein se aik aadmi un mein se aik aadmi key peechey padey. Phir jab ham ne usey gher liya to us ne kaha: La ilaha illallah. To Ansaari us se ruk gaya aur main ne usey apne naizey se maara yahan tak ke qatl kar diya. Phir jab ham Madina aey to ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Usaama! Kya tum ne usey La ilaha illallah kehney key baad qatl kya?! Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo to panah maang raha tha. To farmaya: Kya tum ne usey La ilaha illallah kehney key baad qatl kya?! To Aap mujh par dohratey rahey yahan tak ke main ne tamanna ki ke kaash main us din se pehley Musalman nahi hua tha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya us ne La ilaha illallah kaha aur tum ne usey qatl kya?! Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne to hathyaar key khauf se kaha tha. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne uska dil cheera taake jaan lo ke us ne kaha ya nahi?! To Aap dohratey rahey yahan tak ke main ne tamanna ki ke kaash main us din Musalman hua hota."
"394","Jundab bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Musalmanon ka lashkar mushrikon ki qaum ki taraf bheja. Aur wo miley aur mushrikon mein se aik aadmi tha jo jab chaahta ke Musalmanon mein se aadmi ka qasad karey to uska qasad karke usey qatl karta tha. Aur Musalmanon mein se aik aadmi ne uski ghaflat ka qasad kya, aur ham kehtey they ke wo Usaama bin Zaid tha. Phir jab us ne us par talwaar uthai to us ne kaha: La ilaha illallah. To us ne usey qatl kar diya. To khushkhabri dene wala Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap se poochha aur Aap ko khabar di, yahan tak ke us ne Aap ko aadmi ki khabar di ke us ne kaisey kya. To Aap ne usey bulaya aur us se poochha. To farmaya: Tum ne usey kyun qatl kya? To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne Musalmanon ko takleef di, aur fulaan aur fulaan ko qatl kya, aur us ne uskey liye giroh ka naam liya. Aur beshak main ne us par hamla kya. Phir jab us ne talwaar dekhi to us ne kaha: La ilaha illallah. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne usey qatl kya? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To La ilaha illallah key sath kya karogey jab wo qayamat key din aayegi? Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Merey liye maghfirat maangein. Aap ne farmaya: Aur La ilaha illallah key sath kya karogey jab wo qayamat key din aayegi? To Aap isey zyada nahi farmatey they ke farmaatey: La ilaha illallah key sath kya karogey jab wo qayamat key din aayegi? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"395","Abdullah bin Utba bin Masood se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak kuchh log wahi key sabab pakdey jaatey they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein, jabke wahi munqata ho chuki hai. Aur beshak ham unhey ab us se pakadtey hain jo hamarey liye tumharey aamaal mein se zaahir hua hai. Phir jo hamarey liye bhalai zaahir karey to ham usey aman deingey aur qareeb kareingey. Aur hamarey liye uskey baatin mein se kuchh nahi hai. Allah uskey baatin mein uska hisaab leyga. Aur jo hamarey liye burai zaahir karey to ham usey aman nahi deingey, aur na usey sachcha samjheingey chaahey wo kahey: Beshak uska baatin achchha hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"396","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khabar di, jabke Aap sachey tasdeeq kiye gaey hain: Beshak tum mein se har aik ki khilqat uski maa key pait mein chaalees din nutfa jama ki jaati hai. Phir utna hi jamna hota hai. Phir utna hi gosht ka lothda hota hai. Phir farishta bheja jaata hai aur us mein rooh phun ki jaati hai. Aur chaar kalimaat ka hukm diya jaata hai: Uska rizq likha jaata hai, aur uski muddat, aur uska amal, aur badbakht ya khushbakht. Allah ki qasam jiskey siwa koi mabood nahi! Beshak tum mein se koi Jannat walon key amal key sath amal karta hai yahan tak ke uskey aur uskey darmiyaan sirf haath bhar hota hai. To us par kitaab sabqat ley jaati hai aur wo dozakh walon key amal key sath amal karta hai aur us mein dakhil hota hai. Aur beshak tum mein se koi dozakh walon key amal key sath amal karta hai yahan tak ke uskey aur uskey darmiyaan sirf haath bhar hota hai. To us par kitaab sabqat ley jaati hai aur wo Jannat walon key amal key sath amal karta hai aur us mein dakhil hota hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"397","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat key din dozakh laai jaeygi jiskey sattar hazaar lagaamein hongey, har lagaam key sath sattar hazaar farishtey hongey jo usey kheench rahey hongey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"398","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak qayamat key din dozakh walon mein sab se halka azaab wala wo aadmi hoga jiskey qadmon key talwon mein do angaarey rakhey jaengey jin se uska dimaagh ubalega. Wo nahi dekheyga ke koi us se zyada sakht azaab wala hai, jabke wo un mein sab se halka azaab wala hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"399","Samura bin Jundab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un mein se koi hoga jisey dozakh uskey takhnon tak pakdegi. Aur un mein se koi hoga jisey ghutnon tak pakdegi. Aur un mein se koi hoga jisey kamar tak pakdegi. Aur un mein se koi hoga jisey hansi tak pakdegi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Hujzah tehband ka girah neechey naaf key hai, aur tarquwah ta key fatha aur qaaf key zamma key sath hai: Wo haddi hai jo halaq key garhey key paas hai. Aur insaan ki halaq key donon kinaron mein do tarquwah hain."
"400","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log jahaanon key Rab key liye khadey hongey yahan tak ke un mein se koi apne paseeney mein apne donon kaanon key nisf tak doob jaeyga. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur rashah paseena hai."
"401","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein khutba diya aisa khutba jis jaisa main ne kabhi nahi suna. To farmaya: Agar tum jaantey jo main jaanta hun to thoda hanstey aur bahut rotey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba ne apne chehrey dhaanp liye jabke unhey rona tha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Aap key sahaaba ki taraf se kuchh pahunchi aur Aap ne khutba diya. To farmaya: Mujh par Jannat aur dozakh pesh ki gaein. To main ne aaj ki tarah bhalai aur shar mein nahi dekha. Aur agar tum jaantey jo main jaanta hun to thoda hanstey aur bahut rotey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba par us din se sakht din nahi aaya. Unhon-ne apne sar dhaanp liye jabke unhey rona tha."
"402","Miqdaad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qayamat key din suraj makhlooq se qareeb kya jaeyga yahan tak ke wo un se meel key faasley jaisa hoga. Sulaim bin Aamir jo Miqdaad se rawi hain, ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Mujhey nahi maloom meel se kya muraad hai, kya zameen ki musaafat ya meel jis se aankh mein surma lagaya jaata hai. To log apne aamaal key barabar paseeney mein hongey. To un mein se koi takhnon tak hoga. Aur un mein se koi ghutnon tak hoga. Aur un mein se koi kamar tak hoga. Aur un mein se koi hoga jisey paseena lagaam dega. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne haath se apne munh ki taraf ishara kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"403","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log qayamat key din paseena bahaengey yahan tak ke unka paseena zameen mein sattar haath jaeyga. Aur wo unhey lagaam dega yahan tak ke unkey kaanon tak pahunchega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur yazhabu fil arz key maana hain: Neechey jaata hai aur dhansta hai."
"404","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they jab Aap ne dhamaaka suna. To farmaya: Kya tum jaantey ho ye kya hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Ye pathar hai jo dozakh mein sattar saal se phenka gaya tha. To wo dozakh mein gir raha hai ab, yahan tak ke uskey teh tak pahunch gaya. To tum ne uski awaz suni. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"405","Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi nahi magar uska Rab us se kalaam farmayega jabke uskey aur uskey darmiyaan tarjumaan nahi hoga. To wo apne daayein dekheyga aur sirf wo dekheyga jo us ne aagey bheja tha. Aur apne baayein dekheyga aur sirf wo dekheyga jo us ne aagey bheja tha. Aur apne saamney dekheyga aur apne chehrey key saamney dozakh key siwa kuchh nahi dekheyga. Isliye dozakh se bacho chaahey khajoor key tukdey se. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"406","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main dekhta hun jo tum nahi dekhtey. Aasmaan cheekha aur uskey liye haq hai ke cheekhey. Us mein chaar ungliyon ki jagah nahi hai magar farishta hai jo apni peshaani Allah Taala ko sajda kartey huey rakhey huey hai. Allah ki qasam! Agar tum jaantey jo main jaanta hun to thoda hanstey aur bahut rotey. Aur aurton se bistaron par lazzat na letey. Aur raaston ki taraf nikaltey aur Allah Taala ki taraf aah o zaari kartey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur atat hamza key fatha aur ta key tashdeed key sath, aur taittu ta key fatha aur uskey baad hamza maksura key sath. Walateet pichhle aur qutb waghera ki awaz hai. Aur iskey maana hain: Ke aasmaan mein ibaadat karne waley farishton ki kasrat ne usey bhaari kar diya hai yahan tak ke wo cheekha hai."
"407","Abu Barza, ba phir za, Nazla bin Ubaid Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bandey key donon qadam qayamat key din nahi hatengey yahan tak ke us se uski umr key baarey mein poochha jaeyga ke us ne usey kis mein khatm kya. Aur uskey ilm key baarey mein ke us ne us mein kya kya. Aur uskey maal key baarey mein ke us ne usey kahaan se kamaaya, aur kis mein kharch kya. Aur uskey jism key baarey mein ke us ne usey kis mein bosida kya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"408","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne padha: Us din wo apni khabrein bayan karegi. Phir farmaya: Kya tum jaantey ho uski khabrein kya hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. Aap ne farmaya: To uski khabrein hain ke wo har bandey ya londi key baarey mein gawahi degi jo us ne uski peeth par kya. Wo kaheygi: Us ne is is tarah kya fulaan fulaan din mein. To ye uski khabrein hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"409","Abu Saad Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main kaisey aaraam karun jabke soor waley ne pakad liya hai, aur ijazat suni hai ke usey kab phunkney ka hukm diya jaeyga aur wo phunkega? To goya wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba par bhaari hua. To unhon-ne un se farmaya: Kaho: Hasbunallahu wa ni'mal wakeel. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"410","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo dara wo raat key shuru mein chala. Aur jo raat key shuru mein chala wo manzil tak pahunch gaya. Khabardaar! Beshak Allah ka saamaan mehenga hai. Khabardaar! Beshak Allah ka saamaan Jannat hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"411","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Log qayamat key din nangey paaon nangey badan baghair khatna key jama kiye jaengey. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mard aur aurtein sab aik sath baaz baaz ko dekhtey hongey? Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aaisha! Muamla us se sakht hai ke wo uski parwah karein. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Muamla us se ahem hai ke baaz baaz ko dekhein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"412","Ubaada bin As-Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo gawahi dey ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi. Aur Muhammad uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. Aur Eesa Allah key bandey aur uskey Rasool hain, aur uska kalima hai jo us ne Maryam ki taraf daala aur uski taraf se rooh hain. Aur Jannat haq hai aur dozakh haq hai, to Allah usey Jannat mein dakhil farmayega us amal par jo tha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jo gawahi dey ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, us par dozakh haraam hai."
"413","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Jo neki key sath aayega to uskey liye uskey das guna ya zyada hain. Aur jo burai key sath aayega to burai ka badla us jaisi burai hai ya bakhsh dunga. Aur jo mujh se baalisht bhar qareeb hoga to main us se haath bhar qareeb hunga. Aur jo mujh se haath bhar qareeb hoga to main us se do haath qareeb hunga. Aur jo merey paas chal kar aayega to main uskey paas daud kar aaunga. Aur jo mujh se zameen bhar khata key sath milega jabke wo merey sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehrata tha to main us se us jaisi maghfirat key sath milunga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"414","Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Dehaati Nabi Karim key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Do waajib karne waliyan kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Jo mar jaey jabke wo Allah key sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehrata tha wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Aur jo mar jaey jabke wo uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek thehrata tha wo dozakh mein dakhil hoga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"415","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Muaz Aap key peechey sawari par they. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muaz! Us ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah aur saadatmand. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muaz! Us ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah aur saadatmand. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muaz! Us ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah aur saadatmand, teen martaba. Aap ne farmaya: Jo banda gawahi dey ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur Muhammad uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain, apne dil se sachchaai key sath, to Allah usey dozakh par haraam kar deta hai. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main uski khabar logon ko na dun taake wo khush hon? Aap ne farmaya: Tab wo bharosa kareingey. To Muaz ne uski khabar maut key waqt gunaah key khauf se di. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"416","Abu Hurairah, ya Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rawi ko shak hai, aur Sahaabi key ain mein shak nuqsaan nahi deta: Kyonke wo sab aadil hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Jab Ghazwa Tabook hua to logon ko qehat pahunchi. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaash tum hamein ijazat do aur ham apne oonton ko zibah karein aur khaein aur tail lagayein? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Karo. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) tashreef laey aur farmaya: Ya Rasulullah! Agar tum ne kya to sawari kam ho jaeygi. Lekin unhey unkey zaaid tosha key sath bulao, phir Allah se un par barkat ki dua karo, shayed Allah us mein barkat rakhey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan. To Aap ne dastarkhwan mangwaya aur bichhaaya. Phir unkey zaaid tosha ko mangwaya. To aadmi mutthi bhar jau key sath aaya. Aur doosra mutthi bhar khajoor key sath aaya. Aur doosra roti key tukdey key sath aaya, yahan tak ke dastarkhwan par us mein se thoda jama ho gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne barkat ki dua ki. Phir farmaya: Apne bartanon mein lo. To unhon-ne apne bartanon mein liya yahan tak ke lashkar mein bartan nahi chhora magar bhar diya. Aur khaaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaey aur fazl baqi raha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur main Allah ka Rasool hun. Allah se un donon key sath banda nahi milega jo shak nahi karta, aur wo Jannat se rok diya jaeyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"417","Itbaan bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, jabke wo Badri they, unhon-ne kaha: Main apni qaum Bani Saalim ko namaz padhaata tha. Aur merey aur unkey darmiyaan waadi haail thi jab baarishein aatin thein. To usey paar karna mujh par mushkil hota tha unki masjid se pehley. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap se kaha: Beshak main apni beenai ko bura samajhta hun. Aur beshak wo waadi jo merey aur meri qaum key darmiyaan hai behti hai jab baarishein aatin hain. To usey paar karna mujh par mushkil hota hai. Isliye main chaahta tha ke tum aao aur merey ghar mein jagah namaz padho jisey main jaey namaz banaaun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Karunga. To Rasulullah subah tashreef laey, aur Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) baad mein jab din chadh gaya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ijazat maangi aur main ne Aap ko ijazat di. To Aap nahi baithey yahan tak ke farmaya: Tum apne ghar mein se kahaan pasand kartey ho ke main namaz padhun? To main ne Aap ko us jagah ki taraf ishara kya jo main pasand karta tha ke us mein namaz padhein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur takbeer kahi aur ham ne Aap key peechey saf baandhi. To Aap ne do rakaatein padhein, phir salaam phera aur ham ne salaam phera jab Aap ne salaam phera. To Aap ko khazeera par rok diya jo uskey liye banai gai thi. To ghar walon ne suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey ghar mein hain. To un mein se aadmi jama huey yahan tak ke ghar mein aadmi bahut ho gaey. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Maalik ne kya kya? Main usey nahi dekhta! To aik aadmi ne kaha: Wo munaafiq hai jo Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat nahi karta. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho. Kya tum usey nahi dekhtey ke us ne La ilaha illallah kaha hai aur us se Allah Taala ka chehra chaahta hai?! To us ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. Raha ham, to Allah ki qasam ham uski muhabbat aur uski baat ko munaafiqon key siwa nahi dekhtey! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To beshak Allah ne dozakh par usey haraam kar diya hai jo La ilaha illallah kahey aur us se Allah ka chehra chaahta ho. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Itbaan ain muhmala key kasra aur ta musanna fauq key sukoon aur uskey baad ba muwahhada key sath hai. Aur khazeerah kha muqta muqta, aur za key sath hai."
"418","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas qaidi laey gaey. To achanak qaidiyon mein se aurat daud rahi hai. Jab us ne qaidiyon mein bachcha paaya to usey liya aur apne pait key sath lagaya aur usey doodh pilaaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum dekhtey ho ke ye aurat apne bachchey ko dozakh mein daalney wali hai? Ham ne kaha: Nahi Allah ki qasam. Aap ne farmaya: Allah apne bandon par is maa key apne bachchey key sath se zyada rehem karne wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"419","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne makhlooq ko paida kya to kitaab mein likha. To wo uskey paas Arsh key oopar hai: Beshak meri rehmat merey ghazab par ghaalib hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"420","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah ne rehmat ko sau hissey mein banaya. To apne paas ninyanbey rok liye, aur zameen mein aik hissa utaara. To us hissey se makhlooq rehem karti hai yahan tak ke jaanwar apna khur apne bachchey se uthata hai is khauf se ke usey lagey. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak Allah Taala key liye sau rehmatein hain, un mein se aik rehmat naazil ki hai jinnaat aur insaan aur jaanwaron aur keerhey makodhey key darmiyaan. Us mein wo hamdardi kartey hain, aur us se rehem kartey hain, aur us se jangli apne bachchey par narm hota hai. Aur Allah Taala ne ninyanbey rehmatein rok li hain jin se wo qayamat key din apne bandon par rehem farmayega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ne Salmaan Farsi (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat se bhi riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala key liye sau rehmatein hain, un mein se rehmat hai jis se makhlooq aapas mein rehem karti hai, aur ninyanbey qayamat key din key liye hain. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak Allah Taala ne jis din aasmaanon aur zameen ko paida kya sau rehmatein paida kein, har rehmat aasmaan sey zameen tak tabaq hai. To us mein se zameen mein rehmat rakhi, us mein walida apne bachchey par narm hoti hai, aur jangli aur parindey baaz baaz par. Phir jab qayamat ka din hoga to usey is rehmat key sath poora farmayega."
"421","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, us mein jo wo apne Rab Tabaarak wa Taala se hikayat kartey hain, riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey bandey ne gunaah kya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mera gunaah bakhsh dey. To Allah Tabaarak wa Taala ne farmaya: Merey bandey ne gunaah kya. To us ne jaan liya ke uska Rab hai jo gunaah bakhshta hai, aur gunaah key sabab pakadta hai. Phir wapas aaya aur gunaah kya. To us ne kaha: Ae Rab! Mera gunaah bakhsh dey. To Tabaarak wa Taala ne farmaya: Merey bandey ne gunaah kya. To us ne jaan liya ke uska Rab hai jo gunaah bakhshta hai, aur gunaah key sabab pakadta hai. Phir wapas aaya aur gunaah kya. To us ne kaha: Ae Rab! Mera gunaah bakhsh dey. To Tabaarak wa Taala ne farmaya: Merey bandey ne gunaah kya. To us ne jaan liya ke uska Rab hai jo gunaah bakhshta hai, aur gunaah key sabab pakadta hai. Beshak main ne apne bandey ko bakhsh diya hai, isliye jo chaahey karey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Uska Taala ka qaul felyafal ma shaaya yaani: Jab tak wo is tarah karta hai, gunaah karta hai aur tauba karta hai, main usey bakhshunga. Kyonke tauba us se pehley ko dha deti hai."
"422","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar tum gunaah na kartey to Allah tumhey ley jaata. Aur aisi qaum laata jo gunaah kartey. To wo Allah Taala se maghfirat maangtey aur wo unhey bakhshta. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"423","Abu Ayyub Khaalid bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Agar tum gunaah na kartey to Allah aisi makhlooq paida farmata jo gunaah kartey. Phir maghfirat maangtey aur wo unhey bakhshta. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"424","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baithey huey they, hamarey sath Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) giroh mein they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey darmiyaan se uth-khadey huey aur ham se dair laga di. To ham ne khauf kya ke Aap ham se kat kar reh jaengey. To ham ghabra gaey aur uth-khadey huey. To main sab se pehley ghabraya. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko talaash karne nikla, yahan tak ke Ansaar key baagh tak aaya, aur lambi hadis zikr ki uskey qaul tak: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jao, phir jis se tum milo is deewaar key peechey jo gawahi deta ho ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jabke uska dil us par yaqeen rakhta ho to usey Jannat ki bashaarat do. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"425","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah Azza wa Jall ka Ibrahim (Alehis salaam) key baarey mein qaul padha: Ae Rab! Beshak unhon-ne bahut sey logon ko gumraah kya hai. Phir jo meri pairwi karey to wo mujh se hai (Ibrahim: 36). Aur Eesa (Alehis salaam) ka qaul: Agar Tu unhey azaab dey to wo Terey bandey hain, aur agar Tu unhey bakhsh dey to beshak Tu Ghaalib hikmat wala hai (Al-Maaida: 118). To Aap ne apne donon haath uthayein aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Meri ummat meri ummat! Aur roey. To Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Ae Jibraeel! Muhammad key paas jao jabke tumhara Rab behtar jaanta hai. Phir us se poochho ke wo kyun rota hai? To Jibraeel Aap key paas aey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aap ko khabar di jo Aap ne farmaya tha, jabke wo behtar jaanta hai. To Allah Taala ne farmaya: Ae Jibraeel! Muhammad key paas jao aur kaho: Beshak ham tumhey tumhari ummat mein raazi kareingey aur tumhey naraaz nahi kareingey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"426","Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey gadhey par sawaar tha. To farmaya: Ae Muaz! Kya tum jaantey ho ke bandon par Allah ka kya haq hai, aur Allah par bandon ka kya haq hai? Main ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak bandon par Allah ka haq hai ke wo uski ibaadat karein aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrayein. Aur bandon ka Allah par haq hai ke wo usey azaab na dey jo uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehrata hai. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main logon ko bashaarat na dun? Aap ne farmaya: Unhey bashaarat na do warna wo bharosa kareingey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"427","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman jab qabr mein poochha jaata hai to gawahi deta hai ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. To wo Uska Taala ka qaul hai: Allah imaan walon ko saabit qaul key sath saabit rakhta hai duniya ki zindagi mein aur aakhirat mein (Ibrahim: 27). (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"428","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak kaafir jab neki karta hai to usey uskey sabab duniya mein khaana khilaaya jaata hai. Raha momin, to beshak Allah Taala uskey liye uski nekiyan aakhirat mein zakheera karta hai, aur usey uski itaat par duniya mein rizq deta hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak Allah momin par aik neki mein zulm nahi karta, usey uskey sabab duniya mein diya jaata hai, aur uskey sabab aakhirat mein badla diya jaata hai. Aur raha kaafir, to usey us bhalai key badley duniya mein khilaaya jaata hai jo us ne Allah Taala key liye ki, yahan tak ke jab wo aakhirat ki taraf pahunchega to uskey paas koi neki nahi hogi jiskey sabab usey badla diya jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"429","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch namazon ki misaal gehri behti hui neher ki si hai jo tum mein se kisi key darwaazey par ho jis mein wo har din paanch martaba ghusl karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Ghamr bahut hai."
"430","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Musalman aadmi mar jaey aur uskey janazey par chaalees aadmi khadey hon jo Allah key sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehratey to Allah unki sifarish uskey haq mein qabool farmayega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"431","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath kheemey mein taqreeban chaalees they. To farmaya: Kya tum raazi ho ke tum Jannat walon ka chauthaai ho? Ham ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi ho ke tum Jannat walon ka tihaai ho? Ham ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Beshak mujhey ummeed hai ke tum Jannat walon ka aadha hogey. Aur wo isliye ke Jannat mein sirf Musalman jaan dakhil hogi. Aur tum shirk walon mein sirf aise ho jaisa kaaley bail ki khaal mein safed baal, ya surkh bail ki khaal mein kaala baal. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"432","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din hoga to Allah har Musalman ki taraf Yahoodi ya Nasraani deyga aur farmayega: Ye dozakh se tumhari nijaat hai. Aur unhin se aik riwayat mein hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat key din Musalmanon mein se log aaengey jinkey gunaah pahaadon jaisey hongey aur Allah unhey unkey liye bakhsh dega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"433","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Momin qayamat key din apne Rab se qareeb kya jaeyga yahan tak ke wo us par apna parda rakheyga. To usey uskey gunaahon ka iqraar karayega. To farmayega: Kya tum fulaan gunaah jaantey ho? Kya tum fulaan gunaah jaantey ho? To wo kaheyga: Ae Rab! Main jaanta hun. Unhon-ne kaha: To beshak main ne usey duniya mein tum par chhupaaya tha, aur main aaj tumhey bakhshta hun. To usey uski nekiyon ka saheefa diya jaeyga. (Muttafaqun aleh). Kanafuhu uska parda aur uski rehmat hai."
"434","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne aik aurat se bosa liya. To wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Allah Taala ne naazil kya: Aur namaz qaim karo din key donon kinaaron mein aur raat key hissey mein. Beshak nekiyan buraiyon ko door karti hain (Hood: 114). To us aadmi ne kaha: Ye merey liye hai ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Meri tamaam ummat key liye hai sab key sab. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"435","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne hadd waley gunaah ka irtikaab kya hai, isliye mujh par hadd qaim karein. Aur namaz haazir hui aur us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padhi. Phir jab namaz poori ki to kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne hadd waley gunaah ka irtikaab kya hai, isliye mujh par Allah ki kitaab mein hadd qaim karein. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum hamarey sath namaz mein haazir huey they? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tum bakhsh diye gaey ho. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur uska qaul asabtu haddan key maana hain: Gunaah jis mein taazeer waajib hoti hai. Aur muraad sharai hadd-e-haqeeqi nahi hai jaisa zina aur sharab waghera ki hadd. Kyonke ye hudood namaz key sath saaqit nahi hotin, aur imam key liye unhey chhorna jaez nahi hai."
"436","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah bandey se raazi hota hai ke wo luqma khaey aur us par uski hamd karey, ya ghoont piye aur us par uski hamd karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Uk lah hamza key fatha key sath hai aur wo khaaney ki aik martaba hai jaisa subah aur shaam ka khaana. Aur Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"437","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala raat mein apna haath pheelata hai taake din ka bura tauba karey, aur din mein apna haath pheelata hai taake raat ka bura tauba karey, yahan tak ke suraj maghrib se tuloo ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"438","Abu Najeeh Amr bin Abasa, ain aur ba key fatha key sath, Sulami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main jaahiliyat mein tha aur gumaan karta tha ke log gumraahi par hain, aur wo kisi chiz par nahi hain, jabke wo buton ki ibaadat kartey they. To main ne Makkah mein aadmi key baarey mein suna jo khabrein khabar deta tha. To main apni sawari par baitha aur uskey paas aaya. To achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chhup kar they jabke Aap ki qaum Aap par jurrat karti thi. To narmi ki yahan tak ke Makkah mein Aap key paas dakhil hua. To main ne Aap se kaha: Tum kaun ho? Aap ne farmaya: Main Nabi hun. Main ne kaha: Aur Nabi kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey Allah ne bheja hai. Main ne kaha: Aur tumhey kis chiz key sath bheja hai? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey rishtedaaron ko jorney key sath bheja hai, aur buton ko todney key sath, aur ke Allah ko ek maana jaey aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehraaya jaey. Main ne kaha: To tumharey sath is par kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aazaad aur ghulaam. Aur us din Aap key sath Abu Bakr aur Bilaal (Raziallahu anhuma) they. Main ne kaha: Beshak main tumhari pairwi karne wala hun. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum aaj key din uski taqat nahi rakhogey. Kya tum meri aur logon ki haalat nahi dekhtey? Lekin apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas jao. Phir jab tum suno ke main zaahir ho gaya hun to merey paas aao. Unhon-ne kaha: To main apne ghar walon ki taraf gaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashreef laey. Aur main apne ghar walon mein tha. To main khabrein poochhta raha, aur logon se poochhta raha jab Aap Madina tashreef laey, yahan tak ke merey ghar walon mein se giroh Madina se aaya. To main ne kaha: Is aadmi ne kya kya jo Madina aaya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Log uski taraf tez hain. Aur uski qaum ne usey qatl karna chaaha lekin taqat na rakh saki. To main Madina aaya aur Aap key paas dakhil hua. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhey pehchaantey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, tum wahi ho jo Makkah mein mujh se miley they. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey uskey baarey mein khabar dein jo Allah ne tumhey sikhaya hai aur main nahi jaanta. Mujhey namaz key baarey mein khabar dein? Aap ne farmaya: Subah ki namaz padho. Phir namaz se ruk jaao yahan tak ke suraj naizey key barabar buland ho jaey. Kyonke wo tuloo hota hai jab tuloo hota hai shaitaan key donon seengon key darmiyaan, aur us waqt kaafir usey sajda kartey hain. Phir namaz padho kyonke namaz haazir hoti hai. Yahan tak ke saaya naizey key barabar seedha ho jaey. Phir namaz se ruk jaao. Kyonke us waqt dozakh bhadkai jaati hai. Phir jab saaya badhey to namaz padho kyonke namaz haazir hoti hai, yahan tak ke Asr padho. Phir namaz se ruk jaao yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho jaey. Kyonke wo ghuroob hota hai shaitaan key donon seengon key darmiyaan, aur us waqt kaafir usey sajda kartey hain. Phir namaz padho kyonke namaz haazir hoti hai yahan tak ke Isha padho. Phir namaz se ruk jaao yahan tak ke Fajr tuloo ho. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Mujhey wuzu key baarey mein khabar dein? Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne wuzu key paani key paas nahi aata aur kulli karta hai aur naak mein paani chadhaata hai aur naak saaf karta hai magar uskey chehrey aur munh aur naak ki khataein gir jaati hain. Phir jab wo Allah key hukm key mutabiq apna chehra dhoota hai jaisa Allah ne usey hukm diya hai to uskey chehrey ki khataein uskey daadhi key kinaaron key sath paani key sath gir jaati hain. Phir apne donon haath kohniyon tak dhoota hai magar uskey haathon ki khataein uski ungliyon key poron key sath paani key sath gir jaati hain. Phir apne sar ka masah karta hai magar uskey sar ki khataein uskey baalon key kinaaron key sath paani key sath gir jaati hain. Phir apne donon paaon takhnon tak dhoota hai magar uskey paaon ki khataein uski ungliyon key poron key sath paani key sath gir jaati hain. Phir agar wo khada ho aur Allah ki hamd karey aur uski sana karey aur usey buzrug kahey jo uska ahel hai, aur apna dil Allah key liye khaalis karey, to wo gunaahon se nikalta hai jaisa us din tha jab uski maa ne usey jana tha. Phir main ne Aap se kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Mujhey iskey baarey mein khabar dein jo Allah ne tumhey sikhaya hai aur main nahi jaanta. Mujhey namaz key baarey mein khabar dein? To wo isi tarah hai. Yahan tak ke main ne kaha: Mujhey wuzu key baarey mein khabar dein? To Aap ne farmaya: Waisa hi jo guzar chuka hai. To Amr bin Abasa ne kaha: Beshak main ne isey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se gunaah ki maafi mein dekha hai. Aur poori hadis Ummeed key baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"439","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah Taala kisi ummat par rehmat ka irada farmata hai to uskey Nabi ko us se pehley qabz farmata hai. To usey uskey liye aagey aur peechey sawab banaata hai. Aur jab kisi ummat ki halaakat ka irada farmata hai to usey azaab deta hai jabke uska Nabi zinda hai. To usey halaak karta hai jabke wo zinda dekhta hai. To uski aankh ko thanda karta hai uski halaakat key sath jab unhon-ne usey jhutlaaya aur uskey hukm ki nafarmaani ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"440","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Main apne bandey key gumaan key paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhta hai, aur main uskey sath hun jahaan wo mujhey yaad karta hai. Aur Allah ki qasam! Allah apne bandey ki tauba se tum mein se uskey se zyada khush hota hai jo apni gumshuda ko jungle mein paata hai. Aur jo mujh se baalisht bhar qareeb hoga to main us se haath bhar qareeb hunga. Aur jo mujh se haath bhar qareeb hoga to main us se do haath qareeb hunga. Aur jab wo merey paas chal kar aayega to main uskey paas daud kar aaunga. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Muslim ki aik riwayat ka lafz hai. Aur uski sharah peechley baab mein guzar chuki hai. Aur Sahihain mein riwayat kya gaya: Aur main uskey sath hun jab wo mujhey yaad karta hai, noon key sath. Aur is riwayat mein haisu sa musallasa key sath hai, aur donon sahih hain."
"441","Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko wafaat se teen din pehley farmatey huey suna: Tum mein se koi na marey magar wo Allah Azza wa Jall key sath husn-e-zann rakhtey huey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"442","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Ae aadmi key betey! Beshak tum jab tak mujh se dua maangtey raho aur mujh se ummeed rakhtey raho main tumhey bakhshunga jo tum se hua aur mujhey parwah nahi. Ae aadmi key betey! Agar tumharey gunaah aasmaan key kinaaron tak pahunch jaein, phir tum mujh se maghfirat maango to main tumhey bakhshunga. Ae aadmi key betey! Beshak agar tum merey paas zameen bhar khataein ley kar aao, phir mujh se milo jabke tum merey sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehratey they, to main tumharey paas us bhar maghfirat ley kar aaunga. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"443","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar momin jaanta ke Allah key paas azaab mein se kya hai to uski Jannat ki tama koi na karta. Aur agar kaafir jaanta ke Allah key paas rehmat mein se kya hai to uski Jannat se koi naumeed na hota. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"444","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab janaza rakha jaata hai aur usey log ya mard apni gardanon par uthatey hain. Phir agar wo naik hai to kehta hai: Mujhey aagey badhao aagey badhao. Aur agar wo naik nahi hai to kehta hai: Haey us par afsos! Usey kahaan le jaatey ho? Uski awaz har chiz sunti hai siwaey insaan key. Aur agar wo suney to behosh ho jaey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"445","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat tum mein se har aik key uskey jootey key tasmey se zyada qareeb hai. Aur dozakh usi tarah hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"446","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Mujh par Quran padho. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main tum par padhun jabke wo tum par naazil hua hai?! Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main pasand karta hun ke usey ghair se sunun. To main ne Aap par Soorah Nisa padhi yahan tak ke is aayat tak aaya: Phir kya haal hoga jab ham har ummat mein se gawaah laaengey aur tumhey in par gawaah laaengey (An-Nisa: 41). Aap ne farmaya: Ab bas karo. To main Aap ki taraf mutawajjah hua aur Aap ki donon aankhein beh rahi thein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"447","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutba diya aisa khutba jis jaisa main ne kabhi nahi suna. To farmaya: Agar tum jaantey jo main jaanta hun to thoda hanstey aur bahut rotey. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba ne apne chehrey dhaanp liye jabke unhey rona tha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur uska bayaan Khauf key baab mein guzar chuka hai."
"448","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dozakh mein wo aadmi dakhil nahi hoga jo Allah key khauf se roya yahan tak ke doodh than mein wapas aa jaey. Aur Allah key raastey ka ghubaar aur dozakh ka dhuaan jama nahi hongey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"449","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saat hain jinhey Allah apne saaye mein saaya dega jis din uskey saaye key siwa koi saaya nahi hoga: Insaaf karne wala, aur jawaan jo Allah ki ibaadat mein bada hua. Aur aadmi jiska dil masaajid mein laga hua hai. Aur do aadmi jinhon-ne Allah mein mohabbat ki, us par jama huey aur us par judaa huey. Aur aadmi jisey martabey aur jamaal wali aurat ne bulaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak main Allah se darta hun. Aur aadmi jis ne sadqa key sath sadqa kya aur usey chhupaya yahan tak ke uska baayaan haath nahi jaanta ke uska daayaan haath kya kharch karta hai. Aur aadmi jis ne Allah ko tanhai mein yaad kya aur uski donon aankhein beh padhein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"450","Abdullah bin Ash-Shikheer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke Aap namaz padh rahey they aur Aap key pait mein ronay se awaz thi jaisa degchi ki awaz hoti hai. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"451","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jall ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke tum par padhun: Lam yakunillazina kafaroo. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur mera naam liya? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. To Ubayy roey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To Ubayy ronay lagey."
"452","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafaat key baad kaha: Hamarey sath Umm Aiman (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf chalo, ham unki ziyaarat karein jaisa wo unki ziyaarat kartey they. Phir jab ham unkey paas pahunchey to wo roein. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey kya rulaata hai? Kya tum nahi jaantin ke jo Allah Taala key paas hai wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye behtar hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main nahi roti ke main nahi jaanti ke jo Allah key paas hai wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye behtar hai. Lekin main roti hun ke wahi aasmaan se munqata ho gai hai. To unhon-ne un donon ko ronay par ubhara. To wo donon unkey sath ronay lagey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur ye Khair walon ki ziyaarat key baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"453","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key dard ne shiddat ikhtiyaar ki to Aap se namaz key baarey mein kaha gaya. To farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz padhaye. To Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha: Beshak Abu Bakr narm dil aadmi hain, jab Quran padhtey hain to rona un par ghaalib aa jaata hai. To farmaya: Usey hukm do ke wo namaz padhaye. Aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Beshak Abu Bakr jab tumharey maqaam par khadey hongey to log ronay ki wjah se nahi sunengey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"454","Ibrahim bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) key paas khaana laaya gaya jabke wo rozedaar they. To farmaya: Musaab bin Umair (Raziallahu anhu) qatl kiye gaey jabke wo mujh se behtar they. To unkey liye wo nahi paaya gaya jis se unhey kafan diya jaey siwaey chaadar key, agar us se unka sar dhaanpa jaata to unkey paaon zaahir hotey, aur agar us se unkey paaon dhaanpey jaatey to unka sar zaahir hota. Phir hamarey liye duniya mein se jo phelaaya gaya phelaaya gaya, ya farmaya: Hamein duniya mein se jo diya gaya diya gaya. Beshak ham ne khauf kya hai ke hamari nekiyan hamarey liye jaldi de di gaei hain. Phir roney lagey yahan tak ke khaana chhor diya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"455","Abu Umama Sudy bin Ajlaan Baahili (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala ko do qatron aur do nishaanon se zyada mehboob koi chiz nahi hai: Allah key khauf se aansuon ka qatra, aur Allah key raastey mein bahaaya jaaney wala khoon ka qatra. Aur raha do nishaan: To Allah Taala key raastey mein nishaan, aur Allah Taala key faraaiz mein se farz mein nishaan. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Irbaaz bin Saariya (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis: Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein waaz farmaya jis se dil laraz gaey aur aankhein beh padhein."
"456","Amr bin Auf Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarraah (Raziallahu anhu) ko Bahrain ki taraf bheja taake uska jizya laein. To wo Bahrain se maal ley kar aey. To Ansaar ne Abu Ubaida key aane ki khabar suni aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Fajr ki namaz key liye haazir huey. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi to wapas aey aur wo Aap key saamney aey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraye jab unhey dekha. Phir farmaya: Shayad tum ne suna hai ke Abu Ubaida Bahrain se kuchh ley kar aaya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan ya Rasulullah. To farmaya: Khush ho jao aur uski ummeed rakho jo tumhey khush karey. Allah ki qasam! Mujhey tum par faqr ka khauf nahi hai, lekin mujhey khauf hai ke duniya tum par phelaai jaeygi jaisa tum se pehley par phelaai gai thi. To tum us par muqaabla karogey jaisa unhon-ne us par muqaabla kya. To wo tumhey halaak karegi jaisa unhey halaak kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"457","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimbar par baithey, aur ham Aap key gird baithey. To farmaya: Beshak us mein se jo main tum par apne baad dartaa hun wo hai jo tum par duniya key phool aur zeenat mein se khola jaeyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"458","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak duniya meethi sabz hai. Aur beshak Allah Taala tumhey us mein khalifa banaata hai. To dekhta hai ke tum kaisey amal kartey ho. Isliye duniya se daro aur aurton se daro. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"459","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Zindagi sirf aakhirat ki zindagi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"460","Unhin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mayyit key peechey teen chaltey hain: Uskey ghar waley aur uska maal aur uska amal. To do wapas aatey hain aur aik baqi rehta hai: Uskey ghar waley aur uska maal wapas aatey hain aur uska amal baqi rehta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"461","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya walon mein se dozakh walon mein sab se naimat waley ko qayamat key din laaya jaeyga. To usey dozakh mein aik gota diya jaeyga. Phir kaha jaeyga: Ae aadmi key betey! Kya tum ne kabhi bhalai dekhi hai? Kya tum par kabhi naimat guzri hai? To wo kaheyga: Nahi Allah ki qasam ae Rab. Aur duniya mein sab se sakht takleef waley ko laaya jaeyga jo Jannat walon mein se hai. To usey Jannat mein aik gota diya jaeyga. To us se kaha jaeyga: Ae aadmi key betey! Kya tum ne kabhi takleef dekhi hai? Kya tum par kabhi sakhti guzri hai? To wo kaheyga: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Mujh par kabhi takleef nahi guzri, aur na main ne sakhti dekhi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"462","Mustaurid bin Shaddaad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya aakhirat mein sirf uski tarah hai jaisa tum mein se koi apni ungli samundar mein rakhey. To dekhey ke wo kis key sath wapas aati hai? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"463","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bazaar se guzrey jabke log Aap key donon pehluon mein they. To chhotey kaan waley marey huey bakri key bachchey par guzrey. To usey liya aur uskey donon kaanon se pakda. Phir farmaya: Tum mein se kaun pasand karta hai ke ye uskey liye dirham key badley ho? To unhon-ne kaha: Ham pasand nahi kartey ke wo hamarey liye kisi chiz key badley ho aur ham uskey sath kya karein? Phir farmaya: Kya tum pasand kartey ho ke wo tumharey liye ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar wo zinda hota to aib hota ke wo chhotey kaan wala hai. Phir kaisey jabke wo mara hua hai! To farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Duniya Allah key nazdeek is se zyada haqeer hai jitna ye tumharey nazdeek hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul kanafataihi yaani: Uskey donon pehluon par. Walasak chhotey kaan wala hai."
"464","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Madina key pathreelay maidaan mein chal raha tha. To hamarey saamney Uhad aaya. To farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Main ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah. To farmaya: Mujhey pasand nahi ke merey paas Uhad jaisa sona ho aur mujh par teen raatein guzrein jabke merey paas us mein se deenaar ho, siwaey kuchh key jo main qarz key liye rokun. Siwaey iskey ke main uskey baarey mein Allah key bandon mein is tarah aur is tarah aur is tarah kahun. Aap key daayein aur Aap key baayein aur Aap key peechey se. Phir chaley aur farmaya: Beshak zyada waley qayamat key din kam waley hongey, siwaey uskey jo maal key sath is tarah aur is tarah aur is tarah kahey. Aap key daayein aur Aap key baayein aur Aap key peechey se. Aur wo kam hain. Phir mujh se farmaya: Apni jagah raho, yahan tak ke main tumharey paas aaun, yahan tak ke na hato. Phir raat key andherey mein chaley yahan tak ke chhup gaey. To main ne awaz suni jo buland hui. To mujhey khauf hua ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko koi pesh aaya hai. To main ne chaaha ke Aap key paas aaun. Phir main ne Aap ka qaul yaad kya: Yahan tak ke main tumharey paas aaun, yahan tak ke na hato. To main na hata yahan tak ke Aap merey paas aey. To main ne kaha: Beshak main ne awaz suni jis se main dara. To usey Aap se zikr kya. To farmaya: Aur kya tum ne usey suna? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Wo Jibraeel they jo merey paas aey aur farmaya: Jo tumhari ummat mein se mar jaey jabke wo Allah key sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehrata tha wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Main ne kaha: Chaahey wo zina karey aur chori karey? Unhon-ne kaha: Chaahey wo zina karey aur chori karey. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai)."
"465","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar merey paas Uhad jaisa sona ho to mujhey khush karega ke mujh par teen raatein na guzrein jabke merey paas us mein se kuchh ho siwaey kuchh key jo main qarz key liye rokun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"466","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us par nazar daalo jo tum se neechey hai, aur us par nazar na daalo jo tum se oopar hai. To wo zyada laaiq hai ke tum Allah ki naimat ko haqeer na samjho jo tum par hai. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai). Aur Bukhari ki riwayat mein hai: Jab tum mein se koi us par nazar daaley jo maal aur khilqat mein us par fazilat diya gaya hai, to wo us par nazar daaley jo us se neechey hai. Aur Bukhari ki riwayat mein hai: Jab tum mein se koi us par nazar daaley jo maal aur khilqat mein us par fazilat diya gaya hai, to wo us par nazar daaley jo us se neechey hai."
"467","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Halaak ho deenaar aur dirham aur qateefa aur khameesa ka banda. Agar diya jaey to raazi ho. Aur agar na diya jaey to raazi na ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"468","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne Ahle Suffa mein se sattar dekhey hain. Un mein se koi aadmi nahi hai jis par chaadar ho. Ya tehband ya kambal. Unhon-ne unhey apni gardanon mein baandha hua hai. Un mein se baaz aadhi pindliyon tak pahunchta hai. Aur un mein se baaz takhnon tak pahunchta hai. To usey apne haath key sath jama karta hai is naapasandgi se ke uska satr dekha jaey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"469","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya momin ki qaid hai aur kaafir ki Jannat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"470","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera kandha pakda aur farmaya: Duniya mein hoja goya tum ajnabi ho, ya raasta paar karne waley. Aur Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) kehtey they: Jab shaam karo to subah ka intizaar na karo. Aur jab subah karo to shaam ka intizaar na karo. Aur apni sehat mein se apni beemari key liye lo, aur apni zindagi mein se apni maut key liye. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"471","Abul Abbas Sehel bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aise amal ki rahnumai karein jo main karun to Allah mujh se mohabbat karey, aur log mujh se mohabbat karein. To farmaya: Duniya mein be-raghbat hoja, Allah tum se mohabbat farmayega. Aur jo logon key paas hai us mein be-raghbat hoja, log tum se mohabbat kareingey. Hasan hadis hai, ise Ibn Maajah waghera ne hasan asaneed se riwayat kya hai."
"472","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar Ibn Al-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne zikr kya jo logon ko duniya mein se pahuncha hai. To farmaya: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha hai ke wo din bhar tadaptey rehtey they aur ghatiya khajoor nahi paatey they jis se apna pait bharein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Daqal daal muhmala key fatha aur qaaf key sath hai: Ghatiya khajoor hai."
"473","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey jabke merey ghar mein koi chiz nahi thi jo jigar wala khaey siwaey jau key aadhey key jo merey taaq mein tha. To main ne us mein se khaaya yahan tak ke mujh par lamba hua. To usey naapa aur wo khatm ho gaya. (Muttafaqun aleh). Shatr sha'eer jau mein se kuchh hai, is tarah Tirmizi ne tafseer ki hai."
"474","Amr bin Al-Haaris jo Juwairiya bint Al-Haaris Ummul Momineen (Raziallahu anhuma) key bhai hain, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni wafaat key waqt deenaar aur na dirham chhora, aur na ghulaam, aur na londi. Aur na kuchh, siwaey apne safed khachchar key jis par Aap sawaar hotey they, aur apne hathyaar, aur zameen jisey Aap ne musaafir key liye sadqa banaaya tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"475","Khabbaab bin Al-Aratt (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath hijrat ki jabke ham Allah Taala ka chehra talab kartey they. To hamara ajr Allah par waaqe hua. To ham mein se koi mar gaya aur us ne apne ajr mein se kuchh nahi khaaya. Un mein se Musaab bin Umair (Raziallahu anhu) hain. Wo Uhad key din qatl kiye gaey aur namrah chhori. To ham jab us se unka sar dhaanptey they to unkey paaon zaahir hotey they. Aur jab us se unkey paaon dhaanptey they to unka sar zaahir hota tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham unka sar dhaanpein, aur unkey paaon par izkhir mein se kuchh rakhein. Aur ham mein se koi hai jiska phal pak gaya hai aur wo usey kaat-ta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Namrah oon ka ranga hua kapda hai. Aur uska qaul aynaa't yaani: Pak gaya aur haasil ho gaya. Aur uska qaul yahdiha ya key fatha aur daal key zamma aur kasra key sath hai, do lughat hain, yaani: Usey kaat-ta hai aur chun-ta hai. Aur ye isti'aara hai uskey liye jo Allah Taala ne un par duniya mein se khola hai aur wo us mein qaadir huey hain."
"476","Sehel bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar duniya Allah key nazdeek machchar key par key barabar hoti to wo kaafir ko us mein se paani ka ghoont nahi pilaata. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"477","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Khabardaar! Beshak duniya maloon hai. Jo kuchh us mein hai maloon hai, siwaey Allah Taala key zikr key, aur jo us se juda ho, aur aalim aur ilm seekhne waley key. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"478","Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jaaydaad na banao warna duniya mein raghbat karogey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"479","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas se guzrey jabke ham apni chhappar ki marammat kar rahey they. To farmaya: Ye kya hai? To ham ne kaha: Wo gir gaya hai aur ham usey durust kar rahey hain. To farmaya: Main muamley ko us se jaldi dekhta hun. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne Bukhari aur Muslim ki sanad key sath riwayat kya hai, aur Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"480","Kaab bin Iyaaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak har ummat ka fitna hai. Aur meri ummat ka fitna maal hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"481","Abu Amr, aur kaha gaya Abu Abdullah, aur kaha gaya Abu Laila, Usman Ibn Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi key betey key liye in khaslaton key siwa koi haq nahi hai: Ghar jis mein wo rehta hai, aur kapda jis se wo apna satr dhaanpta hai, aur roti ka tukda, aur paani. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Sahih hadis hai. Tirmizi ne kaha: Main ne Abu Dawud Sulaiman bin Saalim Balkhi ko suna, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nazar bin Shumail ko suna, unhon-ne kaha: Jalf roti hai jiskey sath saalan nahi hai. Ghair ne kaha: Wo motee roti hai. Harwi ne kaha: Yahaan us se muraad roti ka bartan hai, jaisa bada thaila aur khurji. Aur Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"482","Abdullah bin Ash-Shikheer, sheen aur kha mushaddad muqta muqta key sukoon key sath, (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke Aap padh rahey they: Tumhey kasrat ne ghaafil kar diya. Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi ka beta kehta hai: Mera maal, mera maal! Aur ae aadmi key betey! Kya tumharey maal mein se tumharey liye hai siwaey uskey jo tum ne khaaya aur khatm kya, ya pehna aur bosida kya, ya sadqa kya aur aagey bheja?! Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"483","Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tum se mohabbat karta hun. To farmaya: Dekho tum kya kehtey ho? Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tum se mohabbat karta hun, teen martaba. To farmaya: Agar tum mujh se mohabbat kartey ho to faqr key liye dhaal taiyaar karo. Kyonke faqr us se zyada tez hai jo mujh se mohabbat karta hai sailaab se apni inteha ki taraf. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Tujfaaf ta musanna fauq key kasra aur jeem key sukoon aur fa key takraar key sath hai, aur wo chiz hai jo ghoda pehenta hai taake us se takleef se bachey. Aur wo insaan bhi pehen sakta hai."
"484","Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do bhookey bhediye bakriyon mein chhorey jaein wo unkey liye us se zyada fasaad karne waley nahi hain jo aadmi ka maal aur izzat par harees hona uskey deen key liye hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"485","Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaatai par soey. To farmaya jabke us ne Aap key pehlu mein nishaan daala tha. Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaash ham tumharey liye bistar banaein! To farmaya: Mujhey duniya se kya hai? Main duniya mein sirf us sawaar ki tarah hun jo darakht key neechey saaya haasil karta hai phir chala jaata hai aur usey chhor deta hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"486","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Faqeer Jannat mein ameeron se paanch sau saal pehley dakhil hongey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Sahih hadis hai."
"487","Ibn Abbas aur Imran bin Al-Husain (Raziallahu anhum) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne Jannat mein jhaanka aur uskey aksar walon ko faqeer dekha. Aur dozakh mein jhaanka aur uskey aksar walon ko aurtein dekha. (Muttafaqun aleh Ibn Abbas ki riwayat se). Aur Bukhari ne bhi Imran bin Al-Husain ki riwayat se riwayat kya hai."
"488","Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Jannat key darwaazey par khada hua. To jo us mein dakhil huey unkey aksar maskeen they. Aur dolat waley rok diye gaey they, lekin dozakh walon key baarey mein hukm diya jaa chuka tha ke unhey dozakh ki taraf ley jaaya jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur jidd qismat aur dolat hai. Aur uska bayaan kamzoron ki fazilat key baab mein guzar chuka hai."
"489","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaa'ir ne jo sab se sachi baat kahi hai wo Labeed ka kalima hai: Khabardaar! Har chiz Allah key siwa baatil hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"490","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aale Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jau ki roti se do din lagataar sair nahi huey yahan tak ke Aap faut huey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aale Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashreef laaney key baad se gandum key khaaney se teen raatein lagataar sair nahi huey yahan tak ke Aap faut huey."
"491","Urwa se Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo kehti thein: Allah ki qasam ae meri behan key betey! Beshak ham chaand ki taraf dekhtey they, phir chaand: Do maheenon mein teen chaand. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key gharon mein aag nahi jalai jaati thi. Main ne kaha: Ae khaala! To tumhey kya zinda rakhta tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Do kaaley: Khajoor aur paani. Siwaey iskey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key Ansaar mein se padosi they, aur unkey paas doodh dene waley jaanwar they. Aur wo Rasulullah ko unkey doodhon mein se bhej kar pilaatey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"492","Abu Saeed Maqburi se Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo qaum key paas se guzrey jinkey saamney bhuni hui bakri thi. To unhon-ne usey bulaya lekin us ne khaaney se inkaar kya. Aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) duniya se gaey jabke Aap jau ki roti se sair nahi huey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Musliyah meem key fatha key sath hai, yaani: Bhuni hui."
"493","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaan key upar khaana nahi khaaya yahan tak ke Aap faut huey. Aur Aap ne narm roti nahi khai yahan tak ke Aap faut huey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Aur bhuni hui bakri ko aankh se kabhi nahi dekha."
"494","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha hai jabke wo ghatiya khajoor nahi paatey they jis se apna pait bharein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Daqal ghatiya khajoor hai."
"495","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne naqee nahi dekha jab se Allah Taala ne Aap ko mab'oos kya yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne Aap ko wafaat di. To us se kaha gaya: Kya tumharey paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein chhalniyan thein? Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhalni nahi dekhi jab se Allah Taala ne Aap ko mab'oos kya yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne Aap ko wafaat di. To us se kaha gaya: To tum baghair chhaney jau kaisey khaatey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham usey peestey they aur phoonktey they. To jo udta tha ud jaata tha. Aur jo baqi rehta tha usey goondhtey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul naqee noon key fatha aur qaaf key kasra aur ya key tashdeed key sath hai, aur wo hawari roti hai, aur wo darmak hai. Uska qaul sarainahu sa musallasa, phir ra mushaddad, phir ya musanna tahtaani, phir noon key sath hai, yaani: Usey geela kya aur goondha."
"496","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din ya raat nikley. To achanak Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) they. To farmaya: Tumhey tumharey gharon se is waqt kis ne nikaala hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Bhook ne ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Aur main, us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Mujhey us ne nikaala hai jis ne tumhey nikaala hai. Utho. To wo donon Aap key sath khadey huey. To wo Ansaar mein se aik aadmi key paas aey. To wo apne ghar mein nahi tha. Phir jab aurat ne usey dekha to us ne kaha: Khush aamdeed. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Fulaan kahaan hai? Us ne kaha: Wo hamarey liye meetha paani laaney gaya hai. Jab Ansaari aaya to us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key donon saathiyon ko dekha. Phir us ne kaha: Tamam tareefein Allah key liye hain. Aaj mujh se zyada izzat waley mehmaan wala koi nahi hai. To wo gaya aur unkey paas khoshaan ley kar aaya jis mein kachchi aur pakki aur taaza khajoorein thein. To us ne kaha: Khao. Aur chhuri li. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Doodh wali se bacho. To us ne unkey liye zibah kya aur unhon-ne bakri mein se aur us khoshaan mein se khaaya aur piya. Phir jab wo sair ho gaey aur sairaab ho gaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum se is naimat key baarey mein qayamat key din zaroor poochha jaeyga. Tumhey tumharey gharon se bhook ne nikaala. Phir tum wapas nahi aey yahan tak ke tumhey ye naimat pahunchi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul yastaazibu yaani: Meetha paani talab karta hai, aur wo pakeeza hai. Walizq ain key kasra aur zaal muqta muqta key sukoon key sath hai, aur wo khoshaan hai, aur wo tehni hai. Walmudyah meem key zamma aur kasra key sath hai: Wo chhuri hai. Walhaloob doodh wali hai. Aur us Ansaari key baarey mein sawal jiskey paas wo aey they wo Abu Al-Haisham bin At-Taihaan (Raziallahu anhu) hain, is tarah Tirmizi waghera ki riwayat mein bayaan key sath aaya hai."
"497","Khaalid bin Umair Adawi se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Utba bin Ghazwaan ne hamein khutba diya, jabke wo Basra par ameer they. To Allah ki hamd ki aur uski sana ki. Phir kaha: Hamd key baad, beshak duniya ne katney ki khabar di hai, aur tez wapas hui hai. Aur us mein se bartan ki baqi teh key siwa kuchh baqi nahi raha hai jisey uska saathi jama karta hai. Aur beshak tum us se us ghar ki taraf muntaqil honay waley ho jisey zawaal nahi hai. Isliye behtreen key sath muntaqil ho jo tumharey paas hai. Kyonke hamarey liye zikr kya gaya hai ke pathar dozakh key kinaarey se phenka jaata hai aur us mein sattar saal girta hai. Wo uskey teh tak nahi pahunchta. Aur Allah ki qasam wo zaroor bharegi. Kya tum taajjub kartey ho!? Aur beshak hamarey liye zikr kya gaya hai ke Jannat key darwaazon mein se do kiwaron key darmiyaan chaalees saal ki musaafat hai. Aur us par din aayega jabke wo bheed se bhara hoga. Aur beshak main ne apne aap ko dekha hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath saat mein saatwaan tha jabke hamarey paas darkhton key patton key siwa khaana nahi tha. Yahan tak ke hamarey jabdey zakhmi ho gaey. To main ne chaadar uthai aur usey merey aur Saad bin Maalik key darmiyaan phaada. To main ne uskey nisf key sath tehband baandha, aur Saad ne uskey nisf key sath tehband baandha. To aaj ham mein se koi subah nahi karta magar wo sheheron mein se sheher par ameer hai. Aur beshak main Allah ki panah maangta hun ke main apne nafs mein azeem hun, aur Allah key nazdeek chhota hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul aazanat madd alif key sath hai, yaani: Khabar di. Aur uska qaul bisarm saad key zamma key sath hai, yaani uskey katney aur fana key sath. Aur uska qaul wawallat hizaa ha muhmala maftuha, phir zaal muqta muqta mushaddad, phir alif mamdooda key sath hai, yaani: Tez. Was subaabah saad muhmala key zamma key sath hai, aur wo thodi baqi hai. Aur uska qaul yatasaabaha ba key tashdeed se ha se pehley hai, yaani: Usey jama karta hai. Wal kazeed bahut bhara hua hai. Aur uska qaul qarihat qaaf key fatha aur ra key kasra key sath hai, yaani: Un mein zakhm huey."
"498","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne hamarey liye kambal aur mota tehband nikaala aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) in donon mein faut huey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"499","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main Arab mein sab se pehla hun jis ne Allah key raastey mein teer maara. Aur beshak ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwa kartey they jabke hamarey paas hulbah aur keeker key patton key siwa khaana nahi tha. Yahan tak ke ham mein se koi rakhta tha jaisa bakri rakhti hai jiskey sath milawat nahi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Hulah ha muhmala key zamma aur ba muwahhada key sukoon key sath hai: Aur wo aur samar, jungle key darkhton mein se maroof do qismein hain."
"500","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Aale Muhammad ka rizq guzaara bana. (Muttafaqun aleh). Ahl-e-lughat wal ghareeb ne kaha: Qootan key maana hain: Yaani jo jaan bachaey."
"501","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey siwa koi mabood nahi! Beshak main bhook se apne jigar key sath zameen par tek lagata tha. Aur beshak main bhook se apne pait par pathar baandhta tha. Aur beshak main aik din unkey raastey par baitha jis se wo nikaltey hain. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas se guzrey. To Aap muskuraye jab mujhey dekha. Aur Aap ne pehchaana jo merey chehrey mein hai aur jo merey dil mein hai. Phir farmaya: Ae Abu Hirr! Main ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Saath hoja. Aur chaley aur main Aap key peechey chala. To Aap dakhil huey aur ijazat maangi. To mujhey ijazat di gai aur main dakhil hua. To pyaaley mein doodh paaya. To farmaya: Ye doodh kahaan se hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Fulaan, ya fulaani ne tumhey tohfey mein diya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hirr! Main ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Ahle Suffa key paas jaao aur unhey merey liye bulao. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Ahle Suffa Islam key mehmaan hain. Wo ghar walon par rehtey hain, aur na maal par. Aur jab Aap key paas tohfa aata to unki taraf bhejty aur us mein se letey aur unhey us mein shareek kartey. To mujhey bura laga aur main ne kaha: Aur Ahle Suffa mein ye doodh kya hai! Main zyada haqdaar tha ke main is doodh mein se ghoont paaun jis se taqat haasil karun. Phir jab wo aaein aur Aap ne mujhey hukm diya to main wahi tha jo unhey deta hun. Aur ye doodh mujhey kahaan pahunchega? Aur Allah aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki itaat key siwa kuchh nahi tha. To main unkey paas aaya aur unhey bulaya. To wo aey aur ijazat maangi. To unhey ijazat di gai aur unhon-ne ghar mein apni majlisein lein. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hirr! Main ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Lo aur unhey do. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne pyaala liya aur aadmi ko dene laga aur wo peeta tha yahan tak ke sairaab hota tha. Phir merey paas pyaala wapas karta tha. To doosrey ko deta tha aur wo peeta tha yahan tak ke sairaab hota tha. Phir merey paas pyaala wapas karta tha, yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahuncha jabke tamaam qaum sairaab ho chuki thi. To Aap ne pyaala liya aur apne haath par rakha. To meri taraf dekha aur muskuraye. To farmaya: Ae Abu Hirr! Main ne kaha: Haazir hun ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Main aur tum baqi rahey. Main ne kaha: Sach kaha ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Baitho aur piyo. To main baitha aur piya. To farmaya: Piyo. To main ne piya. To Aap kehtey rahey: Piyo. Yahan tak ke main ne kaha: Nahi, us zaat ki qasam jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja hai! Merey liye jagah nahi hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne mujhey pyaala dikhaaya aur Aap ne baqi piya."
"502","Muhammad bin Seereen se Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne apne aap ko dekha hai jabke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key mimbar aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) key hujrey key darmiyaan behosh gira hua tha. To aaney wala aata tha aur apna paaon meri gardan par rakhta tha. Aur wo dekhta tha ke main deewaana hun, jabke mujh mein deewangi nahi thi. Mujh mein bhook key siwa kuchh nahi tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"503","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey jabke Aap ki zirah Yahoodi key paas tees saa jau key badley girvi thi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"504","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni zirah jau key badley girvi rakhi. Aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jau ki roti aur pighli hui charbi ley kar gaya. Aur beshak main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Aale Muhammad key liye subah saa nahi hua aur na shaam hua. Jabke wo nau ghar they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Ihaalah hamza key kasra key sath hai: Pighli hui charbi. Was sanikhah noon aur kha muqta muqta key sath hai, aur wo badli hui hai."
"505","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne Ahle Suffa mein se sattar dekhey hain. Un mein se koi aadmi nahi hai jis par chaadar ho. Ya tehband ya kambal. Unhon-ne unhey apni gardanon mein baandha hua hai. Un mein se baaz aadhi pindliyon tak pahunchta hai. Aur un mein se baaz takhnon tak pahunchta hai. To usey apne haath key sath jama karta hai is naapasandgi se ke uska satr dekha jaey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"506","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bistar chamdey ka tha jiskey andar khajoor ki chhaal thi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"507","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baithey huey they ke Ansaar mein se aadmi aaya aur Aap ko salaam kya. Phir Ansaari peeth pher kar gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Ansaar key bhai! Mera bhai Saad bin Ubaada kaisa hai? To us ne kaha: Achchha hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun uski ayadat karta hai? To wo khada hua aur ham uskey sath khadey huey, jabke ham baarah se kuchh oopar they. Ham par na jootey they, aur na moze, aur na topiyan, aur na qameezein. Ham us khaari zameen mein chaltey they, yahan tak ke uskey paas aey. To uski qaum uskey ird gird se peechey hati yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba jo Aap key sath they, qareeb huey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"508","Imran bin Al-Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein behtreen mera zamaana hai. Phir jo unkey peechey hain. Phir jo unkey peechey hain. Imran ne kaha: To mujhey nahi maloom Aap ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do martaba ya teen martaba. Phir unkey baad qaum hogi jo gawahi deingi aur un se gawahi nahi maangi jaeygi. Aur khayaanat kareingi aur amaanat nahi di jaengi. Aur nazr maaneingi aur poori nahi kareingi. Aur un mein motaapa zaahir hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"509","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae aadmi key betey! Beshak tumhara fazl kharch karna tumharey liye behtar hai. Aur usey rokna tumharey liye bura hai. Aur guzaarey par malaamat nahi ki jaati. Aur us se shuru karo jisey tum khilaatey ho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"510","Ubaidullah bin Mihsan Ansaari Khatmi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se subah karey jabke wo apne ghar mein aman mein hai, apne jism mein aafiyat mein hai, uskey paas uskey din ka guzaara hai, to goya uskey liye duniya apne tamaam hissey key sath jama ki gai hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"511","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak kamyaab hua jo Musalman hua, aur uska rizq guzaara tha, aur Allah ne usey us par qanaat di jo us ne usey diya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"512","Abu Muhammad Fazaala bin Ubaid Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Khushkhabri hai uskey liye jo Islam ki hidayat paa gaya, aur uski maeeshat guzaara thi, aur qanaat ki. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"513","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) lagataar raatein bhookey sotey they. Aur Aap key ghar waley raat ka khaana nahi paatey they. Aur unkey aksar roti jau ki roti thi. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"514","Fazaala bin Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab logon ko namaz padhaatey they to khadey honay ki wjah se aadmi gir jaatey they namaz mein faqr ki wjah se, jabke wo Ashaab-e-Suffa they, yahan tak ke dehaati kehtey: Ye deewaaney hain. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padhtey to unki taraf wapas aatey aur farmatey: Agar tum jaantey ke tumharey liye Allah Taala key paas kya hai to tum pasand kartey ke faqr aur haajat mein zyada ho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Sahih hadis hai. Khasaasah faqr aur sakht bhook hai."
"515","Abu Kareema Miqdaam bin Maadi Karib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aadmi ne pait se bura bartan nahi bhara. Aadmi key betey ko luqmey kaafi hain jo uski peeth seedhi rakhein. Phir agar wo zaroor karne wala ho to tihaai khaaney key liye, aur tihaai peeney key liye, aur tihaai saans key liye. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Uklaat yaani: Luqmey."
"516","Abu Umama Iyaas bin Saalaba Ansaari Haarithi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba ne aik din Aap key paas duniya ka zikr kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi suntey? Kya tum nahi suntey? Beshak saadgi imaan mein se hai. Beshak saadgi imaan mein se hai, yaani: Khushk mizaaji. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai. Bazaazah ba muwahhada aur zaalain muqta muqta key sath hai, aur wo haalat ki khasta haali hai, aur umda libaas ka tark hai. Aur raha taqahhul to qaaf aur ha key sath hai. Ahl-e-lughat ne kaha: Mutaqahhil wo aadmi hai jiski khaal sakht maeeshat ki wjah se khushk ho, aur aaraam ka tark ho."
"517","Abu Abdullah Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein bheja aur ham par Abu Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) ko ameer banaaya taake ham Quraish key qafiley ko milein. Aur hamein chamdey key thailay mein khajoor tosha diya jiskey siwa hamarey liye kuchh nahi paaya tha. To Abu Ubaida hamein khajoor khajoor detey they. To kaha gaya: Tum uskey sath kya kartey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham usey choostey they jaisa bachcha choosta hai. Phir us par paani peetey they. To wo hamein din sey raat tak kaafi hoti thi. Aur ham apni laathiyon key sath pattey jhaadtey they. Phir usey paani key sath bhigotey they aur khaatey they. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ham samundar key kinaarey par chaley. To samundar key kinaarey par hamarey liye badi teelay jaisi chiz uthi. To ham uskey paas aey aur wo jaanwar tha jisey Anbar kaha jaata hai. To Abu Ubaida ne kaha: Murdaar hai. Phir kaha: Nahi, balke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key qaasid hain aur Allah key raastey mein hain, jabke tum majboor ho gaey ho, isliye khao. To ham us par maheena rahey jabke ham teen sau they, yahan tak ke motey ho gaey. Aur beshak main ne hamein dekha hai ke ham uski aankh key garhey mein se gharon key sath tail nikaaltey they, aur us mein se bail jaisey ya bail key barabar tukdey kaat-tey they. Aur beshak Abu Ubaida ne ham mein se teerah aadmiyon ko liya aur unhey uski aankh key garhey mein bithaya. Aur uski pasliyon mein se pasli li aur usey khada kya. Phir hamarey paas sab se badey oont par kajaawa rakha aur wo uskey neechey se guzra. Aur ham ne uskey gosht mein se tosha liya aur sookha gosht. Phir jab ham Madina aey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se uska zikr kya. To farmaya: Wo rizq hai jo Allah ne tumharey liye nikaala hai. To kya tumharey paas uskey gosht mein se kuchh hai aur tum hamein khilao? To ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf us mein se bheja aur Aap ne khaaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Jiraab chamdey ka maroof bartan hai, aur wo jeem key kasra aur fatha key sath hai, aur kasra afsah hai. Uska qaul namassuha meem key fatha key sath hai. Walkhabt maroof darkht key pattey hain jinhey oont khaatey hain. Walkaseeb rait ka teela hai. Walwaqb waao key fatha aur qaaf key sukoon aur uskey baad ba muwahhada key sath hai, aur wo aankh ka garha hai. Ha key takhfeef key sath: Yaani us par kajaawa rakha. Shaaiq sookha gosht hai."
"518","Asma bint Yazeed (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qameez ki aasteen kalaai tak thi. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Rusgh saad aur rusgh seen key sath bhi hai: Wo kalaai aur kohni key darmiyaan jor hai."
"519","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ham Khandaq key din khod rahey they. To sakht chataan pesh aai. To wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur kaha: Ye chataan Khandaq mein pesh aai hai. To farmaya: Main utarney wala hun. Phir khadey huey jabke Aap ka pait pathar key sath bandha hua tha. Aur ham teen din rahey aur zaaiqa nahi chakha. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuddal li aur maara. To wo retela teela ho gaya, ya narm. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey ghar ki ijazat dein. To main ne apni biwi se kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein kuchh dekha hai jis par sabr nahi hai. To tumharey paas kuchh hai? To us ne kaha: Merey paas jau aur bakri ka bachcha hai. To us ne bakri ka bachcha zibah kya aur jau peesi yahan tak ke ham ne gosht degchi mein daala. Phir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke aata goondha jaa chuka tha, aur degchi patharon key darmiyaan thi jo pakne key qareeb thi. To main ne kaha: Mera thoda khaana hai. Isliye tum utho ya Rasulullah aur aik ya do aadmi. Aap ne farmaya: Wo kitna hai? To main ne Aap se zikr kya. To farmaya: Bahut achchha hai. Us se kaho ke wo degchi na utaarey, aur na tandoor se roti nikaaley yahan tak ke main aaun. To farmaya: Utho. To Muhaajireen aur Ansaar khadey huey. To main uskey paas dakhil hua aur kaha: Tum par afsos! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Muhaajireen aur Ansaar aur jo unkey sath hain aey hain! Us ne kaha: Kya us ne tum se poochha? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Dakhil ho aur bheed na karo. To wo roti todtey they, aur us par gosht rakhtey they, aur degchi aur tandoor ko dhaanptey they jab us mein se letey, aur apne sahaaba key qareeb kartey they phir nikaaltey. To wo todtey rahey aur nikaaltey rahey yahan tak ke wo sair ho gaey. Aur us mein se baqi raha. To farmaya: Ye khao aur tohfa do, kyonke logon ko bhook pahunchi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jabir ne kaha: Jab Khandaq khodi gai to main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bhookey dekha. To apni biwi ki taraf wapas aaya aur kaha: Kya tumharey paas kuchh hai? Kyonke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein sakht bhook dekhi hai. To us ne merey liye thaila nikaala jis mein jau ka saa tha. Aur hamarey paas paltu jaanwar tha. To usey zibah kya, aur jau peesi. Phir main Aap key paas aaya jabke wo pak rahey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Utho. To tamaam log khadey huey. To main uskey paas aaya aur usey khabar di. To us ne kaha: Allah us par rehem farmaye, Allah us par rehem farmaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Dakhil ho aur bheed na karo. To wo khaatey rahey yahan tak ke sair ho gaey. Phir wo aur degchi wapas aaein jabke wo bhari hui thein. To Aap ne farmaya: Khao aur tohfa do, kyonke logon ko bhook pahunchi hai."
"520","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Talha ne Umm Sulaim se kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki awaz kamzor suni hai jis mein bhook pehchaanta hun. To kya tumharey paas kuchh hai? To us ne kaha: Haan. To us ne jau ki rotiyan nikaalein. Phir apna dupatta liya aur roti ko baaz key sath lapeta. Phir usey merey kapdey key neechey daala aur mujhey baaz key sath wapas kya. Phir mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bheja. To usey ley kar gaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid mein baith-ney huey paaya, jabke Aap key sath log they. To main un par khada hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tumhey Abu Talha ne bheja hai? To main ne kaha: Haan. To farmaya: Kya khaaney key liye? To main ne kaha: Haan. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Utho. To wo unkey aagey chaley yahan tak ke main Abu Talha key paas aaya aur usey khabar di. To Abu Talha ne kaha: Ae Umm Sulaim! Beshak Rasulullah logon key sath aey hain jabke hamarey paas wo nahi hai jo ham unhey khilaein? To us ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. To Abu Talha chaley yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se miley. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uskey sath aey yahan tak ke donon dakhil huey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lao jo tumharey paas hai ae Umm Sulaim. To wo wo roti laai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey baarey mein hukm diya aur wo todi gai. Aur Umm Sulaim ne us par ghee ki kuppi nichodi aur saalan banaaya. Phir us mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha jo Allah ne chaaha ke kahein. Phir farmaya: Das ko ijazat do. To unhey ijazat di gai. To unhon-ne khaaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaey, phir nikley. Phir farmaya: Das ko ijazat do. To unhey ijazat di gai. To unhon-ne khaaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaey, phir nikley. Phir farmaya: Das ko ijazat do. To unhey ijazat di gai yahan tak ke tamaam qaum ne khaaya aur sair ho gaey. Aur qaum sattar aadmi ya assi they. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Wo das ko dakhil kartey rahey aur das ko nikaaltey rahey, yahan tak ke un mein se koi baqi nahi raha magar dakhil hua. To us ne khaaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaya. Phir usey taiyaar kya aur wo waisi thi jaisi unhon-ne us mein se khaaya tha."
"521","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dolat saamaan ki kasrat se nahi hai, lekin dolat nafs ki dolat hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Arz ain aur ra key fatha key sath hai: Wo maal hai."
"522","Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak kamyaab hua jo Musalman hua, aur guzaarey ka rizq diya gaya, aur Allah ne usey us par qanaat di jo us ne usey diya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"523","Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga aur Aap ne mujhey diya. Phir maanga aur Aap ne mujhey diya. Phir maanga aur Aap ne mujhey diya. Phir farmaya: Ae Hakeem! Beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai. Phir jo usey nafs ki sakhaawat key sath ley to uskey liye us mein barkat di jaati hai. Aur jo usey nafs key lalach key sath ley to uskey liye us mein barkat nahi di jaati. Aur wo uski tarah tha jo khaata hai aur sair nahi hota. Aur oopar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. Hakeem ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us zaat ki qasam jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja hai! Main tumharey baad kisi se kuchh nahi lunga yahan tak ke duniya se judaa hun. To Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) Hakeem ko bulaatey they taake usey ata dein. To wo us se kuchh qabool karne se inkaar karta tha. Phir Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey bulaaya taake usey dey. To us ne qabool karne se inkaar kya. To farmaya: Ae Musalmanon ki jamaat! Main tumhey Hakeem par gawaah karta hun ke main us par uska haq pesh karta hun jo Allah ne uskey liye is maal-e-fai mein taqseem kya hai aur wo leney se inkaar karta hai. To Hakeem ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baad kisi se kuchh nahi liya yahan tak ke faut ho gaya. (Muttafaqun aleh). Yarzao ra phir za phir hamza key sath hai, yaani: Wo kisi se kuchh nahi leta tha. Aur raza ki asal kami hai, yaani: Wo leney key sath kisi ko kami nahi deta tha. Wa ishraafun nafs uska lalach aur cheez mein tama hai. Sakhaawatun nafs cheez ki taraf lalach na hona, aur us mein tama na hona, aur uski parwah na hona aur lalach hai."
"524","Abu Burda se Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwey mein nikley, jabke ham chhey aadmi they jinkey darmiyaan oont tha jis par ham baari kartey they. To hamarey paaon zakhmi ho gaey aur mera paaon zakhmi ho gaya. Aur merey naakhun gir gaey. To ham apne paaon par kapdey lapet-tey they. Isliye us ghazwey ka naam Zaatur Riqa rakha gaya jo ham apne paaon par kapdon se baandhtey they. Abu Burda ne kaha: To Abu Musa ne ye hadis bayan ki. Phir usey napasand kya. Aur kaha: Main kya karunga ke usey zikr karun! Unhon-ne kaha: Goya wo napasand karta tha ke uskey amal mein se kuchh ho jo us ne faash kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"525","Amr bin Taghlib, ta musanna fauq key fatha aur ghain muqta muqta key sukoon aur laam key kasra key sath, (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas maal ya qaidi laey gaey aur Aap ne taqseem kya. To Aap ne aadmiyon ko diya, aur aadmiyon ko chhora. To Aap ko pahunchi ke jinhey chhora unhon-ne naraazgi ki. To Allah ki hamd ki phir uski sana ki, phir farmaya: Hamd key baad, Allah ki qasam! Beshak main aadmi ko deta hun aur aadmi ko chhorta hun, jabke jo main chhorta hun wo mujhey us se zyada mehboob hai jisey main deta hun. Lekin main to qaumon ko deta hun uskey liye jo main unkey dilon mein bechaini aur ghabrahat dekhta hun. Aur qaumon ko us par chhorta hun jo Allah ne unkey dilon mein dolat aur bhalai rakhi hai. Un mein se Amr bin Taghlib hain. Amr bin Taghlib ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Mujhey pasand nahi ke merey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key kalimey key badley surkh oont hon. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Hala' sakht bechaini hai, aur kaha gaya: Bechaini hai."
"526","Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Oopar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. Aur us se shuru karo jisey tum khilaatey ho. Aur behtreen sadqa be-niyaazi ki peeth se hai. Aur jo paakdaamani ikhtiyaar kareyga Allah usey paakdaaman farmayega. Aur jo be-niyaaz hoga Allah usey be-niyaaz farmayega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai, aur Muslim ka lafz mukhtasar hai."
"527","Abu Sufyan Sakhr bin Harb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maangney mein israaf na karo. Allah ki qasam! Tum mein se koi mujh se kuchh nahi maangta aur uskey maangney key sabab meri taraf se uskey liye kuchh nikalta hai jabke main uskey liye naapasand karne wala hun, aur usey us mein barkat di jaati hai jo main ne usey diya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"528","Abu Abdur Rahman Auf bin Maalik Ashjai (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas nau ya aath ya saat they. To farmaya: Kya tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baiyat nahi kartey? Jabke ham naey ahd waley they baiyat key. To ham ne kaha: Ham ne tum se baiyat ki hai ya Rasulullah. To ham tum se kis par baiyat karein? Aap ne farmaya: Is par ke tum Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao. Aur paanch namazein, aur itaat karo. Aur chhupi hui baat aahista kahi: Aur logon se kuchh na maango. To main ne un giroh mein se baaz ko dekha ke un mein se kisi ka koda girta tha aur wo kisi se nahi maangta tha ke usey usey dey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"529","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi key sath maangna rehta hai yahan tak ke wo Allah Taala se milega jabke uskey chehrey mein gosht ka tukda nahi hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh). Muz'ah meem key zamma aur za key sukoon aur ain muhmala key sath hai: Tukda hai."
"530","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimbar par they, aur sadqa aur maangney se paakdaamani ka zikr kya: Oopar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. Aur oopar wala haath kharch karne wala hai, aur neechey wala maangney wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"531","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon se kasrat key liye maangta hai to wo angaarey maangta hai. Isliye kam karey ya zyada. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"532","Samura bin Jundab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak maangna kharonch hai jis se aadmi apna chehra kharonchta hai. Siwaey iskey ke aadmi sultaan se maangey ya us muamley mein jo zaroori ho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai. Kadd kharonch waghera hai."
"533","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jisey faqr pahunchy aur usey logon key supurd karey to uska faqr band nahi hoga. Aur jo usey Allah key supurd karey to anqareeb Allah uskey liye jald ya dair se rizq dega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Yus hiku sheen key kasra key sath hai, yaani tez karta hai."
"534","Saubaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaun merey liye zamaant leyga ke wo logon se kuchh nahi maangega, aur main uskey liye Jannat ki zamaant lunga? To main ne kaha: Main. To wo kisi se kuchh nahi maangta tha. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"535","Abu Bishr Qabeesa bin Al-Makhaariq (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne hamaalat uthaai aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein maanga. To farmaya: Thehro yahan tak ke hamarey paas sadqa aey aur ham tumharey liye uska hukm karein. Phir farmaya: Ae Qabeesa! Beshak maangna sirf teen mein se aik key liye halaal hai: Aadmi jo hamaalat uthaey. To uskey liye maangna halaal hai yahan tak ke usey paa ley, phir rok ley. Aur aadmi jisey aafat pahunchy jo uska maal tabaah kar dey. To uskey liye maangna halaal hai yahan tak ke guzaarey key barabar paa ley, ya farmaya: Guzaarey key barabar. Aur aadmi jisey faqr pahunchy, yahan tak ke uski qaum mein se aqal walon mein se teen kahein: Beshak fulaan ko faqr pahunchi hai. To uskey liye maangna halaal hai yahan tak ke guzaarey key barabar paa ley, ya farmaya: Guzaarey key barabar. To unkey siwa maangna ae Qabeesa haraam hai, uska khaaney wala usey haraam khaata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Hamaalah ha key fatha key sath hai: Ke do girohon key darmiyaan ladai waghera waaqe ho. To insaan unkey darmiyaan maal par sulah karey jo wo uthaata hai aur apne nafs par laazim karta hai. Waljaaihah aafat hai jo insaan key maal ko pahunchti hai. Walqiwaam qaaf key kasra aur fatha key sath hai: Wo hai jis se insaan ka muamla qaim hota hai maal waghera mein se. Was sadaad seen key kasra key sath hai: Wo hai jo mohtaaj ki haajat poori karey aur usey kaafi ho. Walfaaqah faqr hai. Walhuja aqal hai."
"536","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi hai jo logon par ghoomta hai jisey aik ya do luqmey wapas kar dein, aur aik ya do khajoorein. Lekin miskeen wo hai jo be-niyaazi nahi paata jo usey be-niyaaz karey. Aur usey pehchaana nahi jaata aur us par sadqa kya jaey. Aur wo khada nahi hota aur logon se maangta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"537","Saalim bin Abdullah bin Umar se apne waalid Abdullah bin Umar se Umar (Raziallahu anhum) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey ata detey they. To main kehta tha: Usey dey do jo mujh se uska zyada mohtaaj hai. To farmaya: Usey lo. Jab tumharey paas is maal mein se kuchh aey jabke tum lalach nahi rakhtey aur na maangtey ho, to usey lo aur usey maal banao. Phir agar chaho to khao, aur agar chaho to sadqa karo. Aur jo nahi, to uskey peechey apna nafs na lagao. Saalim ne kaha: To Abdullah kisi se kuchh nahi maangta tha, aur na usey wapas karta tha jo usey diya jaata tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"538","Abu Abdullah Zubair bin Al-Awwaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni rasiyan ley phir pahaad ki taraf aey aur lakdi ka gaththa apni peeth par ley kar aey aur usey baichey. To Allah uskey sath uska chehra bachaey. Ye uskey liye behtar hai ke wo logon se maangey, chaahey wo usey dein ya mana karein. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"539","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni peeth par lakdi ka gaththa uthakar ley jaey, ye uskey liye behtar hai ke wo kisi se maangey aur wo usey dey ya mana karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"540","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dawood (Alehis salaam) apne haath ki kamaai key siwa nahi khaatey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"541","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zakariya (Alehis salaam) badhai they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"542","Miqdaam bin Maadi Karib (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi ne kabhi us khaaney se behtar khaana nahi khaaya ke wo apne haath ki kamaai mein se khaey. Aur beshak Allah key Nabi Dawood (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne haath ki kamaai mein se khaatey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"543","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rashk sirf do mein hai: Aik aadmi jisey Allah ne maal diya. To usey haq mein uskey kharch karne par laga diya. Aur aik aadmi jisey Allah ne hikmat di. To wo uskey sath faisla karta hai aur usey sikhaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"544","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun hai jiska waaris ka maal usey apne maal se zyada mehboob ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein se koi nahi magar uska maal usey zyada mehboob hai. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak uska maal wo hai jo us ne aagey bheja, aur uskey waaris ka maal wo hai jo us ne peechey rakha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"545","Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dozakh se bacho chaahey khajoor key tukdey se. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"546","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se koi chiz nahi maangi gai aur Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"547","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi din nahi jis mein bandey subah kartey hain magar do farishtey utartey hain. To un mein se aik kehta hai: Ae Allah! Kharch karne waley ko badla ata farma. Aur doosra kehta hai: Ae Allah! Rokne waley ko halaakat ata farma. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"548","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Kharch karo ae aadmi key betey! Tum par kharch kya jaeyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"549","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kaun sa Islam behtar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tum khaana khilaao, aur salaam karo jisey tum jaantey ho aur jisey tum nahi jaantey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"550","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaalees khaslatein hain jinki aala bakri ka doodh dena hai. Jo aamil un mein se kisi khaslat par uskey sawaab ki ummeed aur uskey waadey ki tasdeeq key sath amal karey to Allah Taala usey uskey sabab Jannat mein dakhil farmayega. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur uska bayaan guzar chuka hai Bhalai key raaston ki kasrat key baab mein."
"551","Abu Umama Sudy bin Ajlaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae aadmi key betey! Beshak tumhara fazl kharch karna tumharey liye behtar hai. Aur usey rokna tumharey liye bura hai. Aur guzaarey par malaamat nahi ki jaati. Aur us se shuru karo jisey tum khilaatey ho. Aur oopar wala haath neechey waley haath se behtar hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"552","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Islam par koi chiz nahi maangi gai magar Aap ne di. Aur beshak Aap key paas aadmi aaya aur Aap ne usey do pahaadon key darmiyaan bakriyan dein. To wo apni qaum ki taraf wapas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae qaum! Musalman hojao. Kyonke Muhammad deta hai jo faqr se nahi darta hai. Aur beshak aadmi Musalman hota tha jabke wo sirf duniya chahta tha. To thodi dair nahi guzarti thi yahan tak ke Islam usey duniya aur jo kuchh us mein hai us se zyada mehboob hota tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"553","Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqseem ki. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ghair inkey zyada haqdaar they un se? To farmaya: Beshak unhon-ne mujhey ikhtiyaar diya ke wo mujh se badzabaani key sath maangein aur main unhey dun, ya wo mujhey kanjoos kahein. Aur main kanjoos nahi hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"554","Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hunain se wapas aatey huey chal rahey they. To dehaatiyon ne Aap ko latak kar maanga. Yahan tak ke unhon-ne Aap ko keekar ki taraf majboor kar diya aur us ne Aap ki chaadar kheench li. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukey aur farmaya: Meri chaadar do. Phir agar merey paas in keekaron ki tadaad mein oont hotey to unhey tumharey darmiyaan taqseem karta. Phir tum mujhey kanjoos aur na jhoota aur na buzdil paogey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"555","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa maal mein kami nahi karta. Aur Allah bandey ko darguzar key sabab izzat key siwa nahi badhaata. Aur jo Allah key liye aajizi karey to Allah Azza wa Jall usey buland farmata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"556","Abu Kabsha Amr bin Saad Anmaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Teen par qasam khaata hun aur tumhey hadis bayan karta hun isliye yaad rakho: Bandey ka maal sadqa se kami nahi hota. Aur banda zulm ki wjah se sabr nahi karta magar Allah usey izzat mein badhaata hai. Aur banda maangney ka darwaaza nahi kholta magar Allah us par faqr ka darwaaza kholta hai, ya is jaisa kalima. Aur tumhey hadis bayan karta hun isliye yaad rakho. Unhon-ne kaha: Duniya to chaar aadmiyon key liye hai: Banda jisey Allah ne maal aur ilm diya hai. To wo us mein apne Rab se darta hai, aur us mein apna rishta jorta hai, aur Allah key liye us mein haq jaanta hai. To ye afzal manaazil mein hai. Aur banda jisey Allah ne ilm diya hai, aur usey maal nahi diya hai. To wo sachchi niyat wala hai aur kehta hai: Kaash merey paas maal hota to main fulaan key amal jaisa amal karta. To wo apni niyat key sath hai aur un donon ka ajr barabar hai. Aur banda jisey Allah ne maal diya hai, aur usey ilm nahi diya hai. To wo apne maal mein baghair ilm key idhar udhar maarta hai. Na us mein apne Rab se darta hai, aur na us mein apna rishta jorta hai, aur na Allah key liye us mein haq jaanta hai. To ye khabees tareen manaazil mein hai. Aur banda jisey Allah ne maal aur na ilm diya hai. To wo kehta hai: Kaash merey paas maal hota to main us mein fulaan key amal jaisa amal karta. To wo apni niyat key sath hai. To un donon ka bojh barabar hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"557","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne bakri zibah ki. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us mein se kya baqi raha? Unhon-ne kaha: Us mein se uskey shaaney key siwa kuchh baqi nahi raha. Aap ne farmaya: Uskey shaaney key siwa sab baqi raha. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Sahih hadis hai."
"558","Asma bint Abi Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Na baandho warna tum par baandha jaeyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"559","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Kanjoos aur kharch karne waley ki misaal do aadmiyon ki si hai jinkey oopar lohey ki do zirahein hain unkey seenon sey unki hansiyon tak. To raha kharch karne wala, wo kharch nahi karta magar wo pheelti hai, ya uski khaal par bharpoor hoti hai, yahan tak ke uski ungliyan chhup jaati hain, aur uska nishaan mit jaata hai. Aur raha kanjoos, wo kuchh kharch karna nahi chaahta magar har kadi apni jagah chipak jaati hai. To wo usey kushada karta hai lekin wo kushada nahi hoti. (Muttafaqun aleh). Waljunnah zirah hai. Aur iskey maana hain: Ke kharch karne wala jab kabhi kharch karta hai to wo pheelti hai, aur lambi hoti hai yahan tak ke uskey peechey ghisat-ti hai. Aur uskey donon paaon aur uskey chalney aur qadam key nishaan chhup jaatey hain."
"560","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajoor key barabar paak kamaai mein se sadqa karey. Aur paak key siwa qabool nahi karta. To beshak Allah usey apne daayein haath key sath qabool farmata hai. Phir usey uskey saathi key liye badhaata hai jaisa tum mein se koi apne bachchey ko badhaata hai, yahan tak ke wo pahaad jaisi ho jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Faloo fa key fatha aur laam key zamma aur waao key tashdeed key sath hai. Aur kaha gaya bhi hai: Fa key kasra aur laam key sukoon aur waao key takhfeef key sath. Aur wo bachcha hai."
"561","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik martaba aadmi zameen key jungle mein chal raha tha. To us ne baadal mein awaz suni: Fulaan key baagh ko paani do. To wo baadal hat gaya aur us ne apna paani kaaley patharon wali zameen mein daala. To achanak paani key raaston mein se aik raasta tha jis ne wo saara paani ley liya. To wo paani key peechey chala. To achanak aadmi apne baagh mein khada tha jo paani ko apne phaawdey key sath pher raha tha. To us se kaha: Ae Allah key bandey! Tumhara naam kya hai? Us ne kaha: Fulaan, us naam key liye jo us ne baadal mein suna tha. To us se kaha: Ae Allah key bandey! Tum ne mujh se merey naam key baarey mein kyun poochha? To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne us baadal mein awaz suni jiska ye paani hai jo kehta hai: Fulaan key baagh ko paani do, tumharey naam key liye. To tum us mein kya kartey ho? To us ne kaha: Khabardaar! Jab tum ne ye kaha hai to beshak main dekhta hun ke us mein se kya nikalta hai. To uskey tihaai se sadqa karta hun. Aur main aur merey ghar waley tihaai khaatey hain. Aur us mein tihaai wapas karta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Harrah kaaley patharon wali zameen hai. Wash sharjah sheen muqta muqta key fatha aur ra key sukoon aur jeem key sath hai: Wo paani ka raasta hai."
"562","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zulm se daro kyonke zulm qayamat key din andherey hongey. Aur kanjoosi se daro kyonke kanjoosi ne unhey halaak kya jo tum se pehley they. Us ne unhey is par ubhara ke wo apne khoon bahaein aur apni hurmaton ko halaal karein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"563","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak main thaka hua hun. To Aap ne apni baaz biwiyon ki taraf bheja. To us ne kaha: Us zaat ki qasam jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja hai! Merey paas paani key siwa kuchh nahi hai. Phir doosri ki taraf bheja. To us ne usi tarah kaha. Yahan tak ke sab ne usi tarah kaha: Nahi, us zaat ki qasam jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja hai! Merey paas paani key siwa kuchh nahi hai. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaun iski aaj raat mehmaan nawaazi karega? To Ansaar mein se aadmi ne kaha: Main ya Rasulullah. To wo usey apne ghar ley gaya. To apni biwi se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key mehmaan ki izzat karo. Aur aik riwayat mein us ne apni biwi se kaha: Kya tumharey paas kuchh hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, siwaey merey bachchon key khaaney key. Us ne kaha: Unhey kisi chiz key sath behlao. Aur jab wo raat ka khaana chaahein to unhey sula do. Aur jab hamara mehmaan dakhil ho to chiraagh bujha do aur usey dikhao ke ham khaatey hain. To wo baithey aur mehmaan ne khaaya aur wo bhookey raat guzaartey they. Phir jab subah hui to wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To farmaya: Beshak Allah aaj raat tum donon key mehmaan key sath karne par taajjub farmata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"564","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do ka khaana teen key liye kaafi hai. Aur teen ka khaana chaar key liye kaafi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Aik ka khaana do key liye kaafi hai, aur do ka khaana chaar key liye kaafi hai, aur chaar ka khaana aath key liye kaafi hai."
"565","Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they ke aadmi apni sawari par aaya. To wo apni nigaah daayein baayein phirney laga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jiskey paas zaaid sawari ho to usey us par dey jiskey paas sawari nahi hai. Aur jiskey paas tosha mein se zaaid ho to usey us par dey jiskey paas tosha nahi hai. To Aap ne maal ki aqsaam mein se jo zikr kya so zikr kya, yahan tak ke ham ne dekha ke ham mein se kisi ka fazl mein koi haq nahi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"566","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas buni hui chaadar ley kar aai. To us ne kaha: Main ne usey buna hai taake tumhey pehnaaun. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey liya jabke Aap uskey mohtaaj they. To hamarey paas nikley jabke wo Aap ka tehband thi. To fulaan ne kaha: Mujhey pehnao, wo kitni achchhi hai! To farmaya: Haan. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) majlis mein baithey, phir wapas aey aur usey teh kya, phir usey uski taraf bhej diya. To qaum ne us se kaha: Tum ne achchha nahi kya! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey pehna tha jabke Aap uskey mohtaaj they, phir tum ne maanga jabke tum jaantey they ke wo maangney waley ko radd nahi farmatey. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne usey isliye nahi maanga ke usey pehnun. Main ne to usey isliye maanga taake wo mera kafan ho. Sehel ne kaha: To wo uska kafan thi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"567","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Ashaari jab ghazwey mein unka tosha khatm ho jaata hai, ya Madina mein unkey ghar walon ka khaana kam ho jaata hai, to jo unkey paas hota hai aik kapdey mein jama kartey hain. Phir usey aik bartan mein barabar taqseem kartey hain. Isliye wo mujh se hain aur main un se hun. (Muttafaqun aleh). Armiloo unka tosha khatm ho gaya ya khatm honay key qareeb hua."
"568","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas sharbat laaya gaya. To Aap ne us mein se piya jabke Aap key daayein taraf ladka tha, aur Aap key baayein taraf boodhey they. To Aap ne ladkey se farmaya: Kya tum mujhey ijazat detey ho ke main inhey dun? To ladkey ne kaha: Nahi Allah ki qasam ya Rasulullah! Main tum se kisi ko tarjeeh nahi dunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey apne haath mein rakh diya. (Muttafaqun aleh). Tallahu ta musanna fauq key sath hai, yaani rakha. Aur ye ladka Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) hain."
"569","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik martaba Ayyub (Alehis salaam) nangey ghusl farma rahey they. To un par soney ki tiddiyan girein. To Ayyub apne kapdey mein lapet-ney lagey. To unkey Rab Azza wa Jall ne unhey pukaara: Ae Ayyub! Kya main ne tumhey us se be-niyaaz nahi kya tha jo tum dekhtey ho?! Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi, aur Teri izzat ki qasam! Lekin main Teri barkat se be-niyaaz nahi hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"570","Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rashk sirf do mein hai: Aadmi jisey Allah ne maal diya. To usey haq mein uskey kharch karne par laga diya. Aur aadmi jisey Allah ne hikmat di. To wo uskey sath faisla karta hai aur usey sikhaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur uski sharah qareeb guzar chuki hai)."
"571","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rashk sirf do mein hai: Aadmi jisey Allah ne Quran diya. To wo raat aur din key auqaat mein uskey sath qayaam karta hai. Aur aadmi jisey Allah ne maal diya. To wo raat aur din key auqaat mein usey kharch karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aanaa ghadiyan hain."
"572","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke muhaajireen key fuqara Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Maaldaar buland darjaat aur hamesha ki naimat ley gaey. To farmaya: Aur wo kya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Wo namaz padhtey hain jaisa ham padhtey hain. Aur rozey rakhtey hain jaisa ham rakhtey hain. Aur sadqa kartey hain jabke ham sadqa nahi kartey. Aur aazaad kartey hain jabke ham aazaad nahi kartey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey aisi chiz na sikhaaun jis se tum unhey pa lo jo tum se aagey badh gaey, aur un se aagey badh jao jo tumharey baad hain. Aur tum se afzal koi na ho siwaey uskey jis ne waisa kya jaisa tum ne kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Har namaz key peechey tai tees martaba tasbeeh karo, aur takbeer kaho, aur hamd karo. To muhaajireen key fuqara Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas wapas aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Hamarey maaldaar bhaiyon ne hamarey amal key baarey mein suna. To unhon-ne waisa kya? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye Allah ka fazl hai jisey chahta hai deta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Muslim ki riwayat ka lafz hai."
"573","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera kandha pakda aur farmaya: Duniya mein hoja goya tum ajnabi ho ya raasta paar karne waley. Aur Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) kehtey they: Jab shaam karo to subah ka intizaar na karo. Aur jab subah karo to shaam ka intizaar na karo. Aur apni sehat mein se apni beemari key liye lo, aur apni zindagi mein se apni maut key liye. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"574","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman aadmi ho jiskey paas kuchh ho jiskey baarey mein wo waseeyat karey, wo do raatein na guzaarey magar uski waseeyat uskey paas likhi hui ho. (Muttafaqun aleh). Ye Bukhari ka lafz hai. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Teen raatein guzaarey. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Mujh par koi raat nahi guzri jab se main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai magar meri waseeyat merey paas hai."
"575","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne lakeerein khainchein aur farmaya: Ye insaan hai, aur ye uski muddat hai. Phir isi haal mein qareeb wali lakeer aai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"576","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne murabba lakeer khainchi. Aur darmiyaan mein aik lakeer khainchi jo us se baahar thi. Aur iskey darmiyaan waley ki taraf uskey darmiyaan waley pehlu se chhoti lakeerein khainchein. To farmaya: Ye insaan hai. Aur ye uski muddat hai jo usey gherey huey hai, ya usey gher chuki hai. Aur ye jo baahar hai uski ummeed hai. Aur ye chhoti lakeerein museebatein hain. Phir agar usey ye khata karey to ye usey kaat-ti hai. Aur agar usey ye khata karey to ye usey kaat-ti hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"577","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaamon mein saat se pehley jaldi karo. Kya tum intizaar kartey ho bhoolaney waley faqr key siwa, ya sarkash karne wali dolat key, ya bigaadney wali beemari key, ya kharaab karne waley budhaapey key, ya taiyaar maut key, ya Dajjaal ka, jo badtareen ghaaib hai jiska intizaar kya jaata hai, ya Qayamat ka, aur Qayamat zyada sakht aur kadwi hai?! Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"578","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lazzaaton ko todney wali ko kasrat se yaad karo, yaani maut ko. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"579","Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat ka tihaai guzar jaata to khadey hotey aur farmatey: Ae logon! Allah ko yaad karo. Kaanpney wali aai hai, uskey peechey aane wali aayegi. Maut apne sath jo hai ley kar aai hai. Maut apne sath jo hai ley kar aai hai. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main tum par kasrat se durood bhejta hun. To tumharey liye apni dua mein se kitna rakhu? Aap ne farmaya: Jitna chaho. Main ne kaha: Chauthaai? Aap ne farmaya: Jitna chaho. Phir agar zyada karo to wo tumharey liye hai. Main ne kaha: To aadha? Aap ne farmaya: Jitna chaho, phir agar zyada karo to wo tumharey liye hai. Main ne kaha: To do tihaai? Aap ne farmaya: Jitna chaho, phir agar zyada karo to wo tumharey liye behtar hai. Main ne kaha: Tumharey liye apni dua poori rakhu? Aap ne farmaya: Tab tumhara gham kaafi hoga, aur tumhara gunaah bakhsh diya jaeyga. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"580","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhey qabron ki ziyaarat se mana kya tha, isliye unki ziyaarat karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Phir jo qabron ki ziyaarat karna chaahey to zaroor karey. Kyonke wo hamein aakhirat yaad dilaati hain."
"581","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab unki raat hoti thi jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se hoti thi to raat key aakhir mein Baqee ki taraf nikaltey. To farmatey: Assalamu alaikum, ae momin qaum key ghar! Aur tumhey wo aayega jiska tum se waada kya gaya hai. Kal muakhkhar kiye gaey ho, aur beshak ham Insha Allah tum se milney waley hain. Ae Allah! Baqeeul Gharqad walon ko bakhsh dey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"582","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey sikhaatey they ke jab wo qabron ki taraf niklein to unka kehne wala kahey: Assalamu alaikum, ae ghar walon mein se mominon aur Musalmanon! Aur beshak ham Insha Allah tum se milney waley hain. Main Allah se hamarey aur tumharey liye aafiyat maangta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"583","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina mein qabron par guzrey aur unki taraf apne chehrey key sath mutawajjah huey aur farmaya: Assalamu alaikum, ae qabr walon! Allah hamein aur tumhey bakhsh dey. Tum hamarey aagey ho aur ham peechey hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"584","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na karey, ya neki karne wala, shayed wo zyada karey. Ya bura karne wala, shayed wo maafi maangey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na karey, aur na uskey aaney se pehley uskey liye dua karey. Beshak jab wo mar jaata hai to uska amal munqata ho jaata hai. Aur beshak momin ki umr usey bhalai key siwa nahi badhaati."
"585","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi takleef key sabab jo usey pahunchi hai maut ki tamanna na karey. Phir agar wo zaroor karne wala ho to kahey: Ae Allah! Mujhey zinda rakh jab tak zindagi merey liye behtar ho. Aur mujhey wafaat dey jab wafaat merey liye behtar ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"586","Qais bin Abi Haazim se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Khabbaab bin Al-Aratt (Raziallahu anhu) key paas unki ayadat key liye dakhil huey jabke unhon-ne saat daagh lagwaey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak hamarey saathi jo guzar gaey chaley gaey, aur duniya ne unhey kami nahi ki. Aur beshak ham ne paaya hai jiska matti key siwa koi thikana nahi paatey. Aur agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein maut ki dua maangney se mana na farmaya hota to main uskey liye dua maangta. Phir ham unkey paas aik aur martaba aey jabke wo apne liye deewaar bana rahey they. To farmaya: Beshak Musalman ko har chiz mein ajr diya jaata hai jo wo kharch karta hai siwaey us chiz key jo wo is matti mein rakhta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Bukhari ki riwayat ka lafz hai)."
"587","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak halaal wazeh hai, aur beshak haraam wazeh hai. Aur unkey darmiyaan mushtabaat hain jinhey logon mein se bahut nahi jaantey. Phir jo shubhaat se bacha us ne apne deen aur izzat ko bachaaya. Aur jo shubhaat mein pada wo haraam mein pada. Jaise charwaaha jo hima key ird gird charaata hai, anqareeb wo us mein charayega. Khabardaar! Aur beshak har baadshah ka hima hai. Khabardaar! Aur beshak Allah ka hima uski hurmatein hain. Khabardaar! Aur beshak jism mein gosht ka tukda hai, jab wo durust ho to saara jism durust hota hai. Aur jab wo bigad jaey to saara jism bigad jaata hai. Khabardaar! Aur wo dil hai. (Muttafaqun aleh. Aur un donon ne qareeb alfaaz key sath tareeqon se riwayat kya hai)."
"588","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne raastey mein khajoor paai. To farmaya: Agar mujhey khauf na hota ke wo sadqa mein se hai to main usey khaata. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"589","Nawwas bin Samaan (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Neki achchha akhlaaq hai. Aur gunaah wo hai jo tumharey nafs mein khatkey, aur tum napasand karo ke log us par muttala hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"590","Waabisa bin Maabad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To farmaya: Tum neki key baarey mein poochhney aey ho? Main ne kaha: Haan. To farmaya: Apne dil se fatwa maango. Neki wo hai jis par nafs mutma'in ho, aur dil mutma'in ho. Aur gunaah wo hai jo nafs mein khatkey aur seeney mein taraddud karey, chaahey log tumhey fatwa dein aur fatwa dein. Hasan hadis hai, ise Ahmad aur Daarimi ne apni donon Musnadon mein riwayat kya hai."
"591","Abu Saroo'a, seen muhmala key kasra aur nasb key sath, Uqba bin Al-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke us ne Abi Ihaab bin Aziz ki beti se shaadi ki. To uskey paas aurat aai aur us ne kaha: Beshak main ne Uqba ko doodh pilaaya hai aur usey jis se us ne shaadi ki hai. To Uqba ne us se kaha: Mujhey nahi maloom ke tum ne mujhey doodh pilaaya hai aur na tum ne mujhey khabar di hai. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Madina mein sawaar hokar gaya aur Aap se poochha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaisey, jabke kaha jaa chuka hai?! To Uqba ne usey judaa kar diya aur us ne ghair shohar se nikaah kya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"592","Hasan bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yaad kya: Jo tumhey shak mein daaley usey chhor do uski taraf jo tumhey shak mein na daaley. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"593","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) ka ghulaam tha jo uskey liye mehnat ki kamaai nikaalta tha. Aur Abu Bakr uski kamaai mein se khaatey they. To aik din kuchh ley kar aaya. To Abu Bakr ne us mein se khaaya. To ghulaam ne us se kaha: Kya tum jaantey ho ye kya hai? To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Wo kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main jaahiliyat mein insaan key liye kahaamat karta tha, jabke main kahaamat achchhi tarah nahi jaanta tha, siwaey iskey ke main ne usey dhoka diya. To wo mujh se mila aur mujhey uskey sabab ye diya jo tum ne us mein se khaaya hai. To Abu Bakr ne apna haath dakhil kya aur apne pait mein jo kuchh tha sab qai kar diya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"594","Naafe se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne pehley muhaajireen key liye chaar hazaar muqarrar kiye they aur apne betey key liye teen hazaar paanch sau muqarrar kiye they. To us se kaha gaya: Wo muhaajireen mein se hai, isliye tum ne usey kyun kam kya? To us ne kaha: Wo to apne waalid key sath hijrat karke aaya hai. Wo kehta hai: Wo us jaisa nahi hai jo apne nafs key sath hijrat karke aaya ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"595","Atiya bin Urwa Saadi Sahaabi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda muttaqiyon mein se honay ko nahi pahunchta yahan tak ke wo wo chhor dey jis mein harj nahi hai uskey khauf se jis mein harj hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"596","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah muttaqi maaldaar chhupey huey bandey se mohabbat farmata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur ghani se muraad nafs ki dolat hai, jaisa sahih hadis mein guzar chuka hai."
"597","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne kaha: Logon mein kaun afzal hai ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Momin jo apni jaan aur maal key sath Allah key raastey mein jihad karta hai. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi jo ghaatiyon mein se ghaati mein alag rehta hai aur apne Rab ki ibaadat karta hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Allah se darta hai, aur logon ko apne shar se bachaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"598","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qareeb hai ke Musalman ka behtreen maal bakriyan hon jinkey sath wo pahaadon ki chotiyon key peechey chalta hai, aur baarish ki jagahon key, apne deen key sath fitnon se bhaagta hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Washu'aful jibaal unki bulandiyan hain."
"599","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne bakriyan charaein. To Aap key sahaaba ne kaha: Tum? Aap ne farmaya: Main unhey Ahle Makkah key liye qeeraaton par charaata tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"600","Unhin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ki behtreen guzraan mein se aadmi hai jo Allah key raastey mein apne ghodey ki lagaam pakdey huey hai. Wo uski peeth par udta hai. Jab kabhi pukaar ya ghabrahat suney to us par udta hai. Wo qatl ya maut ko uski jagah mein talaash karta hai. Ya aadmi bakriyon mein in chotiyon mein se kisi choti key sar par, ya in waadiyon mein se kisi waadi key pait mein namaz qaim karta hai, aur zakaat deta hai, aur apne Rab ki ibaadat karta hai yahan tak ke usey maut aa jaey. Wo logon mein sirf bhalai mein hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"601","Iyaaz bin Himaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki hai ke aajizi karo yahan tak ke koi kisi par fakhr na karey, aur koi kisi par zulm na karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"602","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa maal mein kami nahi karta. Aur Allah bandey ko darguzar key sabab izzat key siwa nahi badhaata. Aur jo Allah key liye aajizi karey to Allah usey buland farmata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"603","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo bachchon par guzrey aur unhey salaam kya. Aur kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa kartey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"604","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Madina ki londiyon mein se londi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka haath pakadti thi aur Aap ko ley jaati thi jahaan chahti thi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"605","Aswad bin Yazeed se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se poochha gaya: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar mein kya kartey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo apne ghar walon ki khidmat mein hotey they, yaani: Apne ghar walon ki khidmat, phir jab namaz haazir hoti to namaz key liye nikaltey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"606","Abu Rifaa'a Tameem bin Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas pahuncha jabke Aap khutba dey rahey they. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ajnabi aadmi aaya hai jo apne deen key baarey mein poochhta hai, wo nahi jaanta ke uska deen kya hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri taraf mutawajjah huey aur apna khutba chhor diya yahan tak ke merey paas pahunchey. To kursi laai gai aur Aap us par baithey aur mujhey us mein se sikhaanay lagey jo Allah ne Aap ko sikhaya tha. Phir apna khutba laey aur uska aakhir poora kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"607","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khaana khaatey they to apni teen ungliyan chaat-tey they. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma giR jaey to us se takleef deh chiz door karey, aur usey kha ley, aur usey shaitaan key liye na chhorey. Aur hukm diya ke pyaala saaf kya jaey. Unhon-ne kaha: Kyonke tum nahi jaantey ke tumharey khaaney ke kis hissey mein barkat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"608","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne bakriyan charaein. Aap key sahaaba ne kaha: Aur tum? To farmaya: Haan, main unhey Ahle Makkah key liye qeeraaton par charaata tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"609","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar mujhey kohni ya dastaana ki dawat di jaey to qabool karunga. Aur agar mujhey dastaana ya kohni tohfey mein di jaey to qabool karunga. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"610","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki oontni Azba thi jo peechey nahi rehti thi, ya taqreeban peechey nahi rehti thi. To dehaati apne oont key bachchey par aaya aur us se aagey badh gaya. To wo Musalmanon par mushkil hua yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pehchaana. To farmaya: Allah par haq hai ke duniya mein se koi chiz buland na ho magar wo usey past karey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"611","Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jiskey dil mein zarra barabar takabbur ho. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Beshak aadmi pasand karta hai ke uska kapda achchha ho aur uska joota achchha ho? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah khubsurat hai aur khubsurti ko pasand farmata hai. Takabbur haq ko thukrana hai aur logon ko haqeer samajhna hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"612","Salma bin Al-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baayein haath se khaaya. To farmaya: Daayein haath se khao. Us ne kaha: Main taqat nahi rakhta! Aap ne farmaya: Tu taqat na rakh sakey! Usey takabbur key siwa kuchh nahi rokta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne usey apne munh ki taraf na uthaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"613","Haarisa bin Wahb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Kya main tumhey dozakh walon ki khabar na dun? Har sakht badakhlaaq mutakabbir. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur uski sharah Musalmanon key kamzoron key baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"614","Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat aur dozakh ne jhagda kya. To dozakh ne kaha: Mujh mein jabbar aur mutakabbir hain. Aur Jannat ne kaha: Mujh mein logon key kamzor aur maskeen hain. To Allah ne un donon key darmiyaan faisla kya: Beshak tum Jannat meri rehmat ho, tumharey sath jis par chahunga rehem karunga. Aur beshak tum dozakh mera azaab ho, tumharey sath jisey chahunga azaab dunga. Aur tum donon key liye mujh par bharna hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"615","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah qayamat key din uski taraf nazar nahi farmayega jo apna tehband takabbur se ghaseet-ta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"616","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah qayamat key din kalaam nahi farmayega, aur na unhey paak farmayega, aur na unki taraf nazar farmayega. Aur unkey liye dardnaak azaab hai: Boodha zina karne wala, aur jhoota baadshah, aur maghroor faqeer. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"617","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Izzat mera tehband hai aur kibriyaai meri chaadar hai. Phir jo mujh se un mein se aik mein jhagda karega to main ne usey azaab diya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"618","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik martaba aadmi jodey mein chal raha tha jabke wo apne aap par taajjub karta tha, apne sar key baal sanwaar raha tha, apni chaal mein itraata tha. Jab Allah ne usey dhansa diya. To wo qayamat key din tak zameen mein dhans-ta raheyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"619","Salma bin Al-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi apne aap ko buland karta rehta hai yahan tak ke jabbaron mein likha jaata hai. To usey wo pahunchta hai jo unhey pahuncha tha. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Yazhabu binafsihi yaani: Buland hota hai aur takabbur karta hai."
"620","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein sab se achchhey akhlaaq waley they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"621","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne deebaaj aur na resham ko chhua jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheli se zyada narm ho. Aur na koi khushbu soonghi jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khushbu se zyada achchhi ho. Aur beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki das saal khidmat ki. To Aap ne mujh se kabhi uff nahi kaha. Aur na kisi chiz key liye jo main ne ki kaha: Tum ne kyun ki? Aur na kisi chiz key liye jo main ne nahi ki kaha: Tum ne is is tarah kyun nahi kya? (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"622","Saab bin Jasaama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jangli gadha tohfey mein diya aur Aap ne mujh par wapas kar diya. Phir jab Aap ne dekha jo merey chehrey mein tha to farmaya: Ham ne usey tum par sirf isliye wapas nahi kya ke ham ahraam waley hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"623","Nawwas bin Samaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se neki aur gunaah key baarey mein poochha. To farmaya: Neki achchha akhlaaq hai. Aur gunaah wo hai jo tumharey nafs mein khatkey aur tum napasand karo ke log us par muttala hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"624","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) behaya aur na behayaai ki baat karne waley nahi they. Aur farmatey they: Beshak tum mein behtreen wo hain jinkey akhlaaq sab se achchhey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"625","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat key din momin key meezaan mein achchhey akhlaaq se bhaari koi chiz nahi hai. Aur beshak Allah behaya badzabaan se bughz rakhta hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"626","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha gaya ke sab se zyada kya logon ko Jannat mein dakhil karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ka taqwa aur achchha akhlaaq. Aur poochha gaya ke sab se zyada kya logon ko dozakh mein dakhil karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Munh aur sharmgaah. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"627","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imaan mein kaamil tareen momin wo hain jinkey akhlaaq sab se achchhey hain, aur tum mein behtreen wo hain jo apni biwiyon key liye behtreen hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"628","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak momin apne achchhey akhlaaq key sabab rozey rakhne waley qayaam karne waley ka darja paa leta hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"629","Abu Umaama Baahili (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Jannat key kinarey mein ghar ka zaamin hun uskey liye jo jhagda chhorey chaahey wo haq par ho. Aur Jannat key darmiyaan mein ghar ka uskey liye jo jhoot chhorey chaahey wo mazaak mein ho. Aur Jannat key aala mein ghar ka uskey liye jiska akhlaaq achchha ho. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"630","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se mujhey sab se zyada mehboob aur qayamat key din mujh se majlis mein sab se qareeb tumharey achchhey akhlaaq waley hain. Aur beshak tum mein se mujhey sab se zyada naapasand aur qayamat key din mujh se sab se door, baatein bananey waley, aur munh phadney waley, aur takabbur se baat karne waley hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham ne sarsaaron aur mutashaddiqon ko pehchaan liya. To mutafaihiqoon kaun hain? Aap ne farmaya: Mutakabbir. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Sarsaar wo hai jo takalluf se bahut baat karta hai. Walmutashaddiq wo hai jo logon par apni baat key sath lamba hota hai, aur apne munh bhar key sath baat karta hai apni baat key liye taazeem key sabab. Walmutafaihiq uski asal fahq se hai, aur wo bharna hai. Aur wo hai jo apna munh baat key sath bharta hai, aur us mein wusat karta hai aur us mein takabbur aur bulandi key sabab gharib laata hai, aur ghair par fazilat zaahir karne key liye. Aur Tirmizi ne Abdullah bin Mubaarak (Rehmatullah aleh) se achchhey akhlaaq ki tafseer mein riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Wo chehrey ki khushgawaari hai, aur bhalai dena, aur takleef rokna."
"631","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ashajj Abdul Qais se farmaya: Beshak tum mein do khaslatein hain jin se Allah mohabbat karta hai: Burdbaari aur tahammul. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"632","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah narm hai aur tamaam muamley mein narmi ko pasand farmata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"633","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah narm hai aur narmi ko pasand farmata hai. Aur narmi par deta hai jo sakhti par nahi deta, aur uskey siwa par nahi deta. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"634","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak narmi jis chiz mein ho usey zeenat deti hai. Aur jis chiz se nikaali jaey usey aibdaar karti hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"635","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Dehaati ne masjid mein peshaab kya. To log uski taraf uth-khadey huey taake us par waaqe hon. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey chhor do aur uskey peshaab par paani ka dol daalo, ya paani ka dol. Kyonke tum aasaani karne waley bhejey gaey ho, aur tum mushkil karne waley nahi bhejey gaey ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"636","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aasaani karo aur mushkil na karo, aur khushkhabri do aur nafrat na dilaao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"637","Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo narmi se mehroom ho wo tamaam bhalai se mehroom hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"638","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhey waseeyat karein. Aap ne farmaya: Ghussa na karo. Us ne baar baar dohraaya. Aap ne farmaya: Ghussa na karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"639","Abu Yaala Shaddaad bin Aus (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne har chiz par ahsaan likha hai. Phir jab tum qatl karo to qatl mein ahsaan karo. Aur jab tum zibah karo to zibah mein ahsaan karo. Aur tum mein se har aik apni chhuri tez karey aur apne zabeeha ko aaraam dey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"640","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko do kaamon key darmiyaan kabhi ikhtiyaar nahi diya gaya magar Aap ne un donon mein aasaan liya, jab tak wo gunaah na ho. Phir agar wo gunaah hota to Aap logon mein us se sab se door hotey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne nafs key liye kisi chiz mein kabhi badla nahi liya. Siwaey iskey ke Allah ki hurmat todi jaey. To Allah Taala key liye badla letey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"641","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey uski khabar na dun jo dozakh par haraam hai, ya jis par dozakh haraam hai? Dozakh har qareeb narm leen aasaan par haraam hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"642","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Kya tum par din aaya hai jo Uhad key din se sakht tha? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumhari qaum se paaya hai. Aur sab se sakht jo main ne un se paaya wo Aqaba key din tha. Jab main ne apne aap ko Ibn Abd Yaalail bin Abd Kalaal par pesh kya aur us ne mujhey uska jawab nahi diya jo main chaahta tha. To main chala jabke main apne chehrey par ghumgeen tha. To main hosh mein nahi aaya magar main Qarnus Sa'aalib mein tha. To main ne apna sar uthaya aur achanak baadal ne mujh par saaya kya tha. To main ne dekha aur achanak us mein Jibraeel (Alehis salaam) they. To unhon-ne mujhey pukaara aur kaha: Beshak Allah Taala ne tumhari qaum key tumhey qaul ko suna hai, aur jo unhon-ne tumhey jawab diya hai. Aur beshak us ne tumhari taraf pahaadon ka farishta bheja hai taake tum usey unkey baarey mein jo chaho hukm do. To pahaadon key farishtey ne mujhey pukaara aur mujh par salaam kya, phir kaha: Ae Muhammad! Beshak Allah ne tumhari qaum key tumhey qaul ko suna hai. Aur main pahaadon ka farishta hun. Aur beshak merey Rab ne mujhey tumhari taraf bheja hai taake tum mujhey apne hukm ka hukm do. To jo chaho: Agar chaho to un par Akhshabain mila dun. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Balke mujhey ummeed hai ke unki pushton se wo nikleyga jo Allah ki ibaadat karega aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehraayega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"643","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne haath key sath kabhi kisi chiz ko nahi maara. Na aurat ko aur na khaadim ko. Siwaey iskey ke Allah key raastey mein jihad karein. Aur Aap se koi chiz nahi li gai aur Aap ne uskey saathi se badla liya. Siwaey iskey ke Allah Taala ki hurmaton mein se kuchh todi jaey. To Allah Taala key liye badla letey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"644","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chal raha tha jabke Aap par Najraan ki motee kinari wali chaadar thi. To dehaati Aap tak pahuncha aur Aap ki chaadar ko sakhti se kheench liya. To main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key kandhey key kinarey ki taraf dekha jabke chaadar ki kinari ne sakhti ki wjah se us par nishaan daala tha. To wo hansa. Phir kaha: Ae Muhammad! Merey liye Allah key maal mein se hukm do jo tumharey paas hai. To Aap uski taraf mutawajjah huey aur hansey, phir uskey liye ata ka hukm diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"645","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhta hun ke wo ambiya mein se aik Nabi ka qissa bayan farma rahey hain, Allah ki rehmaten aur salaamti un par hon. Unki qaum ne unhey maara aur khoon aalood kar diya jabke wo apne chehrey se khoon ponchh rahey hain aur kehtey hain: Ae Allah! Meri qaum ko bakhsh dey kyonke wo nahi jaantey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"646","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pehelwaan kushti ladney wala nahi hai. Pehelwaan to wo hai jo ghussey key waqt apne nafs ka maalik hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"647","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak merey rishtedaar hain jin se main rishta jorta hun aur wo mujh se kaat-tey hain. Aur main unkey sath ahsaan karta hun aur wo merey sath bura kartey hain. Aur main un se hilm karta hun aur wo mujh par jihaalat kartey hain! To farmaya: Agar tum waisa ho jaisa tum ne kaha to goya tum unhey garm raakh khilaatey ho. Aur tumharey sath Allah Taala ki taraf se un par madadgaar raheyga jab tak tum us par raho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur uski sharah Sila Rehmi key baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"648","Abu Masood Uqba bin Amr Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak main Subah ki namaz se fulaan ki wjah se peechey rehta hun jo hamarey sath lambi karta hai! To main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko waaz mein ghussa farmatey huey nahi dekha jitna Aap us din ghusay huey. To farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak tum mein se nafrat dilaaney waley hain. Phir tum mein se jo logon ki imaamat karaye to halki karey. Kyonke uskey peechey bada aur chhota aur haajat wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"649","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar se tashreef laey jabke main ne apne taaq key aagey tasweeron wala parda latkaaya tha. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dekha to usey phaad diya aur Aap ka chehra badal gaya aur farmaya: Ae Aaisha! Qayamat key din Allah key nazdeek sab se sakht azaab waley wo hongey jo Allah ki khilqat key sath mushabihat kartey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"650","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Quraish ko Makhzoomiya aurat key muamley ne fikr mein daala jis ne chori ki thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein kaun baat kareyga? To unhon-ne kaha: Aap par Usaama bin Zaid key siwa kaun jurrat karega jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key pyaarey hain? To Usaama ne baat ki. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum Allah Taala ki hadon mein se aik hadd mein sifarish kartey ho?! Phir khadey huey aur khutba diya, phir farmaya: Tum se pehley logon ko sirf is ne halaak kya ke wo jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhor detey. Aur jab un mein kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaim kartey! Aur Allah ki qasam! Agar Faatima bint Muhammad chori karti to main uska haath kaat-ta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"651","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qibla mein balgham dekha. To wo Aap par mushkil hua yahan tak ke Aap key chehrey mein dekha gaya. To khadey huey aur usey apne haath key sath khurach diya. To farmaya: Beshak tum mein se jab koi apni namaz mein khada hota hai to wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai. Aur beshak uska Rab uskey aur qibla key darmiyaan hai. Isliye tum mein se koi qibla mein na thookey. Lekin apne baayein, ya apne qadam key neechey. Phir apni chaadar ka kinara liya aur us mein thooka. Phir baaz ko baaz par wapas kya aur farmaya: Ya is tarah karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"652","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum sab nigehbaan ho, aur tum sab apni riaya key baarey mein poochhey jaaney waley ho: Imam nigehbaan hai aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochha jaaney wala hai. Aur aadmi apne ghar walon mein nigehbaan hai aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochha jaaney wala hai. Aur aurat apne shohar key ghar mein nigehbaan hai aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochhi jaaney wali hai. Aur khaadim apne aaqa key maal mein nigehbaan hai aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochha jaaney wala hai. Aur tum sab nigehbaan ho aur apni riaya key baarey mein poochhey jaaney waley ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"653","Abu Yaala Maaqil bin Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo banda hai jisey Allah riaya par nigehbaan banaata hai. Wo us din mar jaata hai jab mar jaata hai jabke wo apni riaya se dhoka karne wala hai, to Allah us par Jannat haraam kar deta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Phir usey apni khairkhwahi key sath nahi ghera to Jannat ki khushbu nahi paayega. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jo ameer Musalmanon key umoor ki wilayat rakhta hai, phir unkey liye koshish nahi karta aur unki khairkhwahi nahi karta, to wo unkey sath Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"654","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne is ghar mein farmatey huey suna: Ae Allah! Jo meri ummat key muamley mein se kisi ka waali ho aur un par mushkil karey to us par mushkil farma. Aur jo meri ummat key muamley mein se kisi ka waali ho aur unkey sath narmi karey to uskey sath narmi farma. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"655","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bani Israeel ki siyaasat Nabi kartey they. Jab Nabi halaak hota to Nabi uska khalifa hota. Aur beshak merey baad koi Nabi nahi hai aur merey baad khalifa hongey aur bahut hongey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To tum hamein kya hukm detey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Pehley pehley ki baiyat poori karo. Phir unhey unka haq do. Aur Allah se maango jo tumharey liye hai. Kyonke Allah un se poochheyga jiska us ne unhey nigehbaan banaaya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"656","Aa'iz bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Ubaidullah bin Ziyaad key paas dakhil huey. To us se kaha: Ae merey betey! Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak badtareen charwaahey zulm karne waley hain. Isliye bacho ke tum un mein se ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"657","Abu Maryam Azdi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jisey Allah Musalmanon key umoor mein se kuchh ka waali banaey. Phir wo unki haajat aur kami aur faqr key saamney parda kar ley to Allah qayamat key din uski haajat aur kami aur faqr key saamney parda kar leyga. To Muawiya ne logon ki haajaton par aadmi banaaya. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"658","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saat hain jinhey Allah apne saaye mein saaya dega jis din uskey saaye key siwa koi saaya nahi hoga: Insaaf karne wala, aur jawaan jo Allah Taala ki ibaadat mein bada hua. Aur aadmi jiska dil masaajid key sath laga hua hai. Aur do aadmi jinhon-ne Allah mein mohabbat ki, us par jama huey aur us par judaa huey. Aur aadmi jisey martabey aur jamaal wali aurat ne bulaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak main Allah se darta hun. Aur aadmi jis ne sadqa key sath sadqa kya aur usey chhupaya yahan tak ke uska baayaan haath nahi jaanta ke uska daayaan haath kya kharch karta hai. Aur aadmi jis ne Allah ko tanhai mein yaad kya aur uski donon aankhein beh padhein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"659","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak insaaf karne waley Allah key paas noor key mimbaron par hongey: Wo jo apne faisley aur apne ghar walon mein aur jo unhey diya gaya hai insaaf kartey hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"660","Auf bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tumharey behtreen imaam wo hain jin se tum mohabbat kartey ho aur wo tum se mohabbat kartey hain. Aur tum un par durood bhejtey ho aur wo tum par durood bhejtey hain. Aur tumharey burey imaam wo hain jin se tum bughz rakhtey ho aur wo tum se bughz rakhtey hain. Aur tum un par laanat kartey ho aur wo tum par laanat kartey hain! Unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham un se muqaabla na karein? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, jab tak wo tum mein namaz qaim karein. Nahi, jab tak wo tum mein namaz qaim karein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"661","Iyaaz bin Himaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jannat waley teen hain: Insaaf karne wala taufeeq paaney wala sultaan. Aur aadmi jo rehem karne wala hai aur har qareebi aur Musalman key liye narm dil hai. Aur paakdaaman jo ghar walon wala hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"662","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman aadmi par sun-na aur itaat karna hai jo wo pasand karey aur napasand karey. Siwaey iskey ke usey nafarmaani ka hukm diya jaey. Phir jab usey nafarmaani ka hukm diya jaey to sun-na aur na itaat karna hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"663","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sun-ney aur itaat karne par baiyat kartey they to Aap ham se farmatey they: Jitni tum taqat rakho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"664","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo itaat se haath kheench ley to qayamat key din Allah se milega jabke uskey paas hujjat nahi hogi. Aur jo mar jaey jabke uski gardan mein baiyat nahi hai to wo jaahiliyat ki maut marega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Aur jo mar jaey jabke wo jamaat se judaa honay wala hai to wo jaahiliyat ki maut marega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Aur jo mar jaey jabke wo jamaat se judaa honay wala hai to wo jaahiliyat ki maut marega."
"665","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Suno aur itaat karo, chaahey tum par Habshi ghulaam aamil ho jiska sar kishmish ki tarah ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"666","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par sun-na aur itaat karna hai apni tangi aur kushadgi mein, aur apni chusti aur susti mein, aur tum par tarjeeh mein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"667","Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they. To ham manzil mein utrey. To ham mein se koi apna khema durust karta tha. Aur ham mein se koi teer andaazi karta tha. Aur ham mein se koi apne jaanwaron mein tha. Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key munadi ne pukaara: Jama karne wali namaz. To ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jama huey. To farmaya: Beshak mujh se pehley koi Nabi nahi tha magar us par haq tha ke wo apni ummat ko us bhalai ki rahnumai karey jo wo unkey liye jaanta hai. Aur unhey us shar se daraey jo wo unkey liye jaanta hai. Aur beshak tumhari ye ummat uski aaqibat uskey awwal mein rakhi gai hai. Aur uskey aakhir ko aazmaaish pahunchegi aur muamlaat jinka tum inkaar karogey. Aur fitney aaengey jinka baaz baaz ko narm karega. Aur fitna aayega aur momin kaheyga: Ye meri halaakat hai. Phir wo khul jaeyga. Aur fitna aayega aur momin kaheyga: Ye ye hai. Phir jo chahta hai ke usey dozakh se door kya jaey aur Jannat mein dakhil kya jaey to uski maut usey is haal mein aey ke wo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta ho. Aur logon key paas wo ley kar aey jo wo pasand karta hai ke uskey paas laaya jaey. Aur jo imam se baiyat karey aur usey apne haath ka sauda aur apne dil ka phal dey to uski itaat karey jitna ho sakey. Phir agar doosra aey aur us se jhagda karey to doosrey ki gardan maar do. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul yantazilu yaani: Teer aur kamaan key sath muqaabla karta hai. Waljashr jeem aur sheen muqta muqta key fatha aur ra key sath hai: Aur wo jaanwar hain jo chartey hain aur apni jagah raat guzaartey hain. Aur uska qaul yuraqqiqu baazaha baazan yaani: Baaz ko baaz key sabab narm karta hai, yaani: Uskey baad jo hai uski azmat key liye halka. Aur kaha gaya: Iskey maana hain: Baaz ko baaz ki taraf achchha karke aur aaraasta karke shauq dilaata hai. Aur kaha gaya: Baaz baaz key mushabeh hota hai."
"668","Abu Hunaida Waa'il bin Hujr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Salama bin Yazeed Joafi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Batao agar ham par ameer qaim hon jo ham se apna haq maangein, aur hamara haq hamein na dein, to tum hamein kya hukm detey ho? To Aap ne us se munh phera. Phir us ne poochha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Suno aur itaat karo. Kyonke un par hai jo unhon-ne uthaaya hai, aur tum par hai jo tum ne uthaaya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"669","Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak merey baad tarjeeh hogi, aur muamlaat jinka tum inkaar karogey! Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Jo ham mein se usey paey wo kaisey hukm karey? Aap ne farmaya: Tum wo haq ada karogey jo tum par hai, aur Allah se maangogey jo tumharey liye hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"670","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo meri itaat karey to us ne Allah ki itaat ki. Aur jo meri nafarmaani karey to us ne Allah ki nafarmaani ki. Aur jo ameer ki itaat karey to us ne meri itaat ki. Aur jo ameer ki nafarmaani karey to us ne meri nafarmaani ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"671","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ameer mein se koi chiz napasand karey to sabr karey. Kyonke jo sultaan se baalisht bhar nikla wo jaahiliyat ki maut marega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"672","Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo sultaan ko zaleel karey to Allah usey zaleel farmayega. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur is baab mein Sahih mein bahut si ahadis hain. Aur baaz guzar chuki hain darwaazon mein."
"673","Abu Saeed Abdur Rahman bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abdur Rahman bin Samura! Imaarat na maango. Kyonke agar tum usey maangney key baghair diye gaey to us par tumhari madad ki jaeygi. Aur agar tum usey maangney key sabab diye gaey to uskey supurd kiye jaogey. Aur jab tum qasam khao aur uskey siwa ko us se behtar dekho to jo behtar hai usey karo, aur apni qasam ka kaffara do. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"674","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Beshak main tumhey kamzor dekhta hun. Aur beshak main tumharey liye wahi pasand karta hun jo apne liye pasand karta hun. Do par ameer na bano aur na yateem key maal ka waali bano. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"675","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhey aamil nahi banaogey? To Aap ne apne haath key sath merey kandhey par maara, phir farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Beshak tum kamzor ho. Aur beshak wo amaanat hai. Aur beshak wo qayamat key din ruswai aur nadaamat hai. Siwaey uskey jo usey uskey haq key sath ley, aur jo us mein us par hai ada karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"676","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum anqareeb imaarat par harees hogey. Aur wo qayamat key din nadaamat hogi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"677","Abu Saeed aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja, aur na koi khalifa muqarrar kya magar uskey liye do dost they: Dost jo usey bhalai ka hukm deta hai aur us par ubhaarta hai. Aur dost jo usey shar ka hukm deta hai aur us par ubhaarta hai. Aur masoom wo hai jisey Allah bachaey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"678","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah ameer key sath bhalai ka irada farmata hai to uskey liye sachey wazeer banaata hai. Agar wo bhooley to usey yaad dilaata hai. Aur agar yaad karey to uski madad karta hai. Aur jab uskey sath uskey siwa ka irada farmata hai to uskey liye burey wazeer banaata hai. Agar wo bhooley to usey yaad nahi dilaata. Aur jab yaad karey to uski madad nahi karta. Ise Abu Dawud ne Muslim ki shart par jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"679","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas dakhil hua jabke merey sath merey chacha key do betey they. To un mein se aik ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamein us par aamil banaein jo Allah Azza wa Jall ne tumhey diya hai. Aur doosrey ne usi tarah kaha. To farmaya: Beshak ham Allah ki qasam is kaam ka waali usey nahi banaatey jo usey maangey, ya jo us par harees ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
